{"id": "0", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a pink suit gives a speech at a podium while a crowd claps in applause.", "pred": "Severely corrupted horizontal glitch bars in brown/black/beige are visible while a male voice speaks over loud, rapid audience applause.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely corrupted horizontal glitch bars in brown/black/beige are visible while a male voice speaks over loud, rapid audience applause.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, appearing as a series of horizontal, glitchy, and fragmented bars in dark brown, black, and beige tones, with no discernible coherent image; simultaneously, a male voice speaks while loud, rapid applause from a crowd is heard.\n\\boxed{Severely corrupted horizontal glitch bars in brown/black/beige are visible while a male voice speaks over loud, rapid audience applause.}\nThe audio contains a clear male voice speaking over prominent, rhythmic audience applause, suggesting a live performance or presentation. The video shows no corresponding visual of a speaker or audience; instead, it is composed entirely of abstract, horizontal bands of distorted color and light. The corruption is consistent across the frame, indicating a technical failure in the video signal rather than a dynamic scene. The two modalities are temporally synchronized but spatially and semantically unrelated.\n\nSeverely corrupted horizontal glitch bars in brown/black/beige are visible while a male voice speaks over loud, rapid audience applause.", "time_sec": 221.873, "generation_time_seconds": 181.7439, "selection_time_seconds": 11.3669, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "1", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The wind whispers through the leaves as a leaf blower hums, while a black snake slithers in the grass near a tree.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented green and black vertical and horizontal bars is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine and a rhythmic, heavy thudding sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented green and black vertical and horizontal bars is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine and a rhythmic, heavy thudding sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of green and black vertical and horizontal shapes, accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine.\nThe visual is a non-representational, pixelated pattern of fragmented vertical and horizontal bars in green, black, and brown hues, with the audio consisting of a deep, constant engine rumble and distinct, heavy thudding impacts.\nThe visual stream consists of a rapidly changing, fragmented grid of horizontal and vertical bars in green, black, and brown, with some sections exhibiting a pixelated texture; the audio is a persistent low-frequency engine rumble overlaid with a rhythmic, heavy thudding sound.\n\nA rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented green and black vertical and horizontal bars is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine and a rhythmic, heavy thudding sound.", "time_sec": 162.643, "generation_time_seconds": 160.6736, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0367, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "2", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman speaks softly as water splashes and trickles and she sitting on a large rock in the middle of a lake .", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated landscape of a sky and water is accompanied by a man speaking in Russian about recharging at an energetic, sacred place, with the sound of flowing water.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated landscape of a sky and water is accompanied by a man speaking in Russian about recharging at an energetic, sacred place, with the sound of flowing water.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, pixelated, and blocky image of a bright, overcast sky above a body of water, with indistinct shapes resembling trees or buildings in the distance. The audio consists of a man speaking in Russian, describing a place as \"energetic\" and a \"sacred place\" where he recharges his energy, accompanied by the continuous sound of flowing water.\nThe video shows a pixelated, corrupted landscape of a cloudy sky above water, while a man speaks in Russian about a sacred, energetic place where he and another person recharge their energy, with the ambient sound of flowing water.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated landscape of a sky and water is accompanied by a man speaking in Russian about recharging at an energetic, sacred place, with the sound of flowing water.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated landscape of a sky and water is accompanied by a man speaking in Russian about recharging at an energetic, sacred place, with the sound of flowing water.}}", "time_sec": 185.338, "generation_time_seconds": 183.9888, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0387, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "3", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen, a man  with a glass of water in hand opens the door of a refrigerator, speaking amidst rattling and banging with a high frequency ringing.", "pred": "The video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.\nThe video shows severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.\nThe video shows severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating fragmented, shifting bands of light and dark colors, while the audio captures a person speaking followed by the sound of a glass object being placed on a hard surface.", "time_sec": 164.25, "generation_time_seconds": 162.9333, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0393, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "4", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a tiled bathroom, a person lifts the toilet lid as tapping noises are heard, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, pixelated video shows a tiled surface as a toilet flushes, accompanied by the tank refilling and a final electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, pixelated video shows a tiled surface as a toilet flushes, accompanied by the tank refilling and a final electronic tone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, pixelated image of what appears to be a tiled surface, while the audio captures the sequence of a toilet being flushed, including the sound of the tank refilling and the powerful rush of water.\n\\boxed{A heavily distorted, pixelated video shows a tiled surface as a toilet flushes, accompanied by the tank refilling and a final electronic tone.}\nThe visual data shows severe horizontal line distortion and pixelation, rendering the scene unrecognizable beyond a pattern of light and dark bands on a brownish background, suggesting a compromised video signal.\n\\boxed{A heavily distorted, pixelated video shows a tiled surface as a toilet flushes, accompanied by the tank refilling and a final electronic tone.}\n\nA heavily distorted, pixelated video shows a tiled surface as a toilet flushes, accompanied by the tank refilling and a final electronic tone.", "time_sec": 223.768, "generation_time_seconds": 221.8867, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0421, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "5", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person in white gloves pours orange liquid from a plastic bottle while a series of compressed air sprays and a motor hums in the background.", "pred": "The video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal color bands and blocky artifacts, while the audio features a continuous low hum and intermittent high-pitched scraping sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal color bands and blocky artifacts, while the audio features a continuous low hum and intermittent high-pitched scraping sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital distortion, including horizontal color banding, pixelation, and blocky artifacts, while the audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency hum punctuated by intermittent, high-pitched scraping or grinding sounds.\nThe visual shows severe digital corruption with fragmented, shifting horizontal color bands, grayscale textures, and distorted red patterns, while the audio features a constant low-level hum and rhythmic, abrasive scraping noises, suggesting a malfunctioning electronic device or corrupted data stream.\nThe video stream is corrupted with horizontal lines of static, color distortion, and mosaic-like blocks, while the audio contains a low, steady electronic hum and a series of sharp, rhythmic, high-pitched scraping sounds.\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal color bands and blocky artifacts, while the audio features a continuous low hum and intermittent high-pitched scraping sounds.", "time_sec": 129.1, "generation_time_seconds": 127.4818, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1009, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "6", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The tribal drums beat as a green frog sits in a natural environment, surrounded by the sounds of shuffling footsteps, chirping crickets, and wet dirt.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, glitched landscape is accompanied by the sound of a film projector advancing, which stops and is replaced by a continuous electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, glitched landscape is accompanied by the sound of a film projector advancing, which stops and is replaced by a continuous electronic tone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched landscape composed of fragmented, pixelated tiles of what appears to be grass, water, and sky, creating a mosaic effect. Overlaid on this visual is the audio of a series of distinct, rapid, and rhythmic clicking sounds, characteristic of a film projector advancing frames. After a brief pause, the clicking ceases and is replaced by a continuous, high-pitched electronic tone. The juxtaposition of the faulty, fragmented visual with the sounds of a projector and a tone suggests a malfunctioning audiovisual playback system. The final answer is:\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, glitched landscape is accompanied by the sound of a film projector advancing, which stops and is replaced by a continuous electronic tone.}}\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched landscape composed of fragmented, pixelated tiles of what appears to be grass, water, and sky, creating a mosaic effect. Overlaid on this visual is the audio of a series of distinct, rapid, and rhythmic clicking sounds, characteristic of a film projector advancing frames. After a brief pause, the clicking ceases and is replaced by a continuous, high-pitched electronic tone. The juxtaposition of the faulty, fragmented visual with the sounds of a projector and a tone suggests a malfunctioning audiovisual playback system. The final answer is:\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixel\n\nA heavily pixelated, glitched landscape is accompanied by the sound of a film projector advancing, which stops and is replaced by a continuous electronic tone.", "time_sec": 227.827, "generation_time_seconds": 226.4572, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0447, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "7", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small dog sitting in a basket with a leash on the floor, accompanied by the sound of a person snoring.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The visual is a heavily distorted, low-resolution, fragmented image; the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The visual is a heavily distorted, low-resolution, fragmented image; the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video is a glitched, low-resolution feed of a dark, blurry scene with horizontal bands of red and white. The audio is a continuous, low-frequency electronic buzz with a distinct, rhythmic pulsing or throbbing quality.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, low-resolution, and fragmented image composed of dark horizontal bands; the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz with a pulsating quality.\n\\boxed{\\text{The visual is a heavily distorted, low-resolution, fragmented image; the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz.}}\nThe visual presents as a heavily distorted, low-resolution, fragmented image composed of dark horizontal bands, with some sections showing indistinct red and white patterns. Concurrently, the auditory stream consists of a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz exhibiting a pulsating or throbbing characteristic.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The visual is a heavily distorted, low-resolution, fragmented image; the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 175.069, "generation_time_seconds": 173.6191, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1266, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "8", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and blue helicopter landing on a runway as a small plane sits nearby.and some poles are visible.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital compression artifacts form a mosaic of shifting colored blocks on a hazy blue background, accompanied by a loud, continuous mechanical rumbling and whirring sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital compression artifacts form a mosaic of shifting colored blocks on a hazy blue background, accompanied by a loud, continuous mechanical rumbling and whirring sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital compression artifacts, presenting as a mosaic of scrambled, shifting rectangular blocks of color (red, white, blue, green, grey) and abstract patterns against a hazy, light blue background, with no discernible coherent scene; simultaneously, the audio features a continuous, loud, low-frequency mechanical rumbling and whirring sound, characteristic of a large, powerful engine or heavy machinery operating at high speed.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital compression artifacts form a mosaic of shifting colored blocks on a hazy blue background, accompanied by a loud, continuous mechanical rumbling and whirring sound.}}\nThe visual analysis reveals a scene dominated by severe digital compression artifacts, resulting in a fragmented and distorted image composed of numerous shifting rectangular blocks of various colors, primarily red, white, blue, and green, arranged in a grid-like, mosaic pattern over a hazy light blue background. This visual is completely divorced from the auditory information, which consists of a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumbling and whirring sound, suggesting the operation of a large engine or heavy machinery. The two modalities are independent, and no coherent scene can be reconstructed from the visual alone. The audio provides no information about the source of the visual artifacts\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital compression artifacts form a mosaic of shifting colored blocks on a hazy blue background, accompanied by a loud, continuous mechanical rumbling and whirring sound.}}", "time_sec": 223.865, "generation_time_seconds": 222.1089, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0363, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "9", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring helicopter flies low over a building in the windy cityscape. and one man also visible.", "pred": "A loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA massive, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzz fills the audio, creating a tense atmosphere. Simultaneously, the video displays a fragmented, glitching image of a modern building with glass and concrete, set against a dark, indistinct background. The image is heavily distorted with horizontal static lines, suggesting a severe digital corruption or transmission error. Despite the visual confusion, the primary subject of the audio is the overwhelming, continuous, and grating electronic sound. The final answer is \\boxed{A loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.}\nThe audio consists of a single, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzz that is continuous and grating. The visual is a heavily distorted video of a modern building, possibly made of glass, with a dark and indistinct background. The image is fragmented into horizontal bands, resembling a severe digital glitch or corrupted signal. The scene is static, with no discernible movement or action. The final answer is \\boxed{A loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.}\nThe audio is a single, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzz, indicating a continuous and grating sound. The visual is a heavily distorted video of a modern building, possibly made of glass, with a dark and indistinct background. The image is fragmented into horizontal bands, resembling a severe digital glitch or corrupted signal. The scene is static, with no discernible movement or action. The final answer is \\boxed{A loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.}\n\nA loud, low-frequency electronic buzz plays over a glitching, fragmented video of a modern building.", "time_sec": 199.324, "generation_time_seconds": 197.1334, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0355, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "10", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the sun sets, a very long train passes by with warning bells ringing and a honking horn.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated and corrupted urban scene is paired with the sound of a train's screeching brakes and rhythmic clatter on tracks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated and corrupted urban scene is paired with the sound of a train's screeching brakes and rhythmic clatter on tracks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted image, showing fragmented, pixelated, and distorted patches of what appears to be an urban environment with buildings, but no clear, coherent visual scene can be discerned. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, metallic screeching sound, characteristic of train brakes, which then transitions into the rhythmic clattering of wheels on railway tracks as a train moves past.\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated and corrupted urban scene is paired with the sound of a train's screeching brakes and rhythmic clatter on tracks.}\nThe visual stream is a composite of disjointed, corrupted image fragments, predominantly featuring dark geometric shapes and light-colored horizontal lines suggestive of building architecture, rendered in a glitch-art style with no discernible action. The audio stream is clear and distinct, featuring a high-frequency, metallic screech that rapidly fades into a lower-frequency, rhythmic clatter, consistent with a railway vehicle's wheels moving over jointed tracks. These two modalities are unrelated in content, as the audio describes a train in motion while the visual is an abstract, static digital artifact.\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated and corrupted urban scene is paired with the\n\nA heavily pixelated and corrupted urban scene is paired with the sound of a train's screeching brakes and rhythmic clatter on tracks.", "time_sec": 293.475, "generation_time_seconds": 291.3666, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0486, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "11", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A train horn blares, and a train passes by a road with a red traffic light and a gate with a sign.", "pred": "A pixelated, mosaic-like view of a railway crossing with flashing red lights and lowered barriers is accompanied by the sound of a train's horn and its engine passing by.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A pixelated, mosaic-like view of a railway crossing with flashing red lights and lowered barriers is accompanied by the sound of a train's horn and its engine passing by.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA digitally corrupted, mosaic-like view of a railway crossing shows red-and-white barriers, a flashing light, and a countdown timer, while a train horn sounds and a train approaches and passes.\n\\boxed{\\text{A corrupted visual of a railway crossing with flashing lights and barriers is accompanied by the sound of a train horn and a passing train.}}\nThe visual is a heavily pixelated and fragmented composite of multiple images, creating a mosaic effect. Within this, distinct elements of a railway crossing are discernible, including red and white striped barrier arms in various positions, what appear to be red signal lights, and a white sign with a black digital countdown timer showing '00:00'. The background consists of green foliage and what looks like a paved road with white painted lines. The audio begins with the low, rhythmic chugging of a large engine, followed by a single, sustained, low-pitched horn blast, and then the sound of the vehicle moving past at high\n\nA pixelated, mosaic-like view of a railway crossing with flashing red lights and lowered barriers is accompanied by the sound of a train's horn and its engine passing by.", "time_sec": 201.687, "generation_time_seconds": 199.4407, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0402, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "12", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The roaring engine of an orange car fills the air as firefighters , creating a dramatic scene.", "pred": "A violently loud, high-pitched engine roars and accelerates, causing severe digital clipping and distortion, while the visual is a chaotic, abstract mosaic of heavily pixelated and fragmented horizontal and vertical bars.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A violently loud, high-pitched engine roars and accelerates, causing severe digital clipping and distortion, while the visual is a chaotic, abstract mosaic of heavily pixelated and fragmented horizontal and vertical bars.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAn extremely loud, high-pitched engine revs and accelerates to a deafening roar, causing severe digital distortion and extreme pixelation in the visual stream.\nThe recording is overwhelmed by a deafening, high-revving engine sound, which appears to be from a motorcycle or similar vehicle, producing a powerful roar and sharp accelerations, while the accompanying visual is almost entirely abstract, composed of a chaotic, distorted mosaic of fragmented horizontal and vertical blocks, heavily pixelated and corrupted.\nThe audio features a violently loud, high-pitched engine roaring and accelerating, causing severe digital clipping and distortion, while the visual is a chaotic, abstract mosaic of heavily pixelated and fragmented horizontal and vertical bars.\n\nA violently loud, high-pitched engine roars and accelerates, causing severe digital clipping and distortion, while the visual is a chaotic, abstract mosaic of heavily pixelated and fragmented horizontal and vertical bars.", "time_sec": 157.047, "generation_time_seconds": 155.3911, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0446, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "13", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A small frog sits in the leaves of a green bush at night, surrounded by the soothing sounds of frogs and crickets chirping and croaking.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{An abstract, glitch-art mosaic of green and black fragmented horizontal stripes is paired with a series of rapid, high-pitched, staccato yelps resembling a jackal or fox.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{An abstract, glitch-art mosaic of green and black fragmented horizontal stripes is paired with a series of rapid, high-pitched, staccato yelps resembling a jackal or fox.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a complex, abstract pattern of green, black, and grey, constructed from fragmented, distorted horizontal stripes that create a glitch-like, mosaic effect. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a series of high-pitched, rapid, staccato yelps, characteristic of a small animal like a jackal or fox, repeated in a rhythmic, almost laughing sequence. These two modalities—the static, geometric visual and the dynamic, organic animal sound—are presented as an incongruous juxtaposition with no apparent narrative or physical connection.\nThe visual is an abstract, glitch-art mosaic of green and black fragmented horizontal stripes, while the audio features a series of rapid, high-pitched, staccato yelps resembling a jackal or fox.\nThe visual is an abstract, glitch-art mosaic of green and black fragmented horizontal stripes, while the audio features a series of rapid, high-pitched, staccato yelps resembling a jackal or fox.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{An abstract, glitch-art mosaic of green and black fragmented horizontal stripes is paired with a series of rapid, high-pitched, staccato yelps resembling a jackal or fox.}}", "time_sec": 161.734, "generation_time_seconds": 159.9906, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0386, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "14", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man, humming and rustling, gives a thumbs up in front of the casino entrance and there are cars are parking.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched cityscape with fragmented horizontal bars is visible as a male voice speaks over loud static and crackling.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched cityscape with fragmented horizontal bars is visible as a male voice speaks over loud static and crackling.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched image of a city street with fragmented horizontal bars, showing distorted buildings, traffic lights, and a road, while the audio consists of a male voice speaking over prominent static and crackling noise.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched cityscape with fragmented horizontal bars is visible as a male voice speaks over loud static and crackling.}}\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched image of a city street with fragmented horizontal bars, showing distorted buildings, traffic lights, and a road, while the audio consists of a male voice speaking over prominent static and crackling noise.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched cityscape with fragmented horizontal bars is visible as a male voice speaks over loud static and crackling.}}", "time_sec": 196.204, "generation_time_seconds": 194.649, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0391, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "15", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a snowy parking lot, the sound of a truck engine revving mixes with honking horns as people talk, while vehicles drive.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual of horizontal scan lines and fragmented patterns accompanies the low rumble and subsequent honking of a large vehicle's air horn.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual of horizontal scan lines and fragmented patterns accompanies the low rumble and subsequent honking of a large vehicle's air horn.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, glitched image composed of horizontal scan lines and fragmented, repeating patterns, making specific subjects indiscernible. Simultaneously, the audio captures the low rumble of a large diesel engine, followed by the distinct honking of a large vehicle's air horn. The sounds strongly suggest the recording was made from the interior of a truck or bus.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual of horizontal scan lines and fragmented patterns accompanies the low rumble and subsequent honking of a large vehicle's air horn.}}\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, glitched image composed of horizontal scan lines and fragmented, repeating patterns, making specific subjects indiscernible. Simultaneously, the audio captures the low rumble of a large diesel engine, followed by the distinct honking of a large vehicle's air horn. The sounds strongly suggest the recording was made from the interior of a truck or bus.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual of horizontal scan lines and fragmented patterns accompanies the low rumble and subsequent honking of a large vehicle's air horn.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual of horizontal scan lines and fragmented patterns accompanies the low rumble and subsequent honking of a large vehicle's air horn.}}", "time_sec": 211.824, "generation_time_seconds": 210.4056, "selection_time_seconds": 0.041, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "16", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a sewing machine as a person stitches fabric.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented image with horizontal bands of indistinct shapes and colors, primarily light gray, white, and brown, making specific objects unidentifiable. The audio consists of a continuous sequence of loud, sharp, metallic clanking and rattling sounds, with a prominent, repetitive, high-pitched squeak, suggesting the operation of an old, rusted metal mechanism like a gate or a rollercoaster car on a track. The sounds are mechanical, harsh, and rhythmic, and there are no voices or music present.\nA heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented image with horizontal bands of indistinct shapes and colors, primarily light gray, white, and brown, making specific objects unidentifiable. The audio consists of a continuous sequence of loud, sharp, metallic clanking and rattling sounds, with a prominent, repetitive, high-pitched squeak, suggesting the operation of an old, rusted metal mechanism like a gate or a rollercoaster car on a track. The sounds are mechanical, harsh, and rhythmic, and there are no voices or music present.\n\nA heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated visual of indistinct horizontal bands is accompanied by the harsh, rhythmic metallic clanking and rattling of an old, rusted mechanical mechanism.}}", "time_sec": 192.39, "generation_time_seconds": 190.8084, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3344, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "17", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man discusses as footsteps crunch on dirt and gravel, and birds chirp, while a pile of food and bags, a bag of trash, and other litter lay scattered on the ground.", "pred": "The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful patterns and textures, including distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful patterns and textures, including distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful, abstract patterns, textures, and distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful, abstract patterns, textures, and distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.\nThe video shows a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful patterns and textures, including distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful patterns and textures, including distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.}}\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of colorful patterns and textures, including distorted text, while the audio features a male voice discussing the comparative effectiveness of \"late spring\" and \"early spring\" weed killers.", "time_sec": 183.335, "generation_time_seconds": 181.4012, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0334, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
