 text, while the audio captures the sound of a person sniffling and a man speaking in Spanish.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily distorted, horizontally-streaked image with a palette of pink, brown,\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, horizontally-scrambled image with a color palette of pink, brown, and black, overlaid with fragmented white text, while the audio captures the sound of a person sniffling followed by a man speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 272.317, "generation_time_seconds": 270.5425, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0452, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "19", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a blurry room, a man shouts before and after a person belches loudly, while a young woman in a black kitchen smiles by a plate of food with meat and onions.", "pred": "A male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\nA male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\nThe speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\nA male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\n\nA male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker emits a deep, guttural, and distorted voice, followed by a loud, echoing, and processed scream.}}", "time_sec": 135.439, "generation_time_seconds": 134.2086, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0398, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "20", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of sizzling steaks and ribs on the grill, accompanied by whispers and music playing through headphones.", "pred": "\\boxed{A heavily corrupted digital video displays glitched horizontal bars of fragmented text and geometric shapes in blue, purple, and green against a black background, accompanied by the sound of a person coughing followed by a loud, sustained burst of static.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A heavily corrupted digital video displays glitched horizontal bars of fragmented text and geometric shapes in blue, purple, and green against a black background, accompanied by the sound of a person coughing followed by a loud, sustained burst of static.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA heavily corrupted digital video displays glitched horizontal bars of fragmented text and geometric shapes in blue, purple, and green against a black background, accompanied by the sound of a person coughing followed by a loud, sustained burst of static.\nThe audio begins with a male cough, followed by an abrupt transition to an extremely loud, high-pitched, and sustained electronic sound resembling static or white noise that persists until the end.\nThe video is a heavily corrupted digital file displaying fragmented, glitched horizontal bars of distorted imagery and text in blue, purple, green, and orange against a black background, while the audio consists of a single male cough followed by a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic static noise.\n\n\\boxed{A heavily corrupted digital video displays glitched horizontal bars of fragmented text and geometric shapes in blue, purple, and green against a black background, accompanied by the sound of a person coughing followed by a loud, sustained burst of static.}", "time_sec": 221.242, "generation_time_seconds": 219.8323, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0384, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "21", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The digital beep is followed by a man speaking in this screenshot of a website.", "pred": "A software interface with a blue header, a data grid, and a table of text and numbers is shown, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data from a web server in AngularJS.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A software interface with a blue header, a data grid, and a table of text and numbers is shown, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data from a web server in AngularJS.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\nThe screen displays a software interface with a blue header, a grid of data, and a table containing rows of text and numerical values in a structured layout, while a male voice narrates instructions related to loading data from a web server in AngularJS.\nThe screen displays a software interface with a blue header, a grid of data, and a table containing rows of text and numerical values in a structured layout, while a male voice narrates instructions related to loading data from a web server in AngularJS.\n\nA software interface with a blue header, a data grid, and a table of text and numbers is shown, while a male voice narrates instructions for loading data from a web server in AngularJS.", "time_sec": 152.666, "generation_time_seconds": 151.0351, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0339, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "22", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman and another woman chat as a goat baaing is heard, while a black and white kid  is held on a white towel by a person.", "pred": "A heavily glitched, abstract visual of fragmented horizontal bands is paired with a male voice saying \"Come on\" and the bleating of a goat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily glitched, abstract visual of fragmented horizontal bands is paired with a male voice saying \"Come on\" and the bleating of a goat.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and glitched visual field, composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bands of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors, while the audio consists of a male voice speaking, followed by the sound of a goat bleating.\nThe visual is a chaotic mosaic of fragmented, horizontally-striated panels showing abstract, non-representational textures in muted tones like beige, grey, and black, with no discernible objects or setting. The audio contains a male voice saying \"Come on,\" followed by a clear bleating sound characteristic of a goat or sheep, all set against a faint background hum. The scenes are unrelated, with no visual of a goat present in the glitched imagery.\n\nA heavily glitched, abstract visual of fragmented horizontal bands is paired with a male voice saying \"Come on\" and the bleating of a goat.", "time_sec": 179.776, "generation_time_seconds": 178.2337, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0381, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "23", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman delivers a speech at an event, standing at a podium with a microphone in front of a flag.", "pred": "\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with horizontal color bands and static overlays a man with a Southern accent stating he is a hillbilly from East Tennessee who appeared on TV.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with horizontal color bands and static overlays a man with a Southern accent stating he is a hillbilly from East Tennessee who appeared on TV.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal scan lines, blocky artifacts, and color shifting between blue, red, and white. The audio features a man with a Southern American accent speaking over a persistent static hiss.\nThe video shows severe digital distortion with horizontal color bands and static, while the audio contains a man with a Southern accent stating he is a hillbilly from East Tennessee who appeared on TV.\nThe video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal scan lines, blocky artifacts, and color shifting between blue, red, and white. The audio features a man with a Southern American accent speaking over a persistent static hiss.\nThe video shows severe digital distortion with horizontal color bands and static, while the audio contains a man with a Southern accent stating he is a hillbilly from East Tennessee who appeared on TV.\n\n\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with horizontal color bands and static overlays a man with a Southern accent stating he is a hillbilly from East Tennessee who appeared on TV.}", "time_sec": 142.169, "generation_time_seconds": 140.6217, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1175, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "24", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorbike engine purrs softly as it sits on display, showcasing its intricate details up close.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted, pixelated collage of abstract geometric shapes and diagonal stripes overlays the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large mechanical engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted, pixelated collage of abstract geometric shapes and diagonal stripes overlays the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large mechanical engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a complex, fragmented mosaic of abstract shapes, colors, and textures, including repeating patterns resembling circuit boards, diagonal stripes, and grid-like structures in shades of orange, red, black, white, and gray, with some sections appearing blurred or in motion. Overlaid on this static, glitchy visual is the loud, rhythmic, and powerful chugging sound of a large, heavy-duty mechanical engine, possibly a steam engine or a large pump, operating at a steady, forceful pace.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes, including diagonal stripes, grids, and blurred patterns in orange, black, and white, while the audio is the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large mechanical engine.\nThe image is a heavily corrupted, pixelated, and fragmented collage composed of abstract geometric shapes, including diagonal red and white stripes, black and white grids, and irregular color blocks. The audio consists of the loud, powerful, and rhythmic chugging of a large, heavy-duty engine, likely a steam engine or a massive pump in operation.\n\nA heavily corrupted, pixelated collage of abstract geometric shapes and diagonal stripes overlays the loud, rhythmic chugging of a large mechanical engine.", "time_sec": 154.893, "generation_time_seconds": 153.1074, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0411, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "25", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling studio, the sound of aluminum cans clanking and compressed air spraying mingles with the gentle rattling of plastic as artists work on their paintings of various subjects.", "pred": "A distorted, glitching video of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors is accompanied by the sharp sound of a metallic impact followed by rustling and crinkling.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A distorted, glitching video of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors is accompanied by the sharp sound of a metallic impact followed by rustling and crinkling.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image with fragmented horizontal bars of abstract colors, shapes, and patterns, while the audio consists of a sequence of sharp metallic impacts followed by the sound of a crinkling plastic bag.\nA distorted, glitching video of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors is accompanied by the sharp sound of a metallic impact followed by rustling and crinkling.\nThe video is a mosaic of rapidly shifting, abstract horizontal bands of color and distorted patterns, while the audio features a loud metallic clang, the continuous crinkling of a plastic bag, and a second, similar metallic impact.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching video of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors is accompanied by the sharp sound of a metallic impact followed by rustling and crinkling.}}\n\nA distorted, glitching video of fragmented, abstract shapes and colors is accompanied by the sharp sound of a metallic impact followed by rustling and crinkling.", "time_sec": 177.14, "generation_time_seconds": 175.1995, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0377, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "26", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The eerie sound of a beep is accompanied by retching and muffled speech, as a young child in a stroller holds a blanket .", "pred": "\\boxed{Abstract, glitching horizontal color bars in red, white, and black are accompanied by distorted, guttural monster sounds and a final high-pitched electronic beep.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Abstract, glitching horizontal color bars in red, white, and black are accompanied by distorted, guttural monster sounds and a final high-pitched electronic beep.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video consists of a series of rapidly changing, abstract, and pixelated horizontal bars of color, primarily red, white, black, and grey, that shift and morph across the screen in a glitch-like or corrupted data stream. This visual is accompanied by a sequence of distorted, low-pitched, guttural, and monstrous growls or roars, followed by a single, clear, high-pitched electronic beep.\n\\boxed{Abstract, glitching horizontal color bars in red, white, and black are accompanied by distorted, guttural monster sounds and a final high-pitched electronic beep.}\nThe audio features a sequence of guttural, monstrous sounds, specifically a deep growl, a high-pitched screech, and a lower groan, which are then followed by a single, clear, high-pitched electronic beep. The visual consists of a rapidly changing, abstract, and pixelated horizontal bar pattern, primarily in shades of red, white, and black, that shifts and morphs across the screen, resembling corrupted data or a video signal error. The two modalities are independent but synchronized, creating a jarring and unsettling sensory experience.\n\n\\boxed{Abstract, glitching horizontal color bars in red, white, and black are accompanied by distorted, guttural monster sounds and a final high-pitched electronic beep.}", "time_sec": 181.471, "generation_time_seconds": 180.0021, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0456, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "27", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black crow perched in a cage with a yellow cup, chirping as it strikes the bars.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, pixelated green and black abstract image is accompanied by a sequence of sharp electronic beeps and chirps layered over a low hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, pixelated green and black abstract image is accompanied by a sequence of sharp electronic beeps and chirps layered over a low hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated abstract composition dominated by green and black hues, with no discernible objects or actions, while the audio consists of a sequence of sharp, high-pitched electronic beeps and chirps layered over a low, continuous hum.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, abstract green and black pixelated visual is accompanied by sharp electronic beeps and a low hum.}}\nThe visual is an abstract, glitch-art style image composed of numerous horizontal and vertical bars, blocks, and pixels. The dominant colors are various shades of green, ranging from lime to dark forest green, interspersed with black and some very faint yellowish-green areas. The entire image is fragmented and distorted, with parts of the pattern appearing to be mirrored or shifted, creating a mosaic-like effect. The overall impression is of a digital signal malfunction or a heavily processed, non-representational image. The audio consists of a series of distinct, high-pitched electronic tones. The sequence begins with a descending whistle, followed by a rapid\n\nA heavily distorted, pixelated green and black abstract image is accompanied by a sequence of sharp electronic beeps and chirps layered over a low hum.", "time_sec": 212.15, "generation_time_seconds": 210.5545, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1078, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "28", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman and child speak as the little boy in a green shirt holds his hands to his ears while sitting on the couch.", "pred": "The video shows a series of heavily pixelated, abstract still images with distorted green, brown, and pink patterns, while the audio captures a quiet indoor conversation where an adult asks a child about their day at school.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video shows a series of heavily pixelated, abstract still images with distorted green, brown, and pink patterns, while the audio captures a quiet indoor conversation where an adult asks a child about their day at school.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual contains a series of still images that are highly pixelated and distorted, showing fragmented textures, colors, and shapes in a disorganized pattern. The audio features a casual conversation between two individuals, with one asking, \"Did you have fun day at school?\" and the other responding affirmatively, followed by a question about how much fun the day was. The dialogue suggests a personal or familial interaction, likely between a parent and child, in a quiet indoor environment. The contrast between the abstract, glitch-like visuals and the clear, conversational audio indicates a possible disconnect or intentional juxtaposition between the two modalities. No direct correlation\nThe video displays a series of heavily pixelated and fragmented still images with abstract patterns in green, brown, and pink, while the audio captures a quiet indoor conversation where an adult asks a child about their day at school.\n\\boxed{\\text{Highly pixelated, abstract still images display fragmented green, brown, and pink patterns, while an adult asks a child about their day at school.}}\nThe visual content consists of a sequence of still images with severe digital corruption; the frames are composed of large, horizontal blocks of color and texture that are misaligned and scrambled, creating a disjointed and abstract mosaic. The colors are predominantly shades of green, brown, and pink, with some hints of white and purple, but no discernible subjects or scenes can be identified. Simultaneously, the audio provides a clear, conversational exchange between a male and a female, where the male asks, \"Did you have fun day at school?\" and the female replies, \"Yeah. Yeah, how fun was your day?\" The voices\n\nThe video shows a series of heavily pixelated, abstract still images with distorted green, brown, and pink patterns, while the audio captures a quiet indoor conversation where an adult asks a child about their day at school.", "time_sec": 196.517, "generation_time_seconds": 195.1788, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0393, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "29", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A young lady in a green and red sari is speaking on a news program.", "pred": "A male voice speaks in Tamil over a low, continuous hum, as the screen is filled with a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks in Tamil over a low, continuous hum, as the screen is filled with a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in Tamil over a low, continuous, and resonant hum, while the visual field is a chaotic collage of horizontal and vertical bands and blocks of abstract, colorful, patterned textures in red, blue, green, purple, and yellow.\nA male voice speaks in Tamil over a low, continuous hum, as the screen is filled with a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice speaks in Tamil over a low hum, as the screen shows a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.}}\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in Tamil over a low, continuous, and resonant hum, while the visual field is a chaotic collage of horizontal and vertical bands and blocks of abstract, colorful, patterned textures in red, blue, green, purple, and yellow.\nA male voice speaks in Tamil over a low, continuous hum, as the screen is filled with a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice speaks in Tamil over a low hum, as the screen shows a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures\n\nA male voice speaks in Tamil over a low, continuous hum, as the screen is filled with a chaotic mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of abstract, colorful, patterned textures.", "time_sec": 210.083, "generation_time_seconds": 208.6791, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0371, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "30", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling kitchen, the sound of a machine clicking is heard as a person mixes pink cotton candy in a bowl.", "pred": "A glitched video of pink and brown horizontal bands plays with the rhythmic clatter of a moving train and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitched video of pink and brown horizontal bands plays with the rhythmic clatter of a moving train and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train on tracks, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish. The visual is a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of pink, gold, and brown, overlaid with fragmented text fragments including \"india\" and \"www.m.m\".\n\\boxed{A glitched video of pink and brown horizontal bands plays with the rhythmic clatter of a moving train and a male voice speaking in Spanish.}\nThe audio is dominated by the loud, metallic, rhythmic clatter of a mechanical object moving at speed, consistent with a train on railway tracks, and is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish.\nThe visual is a heavily degraded and fragmented image, characterized by horizontal bands of color (predominantly pink and dark brown/black) and numerous small, scattered rectangular blocks of distorted data.\nThe two modalities are unrelated, with the audio depicting a train journey and the video showing corrupted digital information.\n\nA glitched video of pink and brown horizontal bands plays with the rhythmic clatter of a moving train and a male voice speaking in Spanish.", "time_sec": 188.232, "generation_time_seconds": 185.0606, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0379, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "31", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice narrates as a man works diligently on a sewing machine at a wooden table.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted video displays abstract, pixelated shapes while a person in Spanish says, \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the sound of a cash register drawer opening and closing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted video displays abstract, pixelated shapes while a person in Spanish says, \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the sound of a cash register drawer opening and closing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, fragmented, and distorted composite of abstract shapes, lines, and color blocks in shades of brown, blue, and white, exhibiting severe pixelation and mosaic-like artifacts. Concurrently, the audio captures a person speaking in Spanish, stating, \"Aunque pequeño, este va a ser un poco difícil,\" which translates to \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the distinct mechanical sounds of a cash register drawer opening and closing.\n\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays abstract, pixelated shapes while a person in Spanish says, \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the sound of a cash register drawer opening and closing.}\nThe visual stream is a heavily corrupted, fragmented, and distorted composite of abstract shapes, lines, and color blocks in shades of brown, blue, and white, exhibiting severe pixelation and mosaic-like artifacts. Concurrently, the audio captures a person speaking in Spanish, stating, \"Aunque pequeño, este va a ser un poco difícil,\" which translates to \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the distinct mechanical sounds of a cash register drawer opening and closing.\n\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays abstract, pixelated shapes while a person in Spanish says, \"Although small, this is going to\n\nA heavily corrupted video displays abstract, pixelated shapes while a person in Spanish says, \"Although small, this is going to be a little difficult,\" accompanied by the sound of a cash register drawer opening and closing.", "time_sec": 233.588, "generation_time_seconds": 232.0799, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0387, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "32", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white room, a camera on a stand is ready to be installed, while men speak with light clicks, vibrations, and digital clicks.", "pred": "Severe digital video corruption shows shifting blocks of wood and abstract patterns, accompanied by a low electronic hum and two sharp beeps.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severe digital video corruption shows shifting blocks of wood and abstract patterns, accompanied by a low electronic hum and two sharp beeps.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, showing fragmented, shifting, and distorted rectangular blocks of color and pattern, including light wood textures, dark vertical lines resembling a ruler, and abstract grayscale shapes, which persist throughout. The audio consists of a sustained, low-frequency electronic hum or drone, punctuated by two distinct, high-pitched electronic beeps at the end.\n\\boxed{Severe digital video corruption shows shifting blocks of wood and abstract patterns, accompanied by a low electronic hum and two sharp beeps.}\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, showing fragmented, shifting, and distorted rectangular blocks of color and pattern, including light wood textures, dark vertical lines resembling a ruler, and abstract grayscale shapes, which persist throughout. The audio consists of a sustained, low-frequency electronic hum or drone, punctuated by two distinct, high-pitched electronic beeps at the end.\n\\boxed{Severe digital video corruption shows shifting blocks of wood and abstract patterns, accompanied by a low electronic hum and two sharp beeps.}\n\nSevere digital video corruption shows shifting blocks of wood and abstract patterns, accompanied by a low electronic hum and two sharp beeps.", "time_sec": 294.177, "generation_time_seconds": 292.2515, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0402, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "33", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of an aircraft engine hums as the wing of an airplane flies through a blue sky with clouds.", "pred": "\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with static and horizontal lines is accompanied by the continuous low rumble and rattling of a moving vehicle's engine.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with static and horizontal lines is accompanied by the continuous low rumble and rattling of a moving vehicle's engine.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe initial frames display severe digital video corruption, characterized by horizontal lines, blockiness, and color distortions. This visual artifact is accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine, likely a bus or truck, indicating the audio was captured from inside the vehicle during operation.\nThe video displays corrupted, glitched visuals with horizontal static lines, while the audio consists of a continuous low-frequency engine rumble and intermittent rattling, suggesting the recording was made from within a moving vehicle.\nThe visual data is severely corrupted, showing a static, glitched image with horizontal bands of distortion and muted colors, which remains unchanged throughout the clip. The audio consists of a constant, low-frequency mechanical rumble, likely from a large engine, layered with a subtle, rhythmic rattling and a faint, high-pitched whine, all indicative of being inside a moving vehicle.\n\n\\boxed{Severely corrupted video with static and horizontal lines is accompanied by the continuous low rumble and rattling of a moving vehicle's engine.}", "time_sec": 150.711, "generation_time_seconds": 149.0238, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0828, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "34", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man revs a vehicle engine as a woman with a microphone stands in the street, surrounded by a crowd of people talking and whistling and a some people are cleaning a road.", "pred": "A fragmented, abstract image collage is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, abstract image collage is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a chaotic, fragmented collage of abstract and indistinct shapes, colors, and patterns, including what appears to be a grid of small squares, vertical and horizontal bars, and blurred sections of earth and sky, all organized in a grid-like structure.\nThe audio consists of a loud, low-frequency engine rumble, characteristic of a large, powerful vehicle like a truck or bus, with a continuous, heavy, and mechanical sound.\nThe image is a digital mosaic of fragmented, distorted panels, while the audio features the powerful, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, abstract image collage is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.}}\nThe visual is a chaotic, fragmented collage of abstract and indistinct shapes, colors, and patterns, including what appears to be a grid of small squares, vertical and horizontal bars, and blurred sections of earth and sky, all organized in a grid-like structure.\nThe audio consists of a loud, low-frequency engine rumble, characteristic of a large, powerful vehicle like a truck or bus, with a continuous, heavy, and mechanical sound.\nThe image is a digital mosaic of fragmented, distorted panels, while the audio features the powerful, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, abstract image\n\nA fragmented, abstract image collage is accompanied by the loud, continuous rumble of a large diesel engine.", "time_sec": 195.147, "generation_time_seconds": 192.2213, "selection_time_seconds": 0.039, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "35", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The red and white plane's engine roars as it takes off from the airport runway, with people watching from the nearby fence.", "pred": "A digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.\n\\boxed{\\text{A digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.\n\\boxed{\\text{A digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe initial frames display a digital glitch effect with horizontal static lines and fragmented red, white, and green geometric shapes, which then resolve into a clear outdoor scene featuring a grassy field with a metal fence and dark objects in the background. This visual is accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar, characteristic of a powerful engine, such as a jet turbine or a large motor, dominating the audio.\nA digital glitch effect with horizontal static lines and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence, under a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.\nThe scene is a composite of severe digital corruption and a high-fidelity audio recording. The visual component begins as a series of horizontal bands of static and fragmented, distorted geometric patterns in red, white, and green, characteristic of a corrupted video file or a deliberate glitch art effect. These visual artifacts resolve into a coherent, non-glitching scene depicting a wide, grassy field. Within this field, a simple wire mesh fence runs horizontally, and several dark, indistinct shapes, possibly animals or equipment, are visible in the distance. This entire visual presentation is juxtaposed with a powerful, unmodulated, low-frequency mechanical\n\nA digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.\n\\boxed{\\text{A digital glitch with horizontal static and fragmented red, white, and green shapes resolves into a grassy field with a fence and dark objects, accompanied by a loud, sustained, low-frequency mechanical roar.}}", "time_sec": 208.091, "generation_time_seconds": 206.2161, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0427, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "36", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic hum of a train engine fills the air as a black and white train travels down the tracks near a wooded area.", "pred": "\\boxed{A blocky, corrupted image of a railway scene under a blue sky accompanies the sounds of a passing train with a multi-tone horn and wheels on tracks.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A blocky, corrupted image of a railway scene under a blue sky accompanies the sounds of a passing train with a multi-tone horn and wheels on tracks.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted, blocky image of a railway environment under a blue sky, while the audio captures the approach and passage of a train, including a multi-tone horn and the sound of wheels on the track.\n\\boxed{A blocky, corrupted image of a railway scene under a blue sky accompanies the sounds of a passing train with a multi-tone horn and wheels on tracks.}\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted, blocky image of a railway environment under a blue sky, while the audio captures the approach and passage of a train, including a multi-tone horn and the sound of wheels on the track.\n\n\\boxed{A blocky, corrupted image of a railway scene under a blue sky accompanies the sounds of a passing train with a multi-tone horn and wheels on tracks.}", "time_sec": 189.102, "generation_time_seconds": 187.2329, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0445, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "37", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A flock of pigeons coo and flap their wings while a distant rooster crows, with a white pigeon standing on top of a dirt floor.", "pred": "A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the distinct cooing of pigeons and a brief, high-pitched squeak, while the visual shows a rapid, abstract sequence of horizontal bars in black, white, and beige, suggesting glitchy digital distortion or a malfunctioning display.\nA chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.}}\n\nA chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, glitching display of abstract horizontal bars in black, beige, and white is accompanied by the cooing of pigeons and a faint squeak.}}", "time_sec": 171.27, "generation_time_seconds": 169.8752, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0495, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "38", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A horse-drawn carriage clip-clops through a lush green field with sheep grazing in the background and an engine idling nearby.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A horse-drawn carriage with metal wheels clatters along a paved path through a grassy area with trees and a wooden fence.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A horse-drawn carriage with metal wheels clatters along a paved path through a grassy area with trees and a wooden fence.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a green, grassy outdoor area with a wooden fence and a large tree, while the audio features the distinct, rhythmic clatter of a horse-drawn carriage moving over a paved surface.\n\\boxed{\\text{A horse-drawn carriage with metal wheels clatters along a paved path through a grassy area with trees and a wooden fence.}}\nThe visual shows a green, grassy outdoor area with a wooden fence and a large tree, while the audio features the distinct, rhythmic clatter of a horse-drawn carriage moving over a paved surface.\n\\boxed{\\text{A horse-drawn carriage with metal wheels clatters along a paved path through a grassy area with trees and a wooden fence.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A horse-drawn carriage with metal wheels clatters along a paved path through a grassy area with trees and a wooden fence.}}", "time_sec": 132.258, "generation_time_seconds": 130.7997, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0355, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "39", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a garage, an old car and truck are parked as a loud bang is heard, followed by an engine idling loudly.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video frame displays horizontal bands of glitched static and indistinct shapes, while the audio captures the loud, rhythmic clatter of a roller coaster train on metal tracks.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video frame displays horizontal bands of glitched static and indistinct shapes, while the audio captures the loud, rhythmic clatter of a roller coaster train on metal tracks.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures the intense, rhythmic clatter of a roller coaster train on its metal tracks, accompanied by a low, constant rumble. This auditory information is presented alongside a severely corrupted visual stream, which displays a fragmented, glitched, and distorted image composed of displaced horizontal bands with indistinct shapes and unclear colors.\nThe scene is a severely corrupted video frame, visually dominated by horizontal bands of static and glitched imagery in dark, orange, and white tones, while the audio features the loud, percussive clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.\nThe audio captures the intense, rhythmic clatter of a roller coaster train on its metal tracks, accompanied by a low, constant rumble. This auditory information is presented alongside a severely corrupted visual stream, which displays a fragmented, glitched, and distorted image composed of displaced horizontal bands with indistinct shapes and unclear colors.\nThe scene is a severely corrupted video frame, visually dominated by horizontal bands of static and glitched imagery in dark, orange, and white tones, while the audio features the loud, percussive clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.\n\nA severely corrupted video frame displays horizontal bands of glitched static and indistinct shapes, while the audio captures the loud, rhythmic clatter of a roller coaster train on metal tracks.", "time_sec": 179.147, "generation_time_seconds": 177.6682, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1235, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "40", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room filled with toys, a young girl plays joyfully as a woman talks and a man shouts in the background, creating a lively atmosphere of laughter and excitement.", "pred": "Severely corrupted video with horizontal banding overlays a scene where a baby cries, a man speaks in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze occurs.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely corrupted video with horizontal banding overlays a scene where a baby cries, a man speaks in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze occurs.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is heavily degraded by significant horizontal line artifacts and digital distortion, obscuring any clear subject or environment, while the audio consists of a baby crying, a man speaking in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze.\nThe visual is severely corrupted by horizontal banding and pixelation, rendering the scene unidentifiable, while the audio captures a baby crying, a man speaking in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze.\nThe video displays severe horizontal line artifacts and digital corruption, making the visual content unrecognizable, while the audio captures a baby crying, a man speaking in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze.\n\nSeverely corrupted video with horizontal banding overlays a scene where a baby cries, a man speaks in a foreign language, and a loud sneeze occurs.", "time_sec": 182.776, "generation_time_seconds": 177.9643, "selection_time_seconds": 0.7526, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "41", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man's voice narrates as he prepares a meal, cutting shrimp and  while water sprays into the sink and drains.", "pred": "\\boxed{Abstract, fragmented, and distorted panels of color and pattern are visually presented, accompanied by a persistent hissing or static sound and a raspy, muffled male voice speaking.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{Abstract, fragmented, and distorted panels of color and pattern are visually presented, accompanied by a persistent hissing or static sound and a raspy, muffled male voice speaking.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI have analyzed the visual and audio components of the video. The visual stream consists of abstract, fragmented, and distorted panels of color and pattern, showing no discernible subjects or environment. The audio stream contains a male voice speaking in a raspy, muffled tone, accompanied by a persistent hissing or static sound throughout. Both modalities are present and have been independently assessed for objective content. The final step is to synthesize these observations into a single, dense, factual sentence adhering to all constraints.\n\\boxed{Abstract, fragmented, and distorted panels of color and pattern are visually presented, accompanied by a persistent hissing or static sound and a raspy, muffled male voice speaking.}\nThe visual component of the video is a sequence of rapidly changing, horizontal, rectangular bands of color and texture. These bands are highly distorted and appear to be from a source under significant digital or physical manipulation, creating an abstract, non-representational image. The colors are varied and include flesh tones, blues, browns, and black, with some bands showing faint, indistinct patterns that could be interpreted as blurred architectural or landscape features.\n\n\\boxed{Abstract, fragmented, and distorted panels of color and pattern are visually presented, accompanied by a persistent hissing or static sound and a raspy, muffled male voice speaking.}", "time_sec": 187.232, "generation_time_seconds": 185.8116, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0389, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "42", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice crackles over the radio as water splashes and trickles, while a person in a red kayak paddles through the rain-drenched ocean.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted, glitching video of a red kayak on grey water is accompanied by the loud, guttural roars and wet snarls of a large, agitated animal.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted, glitching video of a red kayak on grey water is accompanied by the loud, guttural roars and wet snarls of a large, agitated animal.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented image composed of horizontal bands of grey, white, and abstract red and black patterns, suggesting severe digital corruption or glitching. Simultaneously, the audio captures a cacophony of aggressive animal sounds, dominated by loud, deep, guttural roars and snarls, coupled with wet, forceful breathing and shuffling noises, indicating the presence of a large, agitated animal in close proximity. Despite the visual's abstract nature, the audio is exceptionally clear and detailed, creating a stark contrast between the indistinct imagery and the vivid sound of a powerful creature in a state\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented image composed of horizontal bands of grey, white, and abstract red and black patterns, suggesting severe digital corruption or glitching. Simultaneously, the audio captures a cacophony of aggressive animal sounds, dominated by loud, deep, guttural roars and snarls, coupled with wet, forceful breathing and shuffling noises, indicating the presence of a large, agitated animal in close proximity. Despite the visual's abstract nature, the audio is exceptionally clear and detailed, creating a stark contrast between the indistinct imagery and the vivid sound of a powerful creature in a state\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented image composed of horizontal bands of grey, white, and abstract red and black patterns, suggesting severe digital corruption or glitching. Simultaneously, the audio captures a cacophony of aggressive animal sounds, dominated by loud, deep, guttural roars and snarls, coupled with wet, forceful breathing and shuffling noises, indicating the presence of a large, agitated animal in close proximity. Despite the visual's abstract nature, the audio is exceptionally clear and detailed, creating a stark contrast between the indistinct imagery and the vivid sound of a powerful creature in a state\n\nA heavily corrupted, glitching video of a red kayak on grey water is accompanied by the loud, guttural roars and wet snarls of a large, agitated animal.", "time_sec": 221.726, "generation_time_seconds": 219.9257, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0547, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 19.35, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "43", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The aircraft engine roars as the plane soars high above the clouds, with the sun shining brightly in the sky.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally striped visual of indistinct patterns accompanies the loud, low-frequency rumbling of a large engine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally striped visual of indistinct patterns accompanies the loud, low-frequency rumbling of a large engine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and horizontally striped visual, showing indistinct patterns of dark and light, possibly representing a view from a moving vehicle or a camera malfunction. The audio consists of a loud, low-frequency, continuous rumbling and roaring sound, characteristic of a large engine or heavy machinery in operation.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally striped visual of indistinct patterns accompanies the loud, low-frequency rumbling of a large engine.}}\nThe visual data is a mosaic of horizontal bands with significant pixelation and color shifts, creating a fragmented and abstract view of a scene. The underlying audio is a continuous, low-frequency roar, consistent with a powerful engine operating at a steady rate. The juxtaposition of the chaotic visual and the mechanical sound suggests a recording of a vehicle's interior or exterior during motion, with the camera struggling to capture the fast-moving environment.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally striped visual of indistinct patterns accompanies the loud, low-frequency rumbling of a large engine.}}", "time_sec": 170.656, "generation_time_seconds": 168.2943, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1367, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "44", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man with no shirt on is laying in bed, with footsteps walking on a hard surface followed by a person snoring.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video overlaid with a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video overlaid with a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream shows severe digital corruption, including horizontal banding and pixelation, with indistinct dark shapes; simultaneously, the audio captures a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine, consistent with a power tool like a grinder or saw in operation.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video overlaid with a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine.}}\nThe visual stream shows severe digital corruption, including horizontal banding and pixelation, with indistinct dark shapes; simultaneously, the audio captures a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine, consistent with a power tool like a grinder or saw in operation.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video overlaid with a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video overlaid with a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical whine.}}", "time_sec": 170.399, "generation_time_seconds": 169.1464, "selection_time_seconds": 0.044, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "45", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows hard and the engine hums loud, a man drives a boat on a lake with a purple background.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a sequence of abstract, distorted, and fragmented patterns, including horizontal and vertical bars, checkerboard, and geometric shapes, with color shifts between light and dark tones, some red, and black, suggesting digital corruption or glitch art. Concurrently, the audio is a very loud, low-frequency, rumbling engine sound, like that of a large vehicle such as a bus or truck, with a sustained, vibrating hum. The two modalities are unrelated, with the audio providing no information about the visual source. Based on the instructions, the final description must be extremely concise, objective, and under 30 words,\nA rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}}\n\nA rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting collage of abstract, glitchy patterns in black, white, and red is accompanied by the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}}", "time_sec": 154.583, "generation_time_seconds": 153.3063, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0389, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.3, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "46", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The intense audio of gunshots firing transitions to two men talking, then music playing, as a man sitting on a couch holds a bottle of water.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily glitched video mosaic of fragmented, shifting colored blocks and shapes plays alongside a male voice introducing a water bottle trick.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily glitched video mosaic of fragmented, shifting colored blocks and shapes plays alongside a male voice introducing a water bottle trick.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male speaker introducing a 'trick' with a bottle of water, but the accompanying visual is a heavily distorted, glitching mosaic composed of various fragmented and colorful video clips, including abstract shapes, text overlays, and brief glimpses of people.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, fragmented video mosaic overlays abstract shapes and text with a male voice introducing a water bottle trick.}}\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, with the image broken into numerous disconnected rectangular blocks of varying colors and patterns that shift across the screen. These blocks include abstract textures, parts of human faces, and other indistinct shapes. In contrast, the audio features a male voice speaking in a conversational tone, introducing a \"trick\" involving a bottle of water. The content of the audio and the visual chaos of the video are unrelated.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily glitched video mosaic of fragmented, shifting colored blocks and shapes plays alongside a male voice introducing a water bottle trick.}}", "time_sec": 166.202, "generation_time_seconds": 163.9045, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0433, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "47", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman is heard breathing heavily, sneezing twice, and sniffing her nose, in the dark room.", "pred": "A person repeatedly inhales and forcefully exhales in a strained, guttural manner, creating a rhythmic sound of labored breathing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A person repeatedly inhales and forcefully exhales in a strained, guttural manner, creating a rhythmic sound of labored breathing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures a person repeatedly inhaling deeply and then exhaling forcefully in a strained, guttural manner, creating a rhythmic sound of labored breathing.\n\\boxed{\\text{A person repeatedly inhales and forcefully exhales in a strained, guttural manner, creating a rhythmic sound of labored breathing.}}\nThe visual is completely black with no discernible objects, actions, or environmental cues. The audio is a continuous, rhythmic sequence of deep inhalation and forceful, strained exhalation, characteristic of labored breathing. The sounds are close-mic'd, capturing the wet gurgling and physical effort of each breath cycle.\n\nA person repeatedly inhales and forcefully exhales in a strained, guttural manner, creating a rhythmic sound of labored breathing.", "time_sec": 156.54, "generation_time_seconds": 154.5509, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1131, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "48", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A brown dog sound on top of a rug next to a large tire whimpers and barks while breathing rapidly.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like image of red and black textures is accompanied by the sounds of a dog barking and panting.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like image of red and black textures is accompanied by the sounds of a dog barking and panting.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a heavily pixelated, mosaic-like composite of various close-up textures, predominantly featuring red and black patterns, possibly including fabric or synthetic materials, all rendered in a fractured, abstract manner. Over this visual, the distinct sounds of a dog barking and heavy panting are heard.\n\\boxed{A fragmented, pixelated collage of red and black patterns is overlaid with the sounds of a dog barking and panting.}\nThe audio consists entirely of canine vocalizations, including deep, resonant barks and rapid, high-pitched panting, suggesting a large dog in a state of excitement or exertion. The absence of environmental or human sounds indicates a focused recording of the animal, possibly in a contained space. The visual is an abstract, digital glitch effect, composed of a grid of distorted and misaligned rectangular video segments, obscuring any coherent scene. The audio and visual lack any direct narrative or contextual link.\n\nA heavily pixelated, mosaic-like image of red and black textures is accompanied by the sounds of a dog barking and panting.", "time_sec": 181.555, "generation_time_seconds": 180.1362, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0397, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "49", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The whimpering of several small dogs can be heard as a group of puppies play together in the grass.", "pred": "A dog growls and whines in an outdoor setting, while the visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of abstract shapes and colors.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A dog growls and whines in an outdoor setting, while the visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of abstract shapes and colors.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures a dog vocalizing with growls, whines, and a single bark in an outdoor setting, while the accompanying visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of various colors and shapes.\nA dog growls and whines, with a single bark, in an outdoor setting, while the visual displays a heavily distorted and fragmented mosaic of abstract shapes and colors.\nThe audio consists of a dog's growls, whines, and a single bark in an outdoor environment, while the visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of various colors and shapes.\n\nA dog growls and whines in an outdoor setting, while the visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated mosaic of abstract shapes and colors.", "time_sec": 181.771, "generation_time_seconds": 179.5928, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0395, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "50", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In front of a blue house with a red front door, a man stands as a toy helicopter powers down before starting up.", "pred": "A loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical grinding sound, like a power tool, is heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical grinding sound, like a power tool, is heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical grinding or drilling sound, possibly from a power tool operating at high speed.\nThe audio features a loud, high-pitched, sustained mechanical grinding sound consistent with a high-speed power tool like a grinder or saw operating continuously, accompanied by a lower-frequency motor hum.\nThe audio is dominated by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical grinding or whirring sound, consistent with a high-speed power tool such as a grinder or saw running at full power.\n\nA loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical grinding sound, like a power tool, is heard.", "time_sec": 164.071, "generation_time_seconds": 162.3401, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2561, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "51", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man whistled as the small dogs on the bed looked into a mirror, followed by a yell as plastic rustled and clanked in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video of abstract red, white, and brown static bands is accompanied by a person whistling and a man shouting, \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud thud.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video of abstract red, white, and brown static bands is accompanied by a person whistling and a man shouting, \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud thud.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video stream is heavily corrupted with horizontal bands of static and pixelation, displaying fragmented, abstract patterns of red, white, and brown textures. Over this, the audio features a person whistling, followed by a man shouting \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud, echoing thud occurring during the speech.\nThe video is a heavily corrupted, abstract sequence of horizontal static bands in red, white, and brown, while the audio contains a person whistling followed by a man shouting, \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud thud.\nThe video is a heavily corrupted, abstract sequence of horizontal static bands in red, white, and brown, while the audio contains a person whistling followed by a man shouting, \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud thud.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video of abstract red, white, and brown static bands is accompanied by a person whistling and a man shouting, \"Mama! Mama, come over here, baby!\" with a loud thud.}}", "time_sec": 181.239, "generation_time_seconds": 179.6489, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0338, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "52", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark forest, a man speaks with whistling and rain background noise.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted, horizontally-striped black-and-white video plays alongside a deep male voice narrating as a high-pitched, rhythmic, and dissonant whistling sound begins and then stops abruptly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted, horizontally-striped black-and-white video plays alongside a deep male voice narrating as a high-pitched, rhythmic, and dissonant whistling sound begins and then stops abruptly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a severely corrupted, glitched black-and-white image composed of horizontal bands and static. The audio consists of a male voice narrating as a high-pitched, rhythmic whistling sound begins and then stops abruptly.\nA heavily corrupted, horizontally-striped black-and-white video plays alongside a deep male voice narrating as a high-pitched, rhythmic whistling sound begins and then stops.\nThe audio features a deep male voice narrating a suspenseful line, which is accompanied by a high-pitched, rhythmic, and slightly dissonant whistling sound that starts and stops abruptly. The audio is clear and dry, suggesting an indoor, controlled recording environment. The visual is a completely degraded and static-filled image, showing only horizontal bands of black, white, and grey. There is no discernible object, person, or environment within the visual frame, only digital corruption. The two modalities are unrelated in content.\n\nA heavily corrupted, horizontally-striped black-and-white video plays alongside a deep male voice narrating as a high-pitched, rhythmic, and dissonant whistling sound begins and then stops abruptly.", "time_sec": 201.55, "generation_time_seconds": 199.8548, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0409, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "53", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a scene filled with whimsical characters, a man dressed as a cow speaks in a high tone while a goat bleats, as a woman in a white costume holds a hat.", "pred": "Severely glitched horizontal bars in muted colors overlay a male voice speaking in Japanese, ending with a high-pitched electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely glitched horizontal bars in muted colors overlay a male voice speaking in Japanese, ending with a high-pitched electronic tone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is severely corrupted, displaying a mosaic of horizontal, glitched, and fragmented image blocks in muted pink, white, and beige tones with occasional yellow and green, suggesting a damaged video signal. Simultaneously, a male voice speaks in Japanese, followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely glitched horizontal bars in muted colors overlay a male voice speaking in Japanese, ending with a high-pitched electronic tone.}}\nAnalysis of the audio confirms a single male speaker, likely in a Japanese dialect, delivering a monologue. The speech is clear and distinct from the background noise, which is a constant, low-level electronic hiss. From the 00:09 mark, this hiss is overlaid by a new, prominent, high-pitched electronic tone that remains steady until the end. This tone is not modulated and is characteristic of a data modem or a system alert. The visual and audio streams are entirely independent; the glitched visuals do not correlate with any specific sound events, and the audio continues without interruption.\n\nSeverely glitched horizontal bars in muted colors overlay a male voice speaking in Japanese, ending with a high-pitched electronic tone.", "time_sec": 219.974, "generation_time_seconds": 217.63, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1745, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "54", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black train blows its horn while traveling down the tracks near a street and trees.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video of a landscape with trees and a red-and-white barrier is accompanied by the loud, rhythmic sound of a steam train whistle and clattering wheels.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video of a landscape with trees and a red-and-white barrier is accompanied by the loud, rhythmic sound of a steam train whistle and clattering wheels.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features the loud, high-pitched, and rhythmic sound of a steam whistle, indicating a steam-powered train. This is accompanied by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on tracks. The visual is a heavily distorted and pixelated mosaic, composed of horizontal bands of fragmented imagery. These bands show a mix of green foliage, blue sky with white clouds, grey and brown earthy textures, and a distinct red-and-white striped pattern, all arranged in a disjointed, low-resolution manner.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, mosaic-like video of a forest, sky, and ground textures is accompanied by the loud, rhyth\nThe audio features the loud, high-pitched, and rhythmic sound of a steam whistle, indicating a steam-powered train. This is accompanied by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on tracks. The visual is a heavily distorted and pixelated mosaic, composed of horizontal bands of fragmented imagery. These bands show a mix of green foliage, blue sky with white clouds, grey and brown earthy textures, and a distinct red-and-white striped pattern, all arranged in a disjointed, low-resolution manner.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, mosaic-like video of a forest, sky, and ground textures is accompanied by the loud, rhyth\nThe audio features the loud, high-pitched, and rhythmic sound of a steam whistle, indicating a steam-powered train. This is accompanied by the rhythmic clatter of wheels on tracks. The visual is a heavily distorted and pixelated mosaic, composed of horizontal bands of fragmented imagery. These bands show a mix of green foliage, blue sky with white clouds, grey and brown earthy textures, and a distinct red-and-white striped pattern, all arranged in a disjointed, low-resolution manner.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, mosaic-like video of a forest, sky, and ground textures is accompanied by the loud, rhyth\n\nA heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video of a landscape with trees and a red-and-white barrier is accompanied by the loud, rhythmic sound of a steam train whistle and clattering wheels.", "time_sec": 266.839, "generation_time_seconds": 263.8402, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1733, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "55", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man in the garage is changing a tire on a car while a short spray is followed by a louder, longer spray.", "pred": "A digital collage of abstract, fragmented geometric tiles in black, white, and blue is paired with the ambient sounds of birds, a goat's 'baa', and a sharp metallic clang.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A digital collage of abstract, fragmented geometric tiles in black, white, and blue is paired with the ambient sounds of birds, a goat's 'baa', and a sharp metallic clang.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is a digital, glitch-art style collage composed of numerous small, rectangular tiles showing fragmented, distorted, and abstract patterns. The primary colors are black, white, grey, and blue, with some tiles showing faint textures resembling grids or industrial materials. The visual has no discernible real-world objects, people, or coherent scenes. The accompanying audio is an outdoor soundscape featuring birdsong, the distinct 'baaing' of a goat, and a sharp, sudden metallic clang. Since the task is to describe both what is seen and what is heard in a single sentence, the final description must be a factual, dense\nA digital collage of abstract, fragmented geometric tiles in black, white, and blue is paired with the ambient sounds of birds, a goat's 'baa', and a sharp metallic clang.\nThe image is a static, digitally distorted collage of abstract, rectangular tiles in black, white, and blue, showing no real-world scene. The audio is an outdoor soundscape containing birdsong, the distinct 'baa' of a goat, and a sudden, sharp metallic clang. A single, factual sentence combining these is required.\n\\boxed{\\text{A digital collage of abstract, fragmented geometric tiles in black, white, and blue is paired with the ambient sounds of birds, a goat's 'baa', and a sharp metallic clang.}}\n\nA digital collage of abstract, fragmented geometric tiles in black, white, and blue is paired with the ambient sounds of birds, a goat's 'baa', and a sharp metallic clang.", "time_sec": 171.162, "generation_time_seconds": 169.3455, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2087, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "56", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a hospital room, a baby cries while a woman speaks amidst the background noise of other conversations, as a newborn baby lays in a hospital bed.", "pred": "Severely pixelated image with horizontal banding; audio contains a baby crying and a male voice speaking.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely pixelated image with horizontal banding; audio contains a baby crying and a male voice speaking.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is severely corrupted with horizontal banding and pixelation, making it impossible to identify any specific objects, people, or environment. The accompanying audio consists of a baby crying loudly and a male voice speaking in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely pixelated image with horizontal banding; audio contains a baby crying and a male voice speaking.}}\nThe provided image is severely corrupted with horizontal banding and pixelation, making it impossible to identify any specific objects, people, or environment. The accompanying audio consists of a baby crying loudly and a male voice speaking in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely pixelated image with horizontal banding; audio contains a baby crying and a male voice speaking.}}\n\nSeverely pixelated image with horizontal banding; audio contains a baby crying and a male voice speaking.", "time_sec": 326.857, "generation_time_seconds": 325.114, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1262, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "57", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of ocean waves crashing in the distance accompanies the laughter of children playing on the beach, as a young girl  make faces in the sand, capturing moments of joy and creativity.", "pred": "A male voice speaks in a foreign language over static and a low hum, while a fragmented mosaic of shifting brown and pink textures is displayed.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks in a foreign language over static and a low hum, while a fragmented mosaic of shifting brown and pink textures is displayed.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a male voice speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by background static and a low-frequency hum, while the visual consists of a mosaic of shifting brown, tan, and pink textures with a pixelated, abstract, and fragmented appearance.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice speaks in a foreign language over static and a low hum, while a fragmented mosaic of shifting brown and pink textures is displayed.}}\nThe audio contains a male voice speaking in a foreign language, accompanied by background static and a low-frequency hum, while the visual consists of a mosaic of shifting brown, tan, and pink textures with a pixelated, abstract, and fragmented appearance.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice speaks in a foreign language over static and a low hum, while a fragmented mosaic of shifting brown and pink textures is displayed.}}\n\nA male voice speaks in a foreign language over static and a low hum, while a fragmented mosaic of shifting brown and pink textures is displayed.", "time_sec": 383.934, "generation_time_seconds": 381.7728, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2196, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "58", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The boat motor roars as the small boat speeds across the vast blue water, creating splashes in its wake, before the wind takes over.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a blue body of water under a light sky with static interference is accompanied by the loud rumble of an engine and rushing wind.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a blue body of water under a light sky with static interference is accompanied by the loud rumble of an engine and rushing wind.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitchy image of a body of water under a light blue sky, with corrupted horizontal bands and static interference, while the audio consists of the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine and the rushing sound of wind.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a blue body of water under a light sky with static interference is accompanied by the loud rumble of an engine and rushing wind.}}\nThe audio contains a low-frequency, powerful engine rumble, consistent with a large vehicle like a truck or bus, combined with prominent rushing wind noise, suggesting high speed. The video shows a fragmented, corrupted view of a large blue body of water and a light sky, with severe horizontal static and data corruption, indicating a malfunctioning video signal rather than a physical scene. The two modalities are temporally synchronized but contentually disconnected, one being a realistic mechanical soundscape and the other a purely abstract, corrupted visual.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a blue body of water under a light sky with static interference is accompanied by the loud rumble of an engine and rushing wind.}}", "time_sec": 272.554, "generation_time_seconds": 271.0644, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1022, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.14, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "59", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing steam, a man stands by a black train with red wheels.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitch-effect video of abstract blue, grey, and red shapes plays alongside the loud, intermittent whirring and grinding of a power tool.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitch-effect video of abstract blue, grey, and red shapes plays alongside the loud, intermittent whirring and grinding of a power tool.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a dynamic, abstract composition of fragmented, rapidly shifting geometric shapes in shades of blue, grey, and red, creating a mosaic-like, glitchy visual effect with no discernible real-world objects or scenes. The audio consists of the loud, continuous, high-pitched whirring of a high-speed power tool, possibly a grinder or saw, operating on a hard material, accompanied by intermittent clanking and scraping sounds. The visual style is purely digital and abstract, while the audio is a clear recording of a mechanical action. There is no perceptible connection or synchronization between the visual and auditory components; they are distinct and\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitch-effect video of abstract blue, grey, and red shapes plays alongside the loud, intermittent whirring and grinding of a power tool.}}\nThe visual content is a complex, abstract digital animation. It is constructed from a multitude of small, rectangular video clips that are constantly shifting and rearranging themselves into a larger, evolving mosaic. The dominant colors are cool, with various shades of blue, grey, and white, punctuated by sharp, bright red geometric lines and shapes. The overall effect is one of digital instability, similar to a glitch or a corrupted video file, with no discernible real-world objects or environments.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitch-effect video of abstract blue, grey, and red shapes plays alongside the loud, intermittent whirring and grinding of a power tool.}}", "time_sec": 219.169, "generation_time_seconds": 216.6173, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1679, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "60", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man is using a tool to fix the engine of a motorcycle while speaking with distant hums and horns of passing traffic in the background.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bands of color and pattern, making specific details indiscernible. The audio stream features a male voice speaking in Bengali over the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large vehicle engine, likely a bus or truck. The speech and engine noise are layered, with the engine sound present throughout. No other distinct environmental sounds are audible.\nA heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.}}\n\nA heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, fragmented image with shifting horizontal color bands is accompanied by a male voice speaking Bengali over the continuous rumble of a large vehicle engine.}}", "time_sec": 137.279, "generation_time_seconds": 135.1801, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1725, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "61", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The revving idling engine hums as a crowd of people excitedly takes photos of a concept car on display at the auto show.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented image of a white car with a crowd, while the audio features a loud, roaring engine and a faint, unintelligible male voice.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented image of a white car with a crowd, while the audio features a loud, roaring engine and a faint, unintelligible male voice.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented image composed of numerous rectangular and square blocks, primarily in black, white, and shades of gray, with some color patches, arranged in a grid-like mosaic with horizontal and vertical banding; simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine, possibly from a motorcycle or high-performance vehicle, accompanied by a faint, unintelligible male voice speaking in the background.\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented image composed of numerous rectangular and square blocks, primarily in black, white, and shades of gray, with some color patches, arranged in a grid-like mosaic with horizontal and vertical banding; simultaneously, the audio captures the loud, roaring sound of a powerful engine, possibly from a motorcycle or high-performance vehicle, accompanied by a faint, unintelligible male voice speaking in the background.\nThe video shows a mosaic of distorted, fragmented panels in black, white, gray, and patches of color, while the audio features a loud, roaring engine and a faint, unintelligible male voice.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented image of a white car with a crowd, while the audio features a loud, roaring engine and a faint, unintelligible male voice.}}", "time_sec": 246.14, "generation_time_seconds": 243.0565, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1672, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 18.18, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "62", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The motorcycle's engine chugged slowly before revving up, parked on the side of the street with a close-up view of its engine .", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video frame shows indistinct, abstract shapes and textures, while a loud, rapid mechanical rattling sound abruptly changes into a sustained, high-pitched metallic grinding noise.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video frame shows indistinct, abstract shapes and textures, while a loud, rapid mechanical rattling sound abruptly changes into a sustained, high-pitched metallic grinding noise.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of heavy horizontal digital distortion, rendering the scene unrecognizable, while the audio features a loud, rapid, metallic rattling sound that transitions into a sustained, high-pitched, grinding mechanical noise.\nA heavily corrupted video frame shows indistinct, abstract shapes and textures, while a loud, rapid mechanical rattling sound abruptly changes into a sustained, high-pitched metallic grinding noise.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video frame shows indistinct, abstract shapes and textures, while a loud, rapid mechanical rattling sound abruptly changes into a sustained, high-pitched metallic grinding noise.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video frame shows indistinct, abstract shapes and textures, while a loud, rapid mechanical rattling sound abruptly changes into a sustained, high-pitched metallic grinding noise.}}", "time_sec": 178.035, "generation_time_seconds": 174.7502, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4438, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "63", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a game room, a child's cries are heard as a person blows their nose amidst computer mouse clicks, with a video game displayed on the screen.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes and patterns in vivid purples, pinks, oranges, and teals is accompanied by the sound of a person crying and sobbing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes and patterns in vivid purples, pinks, oranges, and teals is accompanied by the sound of a person crying and sobbing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes and patterns in vivid purples, pinks, oranges, and teals, while the audio captures the sound of a person crying and sobbing.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes and patterns in vivid purples, pinks, oranges, and teals is accompanied by the sound of a person crying and sobbing.}}\nThe visual content is a non-representational, digital glitch effect, characterized by a mosaic of rapidly changing, distorted rectangular tiles. These tiles display a wide spectrum of colors, predominantly featuring strong purples, pinks, and oranges, along with blues and greens, creating a psychedelic and chaotic pattern. The audio consists of the distinct sound of a person crying, including audible sobs and gasps for breath. The emotional tone of the audio is one of distress and sorrow. The two modalities—the chaotic, abstract visuals and the poignant, human audio—exist independently and are not thematically connected.\n\nA rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of abstract shapes and patterns in vivid purples, pinks, oranges, and teals is accompanied by the sound of a person crying and sobbing.", "time_sec": 214.269, "generation_time_seconds": 211.8031, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1391, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "64", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small room, a man's voice is heard followed by the sound of a camera muffling and footsteps shuffling, while a brown cardboard box kept on a wooden table next to a chair.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped image in orange and red tones is paired with a male voice speaking about a model and arms, followed by a dragging sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped image in orange and red tones is paired with a male voice speaking about a model and arms, followed by a dragging sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, pixelated image with horizontal bands of orange, red, and black, while the audio features a male voice speaking, followed by the sound of an object being dragged or scraped across a surface.\nThe visual shows a chaotic, horizontally-segmented abstract pattern in warm tones, with the audio capturing a male speaker saying \"stand for my first model,\" followed by the distinct sound of an object being dragged, which is then accompanied by the speaker saying \"doing the arms.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped image in orange and red tones is paired with a male voice speaking about a model and arms, followed by a dragging sound.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, horizontally-striped image in orange and red tones is paired with a male voice speaking about a model and arms, followed by a dragging sound.}}", "time_sec": 178.723, "generation_time_seconds": 176.8924, "selection_time_seconds": 0.122, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "65", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the forest, a man speaks amidst a swarm of bees buzzing around a tree branch with berries in forest.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting abstract pattern of green and brown textures is shown, accompanied by a man speaking in French about a beehive and the loud buzzing of insects.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting abstract pattern of green and brown textures is shown, accompanied by a man speaking in French about a beehive and the loud buzzing of insects.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting collage of abstract, pixelated patterns in green, brown, and white, while the audio features a man speaking in French about a \"ruche\" (beehive) amidst the loud, continuous buzzing of insects.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting abstract pattern of green and brown textures is shown, accompanied by a man speaking in French about a beehive and the loud buzzing of insects.}}\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting collage of abstract, pixelated patterns in green, brown, and white, while the audio features a man speaking in French about a \"ruche\" (beehive) amidst the loud, continuous buzzing of insects.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting abstract pattern of green and brown textures is shown, accompanied by a man speaking in French about a beehive and the loud buzzing of insects.}}\n\nA rapidly shifting abstract pattern of green and brown textures is shown, accompanied by a man speaking in French about a beehive and the loud buzzing of insects.", "time_sec": 227.947, "generation_time_seconds": 223.1781, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1977, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "66", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "An adult female speaks as a blue and white bus idles at a stop, with passengers boarding and vehicle traffic passing by on the city street.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, fragmented cityscape with horizontal static bars is accompanied by the loud screech of train brakes and a male voice on a PA system.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, fragmented cityscape with horizontal static bars is accompanied by the loud screech of train brakes and a male voice on a PA system.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a distorted, fragmented cityscape with glitching horizontal bars, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched screech of train brakes and a male voice speaking over a public announcement system.}}\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1.  Analyze the visual stream independently: The scene is not a normal city view but a heavily distorted, glitchy feed. It is composed of a mosaic of rectangular blocks, many of which are black, white, or filled with horizontal lines resembling digital static. The underlying image is a cityscape at night, with illuminated buildings and streets that are fragmented and scrambled across the frame.\n2.  Analyze the audio stream independently: The most prominent sound is the high-pitched, metallic screech of train brakes, suggesting a train is slowing or stopping on tracks. Layered beneath this is a\nThe reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, fragmented cityscape with horizontal static bars is accompanied by the loud screech of train brakes and a male voice on a PA system.}}", "time_sec": 155.981, "generation_time_seconds": 151.7619, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4223, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "67", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of water running from a flushed toilet fills the tiled bathroom as a white toilet bowl with bubbles of water inside it is shown.", "pred": "A severely distorted, blocky visual of a textured surface is paired with the clear audio of a toilet flushing and gurgling water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely distorted, blocky visual of a textured surface is paired with the clear audio of a toilet flushing and gurgling water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA distorted, blocky visual of what appears to be wooden and patterned surfaces is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing followed by the continuous gurgling of water.\nA highly distorted, fragmented visual of what appears to be wooden textures and vertical blinds is paired with the distinct sound of a toilet flushing and the subsequent gurgling of water.\nThe audio is a clear, close-mic recording of a toilet being flushed, with prominent gurgling and suction sounds, indicating a small, hard-surfaced room. The visual is a severely corrupted, mosaic-like image, possibly showing a wooden door or wall with a textured surface, but its details are too fragmented to be certain. The two modalities are unrelated.\n\nA severely distorted, blocky visual of a textured surface is paired with the clear audio of a toilet flushing and gurgling water.", "time_sec": 149.522, "generation_time_seconds": 146.6674, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1884, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "68", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a child yells, with an aircraft flying in the distance, while a little girl stands on a swing overlooking the ocean and a young boy rides a skateboard on a boat deck.", "pred": "A low-resolution, abstract mosaic of intersecting horizontal and vertical bars in muted earth tones and blues is accompanied by a low, distorted, guttural vocalization, a burst of static, and a deep, continuous mechanical hum.\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, abstract mosaic of intersecting horizontal and vertical bars in muted earth tones and blues is accompanied by a low, distorted, guttural vocalization, a burst of static, and a deep, continuous mechanical hum.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A low-resolution, abstract mosaic of intersecting horizontal and vertical bars in muted earth tones and blues is accompanied by a low, distorted, guttural vocalization, a burst of static, and a deep, continuous mechanical hum.\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, abstract mosaic of intersecting horizontal and vertical bars in muted earth tones and blues is accompanied by a low, distorted, guttural vocalization, a burst of static, and a deep, continuous mechanical hum.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a high-frequency, low-resolution, abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical bars in muted colors, showing no discernible objects or scenes.\n The audio stream contains a low-pitched, distorted, and guttural vocalization, followed by a burst of static and then a low-frequency mechanical rumble.\n The two modalities are unrelated and do not depict the same event.\n Combining the factual observations from both streams into a single, dense sentence.\nA low-resolution, abstract mosaic of intersecting horizontal and vertical bars in muted earth tones and blues is accompanied by 