arrier, and a field with trees under a light blue sky. The sounds suggest a high-speed vehicle event, while the visuals depict a static, abstracted landscape.\nA fragmented, abstracted mosaic of a paved road, a white barrier, and a treeline under a light blue sky is visually presented, while the audio simultaneously captures the powerful roar of\n\nA fragmented, abstracted mosaic of a paved road, a white barrier, and a treeline under a light blue sky is visually presented, while the audio simultaneously captures the powerful roar of a high-performance vehicle engine and the screech of tires losing traction.", "time_sec": 201.885, "generation_time_seconds": 198.3497, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4006, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
