entirely obscured by severe digital artifacts, including horizontal and vertical static lines, blocky pixelation, and large sections of solid black and white, suggesting a corrupted or glitched video signal. No clear objects, people, or environments can be identified from the corrupted visuals. The audio and visual streams are fundamentally unrelated, with the audio providing a constant mechanical sound and the video being a non\n\nA heavily corrupted video signal displays static and blocky artifacts, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency engine rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video signal displays static and blocky artifacts, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency engine rumble.}}", "time_sec": 199.622, "generation_time_seconds": 197.4486, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2024, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "71", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman in a red and black jacket is speaking over a microphone on stage.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a glitching, pixelated mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown, while a male speaker discusses an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a glitching, pixelated mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown, while a male speaker discusses an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA glitching, pixelated video displays a mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, white, red, and brown, while a male voice speaks about an \"inspiring song\" and a \"Light It Up convention theme.\"\nA glitching, pixelated video of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown is paired with a male speaker discussing an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"\nThe video displays a glitching, pixelated mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown, while a male speaker discusses an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a glitching, pixelated mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown, while a male speaker discusses an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a glitching, pixelated mosaic of abstract horizontal bars in yellow, black, red, and brown, while a male speaker discusses an \"inspiring song\" and the \"Light It Up convention theme.\"}}", "time_sec": 193.731, "generation_time_seconds": 191.9617, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0372, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "72", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a young woman in a blue skirt is seen holding a paper as a speech in front of a door.", "pred": "The video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content. The audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.\nThe video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.}}\nThe video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.\nThe video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal static and digital corruption, obscuring any clear visual content, while the audio captures a male speaker with a neutral accent explaining that medical abortion uses pharmaceutical drugs instead of surgery and is known as the abortion pill.", "time_sec": 217.538, "generation_time_seconds": 215.8925, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0636, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "73", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The booming engines of cars racing on the highway as a red car speeds down the road in the right lane.", "pred": "A mosaic of fragmented, corrupted video blocks overlays a loud, rapid machine gun fire followed by a deep, resonant rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A mosaic of fragmented, corrupted video blocks overlays a loud, rapid machine gun fire followed by a deep, resonant rumble.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, presenting a mosaic of fragmented, distorted rectangular blocks in various colors and patterns against a light blue background, with no discernible coherent imagery. Concurrently, the audio features the loud, rapid, and irregular sound of a machine gun or similar automatic weapon firing, followed by a deep, resonant, low-frequency rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented, corrupted video blocks overlays a loud, rapid machine gun fire followed by a deep, resonant rumble.}}\nThe visual information is entirely composed of digital corruption, manifesting as a grid of scrambled, colored rectangular blocks. This corruption is consistent throughout the video, indicating a systemic issue with the video data stream rather than a physical scene. The audio is a clear, high-fidelity recording of two distinct events: the rapid, percussive crack of automatic gunfire and the powerful, low-frequency roar of a large engine, likely from a military vehicle. These two streams are independent; the corruption does not obscure the audio.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented, corrupted video blocks overlays a loud, rapid machine gun fire followed by a deep\n\nA mosaic of fragmented, corrupted video blocks overlays a loud, rapid machine gun fire followed by a deep, resonant rumble.", "time_sec": 238.029, "generation_time_seconds": 235.9324, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2768, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "74", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman standing at a podium giving a speech while playing a musical instrument in a quiet environment.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol. \\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol. \\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, with multiple horizontal scan lines, blocky pixelation, and distorted, rapidly shifting abstract patterns in a palette of purple, green, and cyan. Over this, a male voice with a heavy accent speaks in a formal, measured tone, saying, \"I'm told that I have very little time, so I may I beg to stand on all existing protocol. I beg...\"\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines, blocky pixelation, and shifting abstract patterns in purple, green, and cyan, while the audio is a male voice with a heavy accent speaking formally, \"I'm told that I have very little time, so I may I beg to stand on all existing protocol. I beg...\"\nA heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol. \\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol.}}\n\nA heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol. \\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted digital video with horizontal scan lines and blocky, shifting patterns in purple, green, and cyan displays over which a male voice with a heavy accent speaks formally about having little time and begging to stand on existing protocol.}}", "time_sec": 208.892, "generation_time_seconds": 207.1834, "selection_time_seconds": 0.113, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "75", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the serene ambiance of a bathroom, water softly flows as a man speaks amidst the presence of a shower head, a toothbrush, an umbrella on a tripod, and a person holding a plunger.", "pred": "A low-fidelity recording features a repetitive, high-pitched electronic beep layered over a distorted, low-pitched male voice, while the visuals display a rapid mosaic of abstract, shifting color blocks in beige, brown, and grey.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A low-fidelity recording features a repetitive, high-pitched electronic beep layered over a distorted, low-pitched male voice, while the visuals display a rapid mosaic of abstract, shifting color blocks in beige, brown, and grey.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a harsh, repetitive electronic beep layered over a male voice speaking in a heavily distorted, low-fidelity tone, while the video consists of a mosaic of rapidly shifting, abstract color blocks and geometric patterns in muted beige, brown, and grey tones.\nA low-fidelity recording features a repetitive, high-pitched electronic beep layered over a distorted, low-pitched male voice, while the visuals display a rapid mosaic of abstract, shifting color blocks in beige, brown, and grey.\nThe audio features a harsh, repetitive electronic beep layered over a male voice speaking in a heavily distorted, low-fidelity tone, while the video consists of a mosaic of rapidly shifting, abstract color blocks and geometric patterns in muted beige, brown, and grey tones.\nA low-fidelity recording features a repetitive, high-pitched electronic beep layered over a distorted, low-pitched male voice, while the visuals display a rapid mosaic of abstract, shifting color blocks in beige, brown, and grey.\n\nA low-fidelity recording features a repetitive, high-pitched electronic beep layered over a distorted, low-pitched male voice, while the visuals display a rapid mosaic of abstract, shifting color blocks in beige, brown, and grey.", "time_sec": 187.181, "generation_time_seconds": 183.993, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1765, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "76", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The soothing sound of water trickling and dripping accompanies a bustling crowd's chatter, as a man captures a mesmerizing image of fish swimming in a large aquarium.", "pred": "The video displays severe digital static and horizontal tearing, while the audio features the continuous rumble of a large engine and the sound of heavy splashing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays severe digital static and horizontal tearing, while the audio features the continuous rumble of a large engine and the sound of heavy splashing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital distortion, with rapidly shifting horizontal bands of fragmented, high-contrast visual information, while the audio contains the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine and the distinct sound of heavy splashing water, as if a large object is moving through it.\nThe video shows severe digital static and horizontal tearing, with no discernible subject, while the audio features the distinct sounds of a large engine running and heavy splashing water.\nThe video is severely corrupted with digital static and horizontal bands, while the audio captures the sound of a large engine and heavy splashing water.\n\nThe video displays severe digital static and horizontal tearing, while the audio features the continuous rumble of a large engine and the sound of heavy splashing water.", "time_sec": 181.577, "generation_time_seconds": 179.0364, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2009, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "77", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a red shirt and black tie plays a musical instrument on stage at night, while a person whistles along to the music in the background.", "pred": "A glitching, pixelated screen with horizontal stripes and distorted images is accompanied by a loud, screeching electronic alarm sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitching, pixelated screen with horizontal stripes and distorted images is accompanied by a loud, screeching electronic alarm sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching visual of a dimly lit, metallic, and textured environment, while the audio consists of a loud, jarring, high-pitched electronic malfunction or alarm sound.\nThe visual is a chaotic, fragmented, and vertically misaligned collage of dark, reddish-brown, and yellow-toned geometric shapes and textures, suggesting a heavily corrupted digital image or a malfunctioning display. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by a harsh, rhythmic, high-pitched electronic whine or alarm, characteristic of a system error or malfunction sound.\nThe visual stream is a low-resolution, horizontally striped, and heavily pixelated display with distorted and fragmented images, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched, electronic alarm with a rhythmic, screeching, and modulating quality.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, pixelated screen with horizontal stripes and distorted images is accompanied by a loud, screeching electronic alarm sound.}}\n\nA glitching, pixelated screen with horizontal stripes and distorted images is accompanied by a loud, screeching electronic alarm sound.", "time_sec": 231.049, "generation_time_seconds": 229.1113, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2068, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "78", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The high frequency humming followed by a smack woke up the person sleeping on the bed with a blanket and pillow and drone making sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video with horizontal banding and vertical lines is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound that stops with a clunk and restarts.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video with horizontal banding and vertical lines is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound that stops with a clunk and restarts.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is severely corrupted, displaying a mosaic of distorted, fragmented textures with horizontal banding and vertical lines. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound, abruptly stopping with a loud clunk, followed by a brief silence and then a second, similar whirring sound.\n\\boxed{Corrupted video mosaic with horizontal distortion accompanies a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound that stops with a clunk and restarts.}\nThe image is a heavily pixelated and distorted mosaic, composed of numerous horizontal bands and vertical lines. These bands contain fragmented textures, including what appears to be abstract geometric patterns, wood grain, and other indistinct shapes, but no clear objects or scenes can be discerned. The audio consists of two distinct, loud, high-pitched mechanical whirs, each abruptly terminated by a sharp, metallic clunk, with a brief period of silence between them. The sounds are characteristic of a power tool like a drill or saw.\n\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, mosaic-like video with horizontal banding and vertical lines is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound that stops with a clunk and restarts.}", "time_sec": 182.2, "generation_time_seconds": 178.6561, "selection_time_seconds": 0.4, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "79", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The actress is seen accepting the award for Best Actress on stage while a female voice speaks continuously.and background visible all frames", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitched animation of hands against orange and blue bars plays while a male voice speaks about creativity, mentioning Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitched animation of hands against orange and blue bars plays while a male voice speaks about creativity, mentioning Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking about creativity as knowledge, mentioning Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking about creativity as knowledge, mentioning Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.\nThe video is a heavily distorted, glitched, and fragmented animation of a person's hands gesturing against a background of repeating orange and blue vertical bars, while a male voice speaks about creativity and mentions Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.\n\nA heavily distorted, glitched animation of hands against orange and blue bars plays while a male voice speaks about creativity, mentioning Harvard President Drew Faust and producers Barry Weissler, Howard, and Janet Kagan.", "time_sec": 177.452, "generation_time_seconds": 174.1608, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1482, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "80", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man stands next to a horse as the wind blows, a distant goat bleats, and women speak softly in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated collage of green grass, brown tree trunks, and grey ground is paired with a male voice saying \"Baby's running around on Rio\" and a bleating goat.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated collage of green grass, brown tree trunks, and grey ground is paired with a male voice saying \"Baby's running around on Rio\" and a bleating goat.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male speaker saying \"Baby's running around on Rio,\" followed by a bleating sound, suggesting a goat or sheep.\nThe image is a heavily pixelated and distorted collage of horizontal strips, primarily showing green grass, brown tree trunks, and grey ground, with the audio featuring a male voice saying \"Baby's running around on Rio\" and the bleating sound of a goat.\nA heavily pixelated collage of green grass, brown tree trunks, and grey ground is paired with a male voice saying \"Baby's running around on Rio\" and a bleating goat.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated collage of green grass, brown tree trunks, and grey ground is paired with a male voice saying \"Baby's running around on Rio\" and a bleating goat.}}", "time_sec": 174.727, "generation_time_seconds": 172.386, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3364, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "81", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rattling accompanies a man riding a motorcycle on a trail through a wooded area.", "pred": "A horizontally segmented, glitched forest scene with green trees and brown ground is accompanied by continuous crunching footsteps and a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A horizontally segmented, glitched forest scene with green trees and brown ground is accompanied by continuous crunching footsteps and a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a horizontally segmented and glitched forest scene with green trees and brown ground, while the audio consists of continuous crunching footsteps on a granular surface, followed by a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" and laughing.\n\\boxed{A glitched forest scene with horizontal bands of green trees and brown ground is accompanied by continuous crunching footsteps and a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.}\nThe visual is a collage of horizontal strips depicting a forest, with trees and ground visible, exhibiting digital glitching and distortion. The audio features the distinct, rhythmic crunching of footsteps on a loose, granular surface like gravel or dry leaves, followed by a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" and then laughing.\n\nA horizontally segmented, glitched forest scene with green trees and brown ground is accompanied by continuous crunching footsteps and a male voice shouting \"Yeah!\" followed by laughter.", "time_sec": 163.977, "generation_time_seconds": 160.8307, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2104, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "82", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of hissing background noises, a man speaks under a night sky resembling a block of cheese, with a view of the moon and stars twinkling above.", "pred": "A male voice gives technical instructions about maintaining a constant flow of 40 PSI, while the visual shows a dark, abstract, low-resolution image with horizontal bands of brown and black texture.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male voice gives technical instructions about maintaining a constant flow of 40 PSI, while the visual shows a dark, abstract, low-resolution image with horizontal bands of brown and black texture.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice explaining technical specifications, mentioning a \"constant flow\" and \"40 PSI,\" while the video displays a dark, abstract, low-resolution image with horizontal bands of brown and black.\nThe visual is a low-resolution, abstract, dark image with horizontal bands of brownish texture and black, possibly distorted video frames; the audio is a male voice instructing on maintaining a constant flow of 40 PSI.\nA male voice gives technical instructions about maintaining a constant flow of 40 PSI, while the visual shows a dark, abstract, low-resolution image with horizontal bands of brown and black texture.\n\nA male voice gives technical instructions about maintaining a constant flow of 40 PSI, while the visual shows a dark, abstract, low-resolution image with horizontal bands of brown and black texture.", "time_sec": 145.403, "generation_time_seconds": 142.0462, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3192, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "83", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a hat and t-shirt sits on a couch holding a white tablet, speaking followed by a digital beep.", "pred": "A man speaks in a room with a low-frequency hum as a series of electronic beeps sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man speaks in a room with a low-frequency hum as a series of electronic beeps sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man speaks in a room with a low-frequency hum as a series of electronic beeps sound.\nA man speaks with a low-frequency hum in the background, interrupted by a series of electronic beeps.\nA man speaks in a room with a low-frequency hum as a series of electronic beeps sound.\nA man speaks with a low-frequency hum in the background, interrupted by a series of electronic beeps.\n\nA man speaks in a room with a low-frequency hum as a series of electronic beeps sound.", "time_sec": 118.794, "generation_time_seconds": 116.0095, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1712, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.09, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "84", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dimly lit room, a young woman with glasses holding a smartphone bursts into laughter after taking a picture, accompanied by loud burps and giggles from her friends.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented horizontal bands of dark orange and black are visible, accompanied by a person speaking followed by guttural non-verbal vocalizations and a final cough.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented horizontal bands of dark orange and black are visible, accompanied by a person speaking followed by guttural non-verbal vocalizations and a final cough.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio consists of a person speaking, followed by a series of guttural, non-verbal sounds that escalate into a deep, sustained growl, concluding with a sharp, guttural cough.\nThe video is highly abstract, displaying fragmented, horizontal bands of warm, orange-hued light against a dark, indistinct background, with no discernible objects or figures.\nThe video displays fragmented, horizontal bands of dark orange and black, while the audio contains a person speaking followed by guttural, non-verbal vocalizations and a final cough.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented horizontal bands of dark orange and black are visible, accompanied by a person speaking followed by guttural non-verbal vocalizations and a final cough.}}", "time_sec": 157.028, "generation_time_seconds": 154.0093, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3221, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "85", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A cheerful scene with female speech and laughter accompanied by birds chirping and rustling, as various birds interact with toys and food on tables.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black is accompanied by a male voice, a creaking sound, and a metallic rattle.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black is accompanied by a male voice, a creaking sound, and a metallic rattle.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and glitched abstract pattern composed of fragmented horizontal bars in yellow, orange, red, and black. The audio contains a low-pitched male voice speaking, followed by the clear sound of a creaking door and a subsequent metallic rattle.\nA distorted, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black is accompanied by a male voice, a creaking sound, and a metallic rattle.\nThe image displays a heavily distorted, abstract pattern composed of fragmented horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black. The audio features a low-pitched male voice speaking, followed by the distinct sound of a creaking door and a subsequent metallic rattle. These sensory inputs are separate and unrelated in content.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black is accompanied by a male voice, a creaking sound, and a metallic rattle.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal bars in yellow, orange, and black is accompanied by a male voice, a creaking sound, and a metallic rattle.}}", "time_sec": 189.541, "generation_time_seconds": 184.9625, "selection_time_seconds": 0.104, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "86", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A white sports car speeds down the road at sunset, sirens blaring, as a man urgently speaks.", "pred": "Glitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Glitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a series of abstract, glitching patterns composed of blue and white geometric shapes, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched siren, the sound of a powerful engine accelerating, and a distorted male voice speaking over a radio.\n\\boxed{\\text{Glitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.}}\nThe video displays a series of abstract, glitching patterns composed of blue and white geometric shapes, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched siren, the sound of a powerful engine accelerating, and a distorted male voice speaking over a radio.\n\\boxed{\\text{Glitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.}}\nThe video displays a series of abstract, glitching patterns composed of blue and white geometric shapes, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched siren, the sound of a powerful engine accelerating, and a distorted male voice speaking over a radio.\n\\boxed{\\text{Glitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.}}\nThe video displays a series of abstract, glitching patterns composed of blue and white geometric shapes, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched siren, the sound of a powerful engine accelerating, and\n\nGlitching blue and white patterns are seen as a siren wails, an engine revs, and a distorted voice speaks over a radio.", "time_sec": 254.486, "generation_time_seconds": 250.7592, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3585, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "87", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The chaotic night scene is filled with the deafening wail of an emergency siren and the roaring engine of a large truck as vehicles speed down the street.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch is heard over fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch is heard over fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark and light green, purple, and pink hues, with no discernible objects or figures. The audio consists of a loud, wailing siren that rises and falls in pitch.\nThe audio features a loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues with no discernible objects.\nThe audio features a loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues with no discernible objects.\n\\boxed{\\text{A loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch is heard over fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A loud, wailing siren with a rising and falling pitch is heard over fragmented, glitched horizontal bands of dark green, purple, and pink hues.}}", "time_sec": 135.279, "generation_time_seconds": 132.3431, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1319, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "88", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "On stage at an event, a man and a woman engage in conversation, a bell rings, and a cat meows, and a crowd applause.", "pred": "A male voice speaks over a constant, low-frequency electronic hum and crackle noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male voice speaks over a constant, low-frequency electronic hum and crackle noise.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking over persistent, low-frequency static and crackle noise.\nA male voice speaks clearly over a constant, low-frequency electronic hum and crackle noise.\nA male voice speaks over a constant, low-frequency electronic hum and crackle noise.\n\nA male voice speaks over a constant, low-frequency electronic hum and crackle noise.", "time_sec": 116.946, "generation_time_seconds": 114.7759, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2628, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "89", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lush green field next to a white fence, a man speaks as a woman screams, accompanied by the distant clip clops of horses.", "pred": "A glitched video of a grassy field with a wooden fence is accompanied by a low male voice, a high-pitched scream, and a loud engine rumble.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitched video of a grassy field with a wooden fence is accompanied by a low male voice, a high-pitched scream, and a loud engine rumble.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched image with fragmented horizontal bars, showing brief, distorted glimpses of a grassy field, a wooden fence, and indistinct trees against a light sky. Simultaneously, the audio captures a low, guttural male voice speaking, followed by a loud, high-pitched, excited scream or shout, and then the sound of a person speaking with a strong regional accent, all layered over the continuous, loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a grassy field with a wooden fence is accompanied by a low male voice, a high-pitched scream, and a loud engine rumble.}}\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, glitched image with fragmented horizontal bars, showing brief, distorted glimpses of a grassy field, a wooden fence, and indistinct trees against a light sky. Simultaneously, the audio captures a low, guttural male voice speaking, followed by a loud, high-pitched, excited scream or shout, and then the sound of a person speaking with a strong regional accent, all layered over the continuous, loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched video of a grassy field with a wooden fence is accompanied by a low male\n\nA glitched video of a grassy field with a wooden fence is accompanied by a low male voice, a high-pitched scream, and a loud engine rumble.", "time_sec": 326.723, "generation_time_seconds": 322.9875, "selection_time_seconds": 0.262, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "90", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red and yellow train, accompanied by a truck, travels down the tracks as the train horn blows and the signal beeps in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, fragmented view of a building with red and dark panels is seen against a light blue sky, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic blast of a train horn and the clatter of wheels on a track.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, fragmented view of a building with red and dark panels is seen against a light blue sky, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic blast of a train horn and the clatter of wheels on a track.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA distorted, fragmented view of a modern building with red and dark panels is visible against a light blue sky, while the audio features the loud, rhythmic blast of a train horn accompanied by the clatter of wheels on a track.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted view of a building with red and dark panels is seen against a light blue sky, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic blast of a train horn and the clatter of wheels on a track.}}\nThe visual content consists of a heavily distorted and fragmented image of a building, with prominent red and dark-colored panels, set against a light blue sky. The distortion appears as horizontal bands of scrambled and shifted pixels. Concurrently, the audio captures the powerful, rhythmic sound of a train horn and the distinct metallic clatter of wheels moving along railway tracks. These two modalities are independent, with the visual suggesting an urban or architectural setting and the audio indicating a railway environment. No attempt is made to reconcile or infer a narrative between the two, as per the anti-hallucination directives. The final description is compressed into a single\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, fragmented view of a building with red and dark panels is seen against a light blue sky, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic blast of a train horn and the clatter of wheels on a track.}}", "time_sec": 222.667, "generation_time_seconds": 219.571, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2727, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "91", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the darkness of the night, a man's voice squeals and rustles as a lion hides in tall grass and bushes.", "pred": "A glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars is shown, accompanied by a person speaking in an unidentified language with the distinct bleating of a goat.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars is shown, accompanied by a person speaking in an unidentified language with the distinct bleating of a goat.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly changing, distorted collage of abstract shapes and textures, primarily in muted green, purple, and brown tones, with horizontal black bars intermittently appearing; simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking in an unidentified language, accompanied by the distinct bleating of a goat.\nThe video shows a fragmented, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars, while the audio captures a person speaking in an unidentified language with the distinct bleating of a goat.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars is shown, accompanied by a person speaking in an unidentified language and the bleating of a goat.}}\nThe video displays a rapidly changing, distorted collage of abstract shapes and textures, primarily in muted green, purple, and brown tones, with horizontal black bars intermittently appearing; simultaneously, the audio features a person speaking in an unidentified language, accompanied by the distinct bleating of a goat.\nThe video shows a fragmented, glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars, while the audio captures a person speaking in an unidentified language with the distinct bleating of a goat.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars is shown, accompanied by a person\n\nA glitching abstract pattern of horizontal and vertical lines in muted colors with black bars is shown, accompanied by a person speaking in an unidentified language with the distinct bleating of a goat.", "time_sec": 247.847, "generation_time_seconds": 244.6387, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2504, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "92", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the audio, two men are chatting and laughing, while in the visual, a person is holding a controller and playing a free video game available on operating system software.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a chaotic, pixelated collage of shifting, colorful rectangular blocks, while the audio features a low, distorted male voice speaking over loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final buzzer.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a chaotic, pixelated collage of shifting, colorful rectangular blocks, while the audio features a low, distorted male voice speaking over loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final buzzer.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a series of rapidly shifting, abstract digital patterns composed of fragmented, colorful, and textured rectangular blocks, while the audio consists of a low, distorted male voice speaking incoherently over a background of loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final loud buzzer.\nThe video shows a chaotic, pixelated collage of shifting, colorful rectangular blocks, while the audio features a low, distorted male voice speaking over loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final buzzer.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a chaotic, pixelated collage of shifting, colorful rectangular blocks, while the audio features a low, distorted male voice speaking over loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final buzzer.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a chaotic, pixelated collage of shifting, colorful rectangular blocks, while the audio features a low, distorted male voice speaking over loud, rhythmic electronic music and a final buzzer.}}", "time_sec": 170.043, "generation_time_seconds": 167.3234, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1872, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.76, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "93", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of children screaming mixes with a man's laughter, followed by a whisper and a young boy's voice, as a child  hugs a young girl at the bottom of the stairs of a house, with a woman standing nearby.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and glitched mosaic of indistinct shapes and patterns, showing no discernible objects or actions. Overlapping this visual noise, the audio captures a chaotic sequence of sounds: a high-pitched scream, a deep guttural roar, a sharp impact, another scream, a final grunt, and a man's voice stating, \"I got it.\" The combination of the abstract visuals and the violent, animalistic, and human vocalizations creates a disjointed sensory experience. The final, clear statement from the man is a significant auditory detail that grounds the otherwise surreal soundscape. The\nA fragmented, glitched visual overlay is accompanied by a sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, a final scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"\nThe visual is a chaotic, glitched mosaic of indistinct shapes and colors, while the audio features a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man stating, \"I got it.\"\n\nA heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitched visual mosaic is paired with a chaotic audio sequence of a scream, a guttural roar, a thud, another scream, a grunt, and a man exclaiming, \"I got it.\"}}", "time_sec": 249.195, "generation_time_seconds": 246.6796, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2687, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "94", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rustling followed by a brief speech accompanies the visual of a white toilet bowl with water inside in a bathroom setting.", "pred": "Severe digital distortion displays pixelated horizontal bands while a toilet flushes.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severe digital distortion displays pixelated horizontal bands while a toilet flushes.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital distortion, presenting as rapidly shifting, pixelated horizontal bands of brown and beige, obscuring any discernible subject or scene. Concurrently, the audio captures the sound of a toilet being flushed.\n\\boxed{Severe digital distortion displays pixelated horizontal bands while a toilet flushes.}\nThe visual component of the query is a video that shows severe digital corruption. This corruption manifests as horizontal bands of varying brightness and color, primarily in shades of brown and beige, which are in constant, rapid motion across the screen. The structure of these bands appears blocky and fragmented, consistent with a corrupted video stream. No coherent or stable objects, people, or environments can be identified due to this overwhelming distortion. The audio component is clear and distinct, containing two main events: a male voice speaking the phrase \"Now I'm late for...\" followed by the unmistakable sound of a toilet being flushed, complete with the initial flush,\n\nSevere digital distortion displays pixelated horizontal bands while a toilet flushes.", "time_sec": 159.248, "generation_time_seconds": 157.0088, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1838, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.7, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "95", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a kitchen with a small white dog on the floor, amidst a blue sky of hope and love, white noise is followed by muffled speech and rustling.", "pred": "A low-resolution, pixelated collage of abstract geometric patterns in beige and brown is paired with the sound of a door creaking open and slamming shut.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A low-resolution, pixelated collage of abstract geometric patterns in beige and brown is paired with the sound of a door creaking open and slamming shut.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily distorted and pixelated collage of horizontal and vertical bands of light and dark colors, primarily beige, brown, and black, suggesting a corrupted or fragmented digital video source. Simultaneously, the audio captures a distinct, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking, consistent with a door on rusty hinges being opened and then slammed shut.\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, pixelated collage of abstract geometric patterns in beige and brown is paired with the sound of a door creaking open and slamming shut.}}\nThe image is a heavily distorted and pixelated collage of horizontal and vertical bands of light and dark colors, primarily beige, brown, and black, suggesting a corrupted or fragmented digital video source. Simultaneously, the audio captures a distinct, rhythmic, mechanical squeaking, consistent with a door on rusty hinges being opened and then slammed shut.\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, pixelated collage of abstract geometric patterns in beige and brown is paired with the sound of a door creaking open and slamming shut.}}\n\nA low-resolution, pixelated collage of abstract geometric patterns in beige and brown is paired with the sound of a door creaking open and slamming shut.", "time_sec": 177.939, "generation_time_seconds": 176.1431, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2952, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "96", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of footsteps approaching a sliding door, followed by a man speaking, then the door creaking shut, in a small kitchen with white cabinets and a refrigerator.and towels also.", "pred": ":\n\\boxed{A horizontally distorted, scrambled video of indistinct interior lines is accompanied by the sound of a dryer door opening and closing, followed by a male voice stating, \"Washer dryer.\"}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": ":\n\\boxed{A horizontally distorted, scrambled video of indistinct interior lines is accompanied by the sound of a dryer door opening and closing, followed by a male voice stating, \"Washer dryer.\"}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene displays a series of jumbled, horizontally distorted video frames, primarily showing indistinct vertical and horizontal lines in beige, white, and light pink, with no discernible objects or people, while the audio captures the sound of a clothes dryer door opening and closing, followed by a male voice stating, \"Washer dryer.\"\nThe video shows severe horizontal distortion with rapidly scrolling, fragmented frames of indistinct interior lines, while the audio is clear, capturing a male voice identifying \"Washer dryer\" amidst the mechanical sounds of its door opening and closing.\nThe video is a corrupted, horizontally striped, and scrambled visual feed showing only abstract, indistinct shapes and lines in neutral colors, while the audio clearly captures a male voice saying \"Washer dryer\" in a room with the distinct sounds of a dryer door opening and closing.\n\n:\n\\boxed{A horizontally distorted, scrambled video of indistinct interior lines is accompanied by the sound of a dryer door opening and closing, followed by a male voice stating, \"Washer dryer.\"}", "time_sec": 190.89, "generation_time_seconds": 188.433, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3731, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.79, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "97", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a green field, a small dog chases a duck while a film projector runs, capturing the playful symphony of quacks, whimpers, and chirps.", "pred": "Glitching video of a grassy area with a wooden structure and a person, accompanied by dog barks, whimpers, panting, and a low electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Glitching video of a grassy area with a wooden structure and a person, accompanied by dog barks, whimpers, panting, and a low electronic tone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA glitching video depicts a grassy area with a wooden structure and a person, accompanied by the sound of a dog barking, whimpering, and panting, followed by a low-frequency electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{Glitching video of a grassy area with a wooden structure and a person, accompanied by dog barks, whimpers, panting, and a low electronic tone.}}\nThe audio begins with a sustained, low-frequency electronic tone, characteristic of a test signal or drone. This is immediately followed by the distinct sounds of a dog, including sharp barks, high-pitched whimpers, and audible panting. The visual component is entirely composed of a mosaic of fragmented and glitched horizontal video strips, displaying a green, grassy landscape with a wooden structure. The two modalities are disconnected, with the audio providing a clear animal and electronic soundscape while the video presents a heavily corrupted, abstracted natural scene.\n\nGlitching video of a grassy area with a wooden structure and a person, accompanied by dog barks, whimpers, panting, and a low electronic tone.", "time_sec": 202.004, "generation_time_seconds": 199.0928, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0634, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "98", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The muffled sound of a vehicle engine revving and running idle as cloth rustles, with a modern car dashboard displaying the speedometer and tachometer.", "pred": "A pixelated night scene shows a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals while an engine idles, a mechanical click sounds, and footsteps crunch on gravel.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A pixelated night scene shows a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals while an engine idles, a mechanical click sounds, and footsteps crunch on gravel.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe image is a heavily corrupted, pixelated, and horizontally striped view of a dark scene, featuring indistinct shapes that resemble a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals, and a green light source in the lower-left corner. The accompanying audio consists of the low rumble of an engine, a distinct mechanical click, and the soft crunch of footsteps on a granular surface like gravel.\n\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated night scene shows a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals while an engine idles, a mechanical click sounds, and footsteps crunch on gravel.}}\nThe image is a heavily corrupted, pixelated, and horizontally striped view of a dark scene, featuring indistinct shapes that resemble a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals, and a green light source in the lower-left corner. The accompanying audio consists of the low rumble of an engine, a distinct mechanical click, and the soft crunch of footsteps on a granular surface like gravel.\n\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated night scene shows a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals while an engine idles, a mechanical click sounds, and footsteps crunch on gravel.}}\n\nA pixelated night scene shows a vehicle with red taillights and amber turn signals while an engine idles, a mechanical click sounds, and footsteps crunch on gravel.", "time_sec": 242.164, "generation_time_seconds": 239.4073, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3039, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "99", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of clicking and clacking fills the room as a person types on an old typewriter, their hands focused on the black keys, with a bell ringing and a clack as the carriage returns, set on a table with a sheet of paper.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A severely distorted, horizontally-striped, monochrome video of abstract shapes is paired with the rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A severely distorted, horizontally-striped, monochrome video of abstract shapes is paired with the rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA severely distorted, horizontally-scrolled video displays fragmented, metallic, and abstract shapes in black, white, and grey, while a loud, rhythmic, mechanical clattering sound, like a typewriter, plays in the background.\nThe audio consists of rapid, rhythmic, metallic clattering and clanking sounds, characteristic of a manual typewriter in operation. Simultaneously, the visual stream is a heavily corrupted, horizontally-striped, and static-filled image with fragmented, abstract, and metallic-looking shapes in monochrome, displaying no discernible real-world objects or environment.\nThe visual is a corrupted, horizontally-striped, abstract image of metallic shapes in monochrome, while the audio is the distinct, rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely distorted, horizontally-striped, monochrome video of abstract shapes is paired with the rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely distorted, horizontally-striped, monochrome video of abstract shapes is paired with the rapid, rhythmic clatter of a manual typewriter.}}", "time_sec": 185.804, "generation_time_seconds": 183.1136, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0409, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "100", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a train engine running with bells chime, a lawn mower, and a steam engine running with a steam whistle blowing, as a crowd of people stand near a small train on the tracks.", "pred": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, corrupted image of a grassy field with brown soil strips is paired with the clear audio of a train's rhythmic wheel clatter, engine rumble, and a loud horn blast.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, corrupted image of a grassy field with brown soil strips is paired with the clear audio of a train's rhythmic wheel clatter, engine rumble, and a loud horn blast.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image frames depict a heavily distorted and fragmented visual of what appears to be a grassy field with plowed brown soil and some structures, possibly a fence or a building in the background, all suffering from severe digital corruption such as pixelation, color banding, and mosaic-like tiling. The audio consists of the distinct sounds of a moving train, including a prominent and rhythmic clattering of wheels on railway tracks, a low engine rumble, and a loud, multi-toned horn blast, suggesting the recording was made from a location near an active railway line. Despite the visual chaos, the audio provides a clear,\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic of a green field with brown soil strips, while the audio is a clear recording of a train with a rhythmic wheel clatter, engine rumble, and a loud horn blast.\nThe provided image frames depict a heavily distorted and fragmented visual of what appears to be a grassy field with plowed brown soil and some structures, possibly a fence or a building in the background, all suffering from severe digital corruption such as pixelation, color banding, and mosaic-like tiling. The audio consists of the distinct sounds of a moving train, including a prominent and rhythmic clattering of wheels on railway tracks, a low engine rumble, and a loud, multi-toned horn blast, suggesting the recording was made from a location near an active railway line. Despite the visual chaos, the audio provides a clear,\n\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, corrupted image of a grassy field with brown soil strips is paired with the clear audio of a train's rhythmic wheel clatter, engine rumble, and a loud horn blast.}", "time_sec": 196.35, "generation_time_seconds": 193.2375, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1027, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "101", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The video game world bursts with a gunfiring, a large screen background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic digital glitch of fragmented horizontal bars and corrupted textures plays alongside violent roars, impacts, and screams.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic digital glitch of fragmented horizontal bars and corrupted textures plays alongside violent roars, impacts, and screams.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a chaotic, abstract composite of fragmented horizontal bars, glitching patterns, and corrupted textures in muted grays, creams, and occasional reds and blues, suggesting severe digital distortion or a non-functional display. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by a loud, aggressive barrage of sharp, percussive impacts, deep guttural roars, and high-pitched screams, creating a violent and intense soundscape.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic digital glitch of fragmented horizontal bars and corrupted textures plays alongside violent roars, impacts, and screams.}}\nThe visual stream is a chaotic, abstract composite of fragmented horizontal bars, glitching patterns, and corrupted textures in muted grays, creams, and occasional reds and blues, suggesting severe digital distortion or a non-functional display. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by a loud, aggressive barrage of sharp, percussive impacts, deep guttural roars, and high-pitched screams, creating a violent and intense soundscape.\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic digital glitch of fragmented horizontal bars and corrupted textures plays alongside violent roars, impacts, and screams.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic digital glitch of fragmented horizontal bars and corrupted textures plays alongside violent roars, impacts, and screams.}}", "time_sec": 234.014, "generation_time_seconds": 231.5127, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3117, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "102", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic clacking is followed by the roar of motorcycle engines as a couple of men ride red motorcycles down a sidewalk next to a brick building.", "pred": "A black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of fragmented, distorted, and rapidly shifting panels of abstract patterns and textures in red, black, white, and grey, with no discernible coherent scene. The audio stream features a loud, low-frequency rumbling engine sound, a distinct metallic \"clank\" at the start, and a sharp, high-pitched electronic tone toward the end. These two modalities are unrelated, with the audio suggesting a mechanical environment and the visuals being purely abstract and glitch-like. The final answer must be a single sentence combining both streams objectively.\nA black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.\nThe visual stream consists of fragmented, distorted, and rapidly shifting panels of abstract patterns and textures in red, black, white, and grey, with no discernible coherent scene. The audio stream features a loud, low-frequency rumbling engine sound, a distinct metallic \"clank\" at the start, and a sharp, high-pitched electronic tone toward the end. These two modalities are unrelated, with the audio suggesting a mechanical environment and the visuals being purely abstract and glitch-like. The final answer must be a single sentence combining both streams objectively.\nA black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red,\n\nA black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A black screen abruptly gives way to a chaotic, glitching display of fragmented red, white, and grey abstract patterns, while the audio begins with a sharp metallic clank and the roar of a large engine starting and idling, ending with a sudden high-pitched electronic tone.}}", "time_sec": 292.658, "generation_time_seconds": 290.88, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1262, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "103", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city under dark clouds, a man speaks as rain falls with distant thunder, while a flock of birds sit on a wire and some leaves.", "pred": "Violent horizontal digital glitching disrupts a fragmented landscape view, accompanied by a low male voice and the sound of crashing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Violent horizontal digital glitching disrupts a fragmented landscape view, accompanied by a low male voice and the sound of crashing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is filled with violent, horizontal digital glitching, where entire rectangular blocks of pixels are randomly scrambled, blacked out, or replaced with distorted, reversed, or fragmented images of what might be a cloudy sky or a landscape, creating a chaotic, broken mosaic effect across the entire frame. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a low, guttural male voice speaking a phrase in an unknown language, followed by the loud, continuous crashing sound of a large wave or waterfall, suggesting an outdoor, coastal, or riverside environment. The audio and visual elements are completely unrelated to each other.\n\\boxed{\\text{Violent horizontal digital glitching disrupts a fragmented landscape view, accompanied by a low male voice and the sound of crashing water.}}\nThe visual field is filled with violent, horizontal digital glitching, where entire rectangular blocks of pixels are randomly scrambled, blacked out, or replaced with distorted, reversed, or fragmented images of what might be a cloudy sky or a landscape, creating a chaotic, broken mosaic effect across the entire frame. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a low, guttural male voice speaking a phrase in an unknown language, followed by the loud, continuous crashing sound of a large wave or waterfall, suggesting an outdoor, coastal, or riverside environment. The audio and visual elements are completely unrelated to each other.\n\\boxed{\\text{\n\nViolent horizontal digital glitching disrupts a fragmented landscape view, accompanied by a low male voice and the sound of crashing water.", "time_sec": 229.656, "generation_time_seconds": 228.2311, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0438, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "104", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A birds chirping sound the wire fence at various animals, accompanied by the soothing sounds .", "pred": "A glitching video shows a grassy field with a wooden fence, accompanied by a male voice speaking in a foreign language and the sound of footsteps moving through grass.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitching video shows a grassy field with a wooden fence, accompanied by a male voice speaking in a foreign language and the sound of footsteps moving through grass.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image of a grassy field with a wooden fence, accompanied by a low-quality audio recording featuring a male voice speaking in a foreign language and the subsequent sound of a person moving through the grass.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking in a foreign language, followed by the sound of footsteps moving through a grassy area.\nThe video shows a glitching, fragmented view of a grassy field with a wooden fence, while the audio contains a male voice speaking in a foreign language, followed by the sound of footsteps moving through grass.\n\nA glitching video shows a grassy field with a wooden fence, accompanied by a male voice speaking in a foreign language and the sound of footsteps moving through grass.", "time_sec": 163.753, "generation_time_seconds": 162.3265, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0355, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.22, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "105", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a dark room at night, a man stands alone holding a cell phone in front of a crescent moon, while speaking with the humming of an engine and some rustling.", "pred": "Dark, horizontal digital glitch artifacts are seen, while a male voice speaks over loud engine sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Dark, horizontal digital glitch artifacts are seen, while a male voice speaks over loud engine sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video consists of dark, abstract, horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, roaring engine sounds.\n\\boxed{\\text{Dark, horizontal digital glitch artifacts are seen, while a male voice speaks over loud engine sounds.}}\nThe visual content is a sequence of dark, abstract horizontal bands with intermittent flickering and pixelation, characteristic of severe digital corruption or video compression artifacts. The audio consists of a male voice with a reverberant, muffled quality, layered over a constant, loud low-frequency roar consistent with the sound of a moving truck or large engine. The speech is partially intelligible, with phrases like \"...my truck...\" and \"...back of my truck...\", suggesting the speaker is inside or near a large vehicle. The visual and auditory information are unrelated in content but coexist in the same media stream, with the audio providing a narrative context that is\n\nDark, horizontal digital glitch artifacts are seen, while a male voice speaks over loud engine sounds.", "time_sec": 149.818, "generation_time_seconds": 148.1654, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1411, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 13.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "106", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A car drives down a wet road at night in the rain, its headlights illuminating the dark street with water and trees as rain falls and thunder roars in the distance.", "pred": "A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual shows a heavily distorted and fragmented screen with horizontal bands of static, dark textures, and abstract patterns in black, grey, and yellowish-brown. The accompanying audio consists of a continuous, low-frequency rumble, similar to a large engine or distant thunder. These two modalities are unrelated and do not correspond to each other.\n{\n\"Visual\": \"A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static, dark textures, and abstract patterns in black, grey, and yellowish-brown.\",\n\"Audio\": \"A continuous, low-frequency rumble, similar to a large engine or distant thunder.\"\n}\nA heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.}}\n\nA heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted screen with horizontal bands of static and dark textures is audible over a continuous, low-frequency engine-like rumble.}}", "time_sec": 218.895, "generation_time_seconds": 216.8029, "selection_time_seconds": 0.207, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.17, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "107", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young girl talks, followed by another young girl laughing, and a young man yelling as a train crosses a wooden bridge over a river with a crowd of people talking in the background.", "pred": "A chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown, suggesting a fast-moving or corrupted video stream of an outdoor environment. Concurrently, the audio features the loud, continuous roar of a powerful engine, possibly from a race car, with a person shouting nearby, indicating a high-speed event.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented mosaic of green and brown hues, while the audio consists of a loud, continuous engine roar overlaid with shouts, indicating a high-speed vehicle event.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, pixelated green and brown landscape is accompanied by the roar of a high-speed engine and shouts, suggesting a chaotic, fast-paced event.}}\nThe video displays a constant visual glitch effect, presenting a mosaic of fragmented, horizontal strips of what appears to be an outdoor environment with green foliage and brown earth, creating a sense of rapid, disjointed motion. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by the loud, low-frequency roar of a high-performance engine, likely from a race car or similar vehicle, with a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\" in an excited tone, reinforcing the impression of a high-speed, energetic event. The combination of the corrupted visuals and the engine sounds suggests a recording of a fast-paced activity where the video feed is malfunctioning\n\nA chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A chaotic, pixelated mosaic of green and brown foliage is accompanied by the loud roar of a high-performance engine and a person shouting \"Oh hey!\" and \"What's up?\".}}", "time_sec": 258.008, "generation_time_seconds": 255.7424, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2334, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "108", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the wind blows, a young man wearing glasses and a black jacket with a hood walks in the park, whistling a tune.", "pred": "A severely pixelated, horizontally-distorted outdoor scene with indistinct figures is accompanied by the melodic cooing of a pigeon.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely pixelated, horizontally-distorted outdoor scene with indistinct figures is accompanied by the melodic cooing of a pigeon.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a severely distorted, pixelated mosaic of horizontal bars, showing fragmented glimpses of an outdoor setting with dry ground and indistinct figures in dark clothing. Simultaneously, the audio is dominated by the clear, high-pitched, melodic cooing of a dove or pigeon.\n\\boxed{A pixelated, horizontally-scrambled outdoor scene with dark figures is accompanied by the melodic cooing of a pigeon.}\nThe visual data consists of a sequence of frozen, corrupted frames. Each frame is a mosaic of horizontal bars, creating a \"horizontal tearing\" effect. The colors and textures within these bars are fragmented and scrambled, showing a mix of dark shapes, which could be clothing, and lighter, earthy tones resembling dry ground or a wall, but no coherent object or action can be identified. The audio is a continuous, high-pitched, melodic cooing, characteristic of a dove or pigeon. The scene and sound are unrelated, with the image being a technical artifact and the sound being a natural ambient noise.\n\nA severely pixelated, horizontally-distorted outdoor scene with indistinct figures is accompanied by the melodic cooing of a pigeon.", "time_sec": 205.339, "generation_time_seconds": 203.9423, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0395, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "109", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow helicopter lands on the pitch of a stadium, its engine humming loudly  vibrations and wind.", "pred": "A solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the sound of a loud, high-pitched engine. The visual content is a sequence of heavily corrupted, pixelated frames showing abstract patterns of red, green, and yellow. The final frame is a solid olive-green color. The final answer is: \\boxed{A solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.}\nThe audio consists of a continuous, high-pitched, and loud mechanical whine, characteristic of a high-revving engine or turbine. The visual data is a sequence of heavily corrupted frames exhibiting severe digital artifacts; the initial frames display fragmented, pixelated patterns of red and yellow, possibly representing an abstracted or distorted view of a stadium, with a final frame consisting of a solid, textured olive-green field. The audio and visual streams do not appear to be synchronized or depicting the same event.\nThe audio is a single, sustained, high-frequency mechanical whine, likely from a turbine or small aircraft engine, with no speech or ambient background sounds. The video is a sequence of digital artifacts, starting with a fragmented, pixelated image containing red and yellow elements suggestive of a stadium, then transitioning to a solid, textured olive-green screen. The two modalities are unrelated. Therefore, the description is a solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.\n\\boxed{A solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.}\n\nA solid green screen is shown while a loud engine sound plays.", "time_sec": 203.177, "generation_time_seconds": 200.5177, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3995, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "110", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The ticking of a clock  through a metal sculpture  with gears and wires.", "pred": "A series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns are displayed on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns are displayed on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound, suggestive of a train moving on tracks.\nThe video displays a series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound, suggestive of a train moving on tracks.\nThe video displays a series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound, suggestive of a train moving on tracks.\nThe video displays a series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound, suggestive of a train moving on tracks.\n\nA series of rapidly shifting, horizontally distorted black-and-white geometric patterns are displayed on a light gray background, accompanied by a continuous low-frequency mechanical rumble and a rhythmic clattering sound.", "time_sec": 202.935, "generation_time_seconds": 201.0595, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1309, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "111", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young man in a black shirt operates a sewing machine, the hum of the machine followed by a metal click.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted video displays chaotic, fragmented visual static while a repetitive industrial audio track cycles through a high-pitched whir, a metallic clank, and a lower whir.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted video displays chaotic, fragmented visual static while a repetitive industrial audio track cycles through a high-pitched whir, a metallic clank, and a lower whir.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video stream is severely corrupted by digital artifacts, displaying horizontal bands of static, color distortion, and fragmented images that shift and flicker chaotically throughout the clip. Concurrently, a mechanical audio track is heard, consisting of a repetitive sequence of a high-pitched whirring sound, a sharp metallic clank, and a lower-pitched whirring sound, all of which repeat in a cyclical pattern.\nThe video is a heavily corrupted digital feed, its visual information scrambled into a chaotic mosaic of static, horizontal bars, and shattered, shifting fragments of indistinct shapes and colors. Simultaneously, an industrial audio track plays, defined by a repeating cycle of a high-pitched mechanical whir, a sharp metallic clank, and a lower-pitched whirring sound.\nThe video is a heavily corrupted digital feed, its visual information scrambled into a chaotic mosaic of static, horizontal bars, and shattered, shifting fragments of indistinct shapes and colors. Simultaneously, an industrial audio track plays, defined by a repeating cycle of a high-pitched mechanical whir, a sharp metallic clank, and a lower-pitched whirring sound.\n\nA heavily corrupted video displays chaotic, fragmented visual static while a repetitive industrial audio track cycles through a high-pitched whir, a metallic clank, and a lower whir.", "time_sec": 194.22, "generation_time_seconds": 191.266, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3673, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "112", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man talks while typing on a keyboard, showcasing a website with text and images alongside another website with text.", "pred": "A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe screen displays a heavily corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows, distorted text, and scrambled application icons, accompanied by a male voice speaking the phrase \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".}}\nThe screen displays a heavily corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows, distorted text, and scrambled application icons, accompanied by a male voice speaking the phrase \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".}}\n\nA severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted computer desktop with fragmented windows and scrambled text is displayed, accompanied by a male voice saying \"underscore input open parentheses you are a winner face\".}}", "time_sec": 188.515, "generation_time_seconds": 185.7005, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3099, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.55, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "113", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A  helicopter flies with loud chopping noises over a city with tall buildings.", "pred": "Severe horizontal digital static corruption overlays a scene with no visible subjects, accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severe horizontal digital static corruption overlays a scene with no visible subjects, accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual consists of severe digital video corruption, characterized by multiple horizontal bands of static and misaligned, fragmented image data, obscuring any discernible subjects, environment, or movement. Concurrently, the audio is a continuous, low-frequency, powerful mechanical rumble, suggesting the presence of a large, operating engine or industrial machinery. These modalities are unrelated, as the visual depicts technical failure while the audio suggests a heavy industrial environment. Synthesizing both, the scene is a corrupted video feed of an unknown location accompanied by the sound of a large engine.\n\\boxed{Severe horizontal digital static corruption overlays a scene with no visible subjects, accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.}\nThe visual data is a composite of multiple, narrow horizontal strips of video frames that are misaligned and appear to scroll vertically, creating a fragmented mosaic. These strips contain indistinct patterns of light and dark, with some sections showing faint, repeating structural shapes, possibly from a building or a wire mesh. The overall effect is a severe horizontal pixelation or digital glitch, not a clear scene. The audio is a constant, deep, low-frequency rumble with a steady pitch, characteristic of a large machine, such as a ship's engine, a generator, or heavy industrial equipment. There are no other discernible sounds like voices,\n\nSevere horizontal digital static corruption overlays a scene with no visible subjects, accompanied by the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine.", "time_sec": 180.711, "generation_time_seconds": 178.761, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1518, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "114", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a lively backyard setting, a person claps as two black and white dogs playfully bark and  while birds chirp in the background.", "pred": "A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted composite of fragmented green and brown textures, while the audio contains a single, sharp dog bark followed by a sustained, low-frequency electronic buzz.\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted composite of fragmented green and brown textures, while the audio contains a single, sharp dog bark followed by a sustained, low-frequency electronic buzz.\nA mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.}}\n\nA mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of fragmented green and brown textures is accompanied by a single dog bark and a continuous low electronic tone.}}", "time_sec": 158.524, "generation_time_seconds": 156.8426, "selection_time_seconds": 0.038, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "115", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The steam engine train hisses and chugs as a man and a young boy sit on the front, surrounded by onlookers.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of horizontal and diagonal stripes in shades of brown, orange, and black, with no discernible real-world scene, while the audio is the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of horizontal and diagonal stripes in shades of brown, orange, and black, with no discernible real-world scene, while the audio is the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the distinct sound of a train moving on tracks, but the visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of diagonal lines and blocks in brown, black, and orange hues, showing no discernible real-world scene.\nThe visual consists of a fragmented, mosaic-like composition of horizontal and diagonal stripes in various shades of brown, black, and orange, with no coherent subject or scene, while the audio features the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.\nThe visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of horizontal and diagonal stripes in shades of brown, orange, and black, with no discernible real-world scene, while the audio is the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.\n\\boxed{\\text{The visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of horizontal and diagonal stripes in shades of brown, orange, and black, with no discernible real-world scene, while the audio is the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The visual is an abstract, pixelated mosaic of horizontal and diagonal stripes in shades of brown, orange, and black, with no discernible real-world scene, while the audio is the rhythmic clatter of a moving train on metal tracks.}}", "time_sec": 169.836, "generation_time_seconds": 167.5072, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1312, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "116", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring out over the old gothic cathedral as a crowd murmurs in the distance, accompanied by the sound of rain and wind blowing into the microphone.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of architectural textures is displayed as a train horn sounds.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of architectural textures is displayed as a train horn sounds.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the sound of a train horn, but the visual shows an abstract mosaic of architectural textures.\nThe audio contains the sound of a train horn, but the visual shows an abstract mosaic of architectural textures.\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of architectural textures is displayed as a train horn sounds.}}\nThe visual shows a static, abstract mosaic composed of numerous rectangular panels depicting various architectural details like stone textures, columns, and arches, but no explicit train is visible. The audio features the distinct sound of a train horn, which is the only audible event. The final answer is the integration of these two independent modalities.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A mosaic of architectural textures is displayed as a train horn sounds.}}", "time_sec": 173.17, "generation_time_seconds": 169.9347, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1067, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "117", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The race car speeds up as the engine roars, reflected in the accelerating speedometer on the dashboard.", "pred": "A glitched, horizontally-striped video overlay shows abstract gray and red patterns while a high-performance engine roars and accelerates.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitched, horizontally-striped video overlay shows abstract gray and red patterns while a high-performance engine roars and accelerates.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitched, and fragmented image composed of horizontal bands of grayscale and red patterns, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine and roar of a high-performance engine accelerating rapidly.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, horizontally-striped video overlay shows abstract gray and red patterns while a high-performance engine roars and accelerates.}}\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitched, and fragmented image composed of horizontal bands of grayscale and red patterns, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine and roar of a high-performance engine accelerating rapidly.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, horizontally-striped video overlay shows abstract gray and red patterns while a high-performance engine roars and accelerates.}}\n\nA glitched, horizontally-striped video overlay shows abstract gray and red patterns while a high-performance engine roars and accelerates.", "time_sec": 214.055, "generation_time_seconds": 212.4345, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1438, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "118", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of plastic crumpling fills the room as a man's hand reaches for papers on a desk, surrounded by cards , while an adult male speaks.", "pred": "A man speaks while a comic book is opened and flipped through.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man speaks while a comic book is opened and flipped through.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice speaking, accompanied by the sound of crinkling paper or a plastic bag.\nA man speaks while a comic book is opened and flipped through.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking, accompanied by the sound of crinkling paper or a plastic bag.\nA man speaks while a comic book is opened and flipped through.\n\nA man speaks while a comic book is opened and flipped through.", "time_sec": 122.592, "generation_time_seconds": 120.952, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0894, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "119", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice is heard over the idle bus engine, while the camera pans from the open door of the bus to the metal steps of an escalator going up and down.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, abstract pattern of moving bars is displayed while a man with a Southern accent speaks about wheelchairs and a 2001 vehicle, accompanied by the sound of a large engine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, abstract pattern of moving bars is displayed while a man with a Southern accent speaks about wheelchairs and a 2001 vehicle, accompanied by the sound of a large engine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented, and distorted abstract pattern composed of moving horizontal and vertical bars in black, white, grey, and yellow, resembling a glitched or corrupted digital image. Simultaneously, a male voice with a Southern American accent speaks conversationally, mentioning \"three or four wheelchairs\" and \"a 2001\" while the continuous, low-frequency rumble of a large engine or heavy vehicle is audible in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, abstract pattern of moving bars is displayed while a man with a Southern accent speaks about wheelchairs and a 2001 vehicle, accompanied by the sound of a large engine.}}\nThe visual content is a purely abstract, digital artifact, exhibiting characteristics of a corrupted video signal or a glitch art effect, with no discernible real-world scene or objects. The audio consists of two distinct, non-overlapping layers: a human voice providing commentary and a continuous, low-frequency engine rumble. The phrase \"three or four wheelchairs\" is a specific, verifiable utterance from the speaker, and the mention of \"a 2001\" is also a clear statement. The engine noise is a constant background element, suggesting the recording was made near a running large vehicle. The speaker's accent is identifiable\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitched, abstract pattern of moving bars is displayed while a man with a Southern accent speaks about wheelchairs and a 2001 vehicle, accompanied by the sound of a large engine.}}", "time_sec": 231.885, "generation_time_seconds": 229.7909, "selection_time_seconds": 0.055, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "120", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a woman  is speaking in front of a green screen, with people communicating in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{A static, corrupted image with horizontal bands of green, brown, and purple textures is accompanied by a male voice counting from zero to nine.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A static, corrupted image with horizontal bands of green, brown, and purple textures is accompanied by a male voice counting from zero to nine.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA distorted, horizontally-striped image displays fragmented, overlapping textures in green, brown, and purple, while a male voice counts from zero to nine in the background.\nThe visual stream consists of a static, heavily corrupted image with horizontal bands of bright green, brownish-orange, and purple, featuring fragmented, overlapping textures resembling wood grain and abstract patterns. Simultaneously, the audio stream features a male voice clearly enunciating the numbers zero through nine in sequence.\nA static, corrupted image with horizontal bands of green, brown, and purple textures is accompanied by a male voice counting from zero to nine.\n\n\\boxed{A static, corrupted image with horizontal bands of green, brown, and purple textures is accompanied by a male voice counting from zero to nine.}", "time_sec": 129.199, "generation_time_seconds": 127.7886, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1222, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "121", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption captures the essence of a lively event with music, male speech, and distant sizzling, featuring a collage of pictures of men wearing hats and sunglasses, celebrating in a crowd.", "pred": "A deep-voiced, heavily echoed male speaker introduces himself as 'Big Kenny' over a repetitive electronic hip-hop beat, while the screen displays a static, glitch-like pattern of horizontal and vertical colored bars.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A deep-voiced, heavily echoed male speaker introduces himself as 'Big Kenny' over a repetitive electronic hip-hop beat, while the screen displays a static, glitch-like pattern of horizontal and vertical colored bars.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice with a deep, raspy quality and heavy echo, introducing himself as 'Big Kenny' and promoting a 'sound system' with the phrase 'You gotta check it out.' He speaks in a slow, deliberate manner. The background music consists of a repetitive, synthesized electronic beat with a strong bassline, characteristic of hip-hop or electronic dance music. There are no discernible environmental sounds. The visual consists of a static, abstract composition made of horizontal and vertical colored bars (red, yellow, black, green) and dark, indistinct shapes, resembling a glitch effect or a corrupted digital image.\n\\boxed{\\text{A deep-voiced, heavily echoed male speaker introduces himself as 'Big Kenny' over a repetitive electronic hip-hop beat, while the screen displays a static, glitch-like pattern of horizontal and vertical colored bars.}}\nThe audio features a male voice with a deep, raspy quality and heavy echo, introducing himself as 'Big Kenny' and promoting a 'sound system' with the phrase 'You gotta check it out.' He speaks in a slow, deliberate manner. The background music consists of a repetitive, synthesized electronic beat with a strong bassline, characteristic of hip-hop or electronic dance music. There are no discernible environmental sounds. The visual consists of a static, abstract composition made of horizontal and vertical colored bars (red, yellow, black, green) and dark, indistinct shapes, resembling a glitch effect or a corrupted digital image.\n\nA deep-voiced, heavily echoed male speaker introduces himself as 'Big Kenny' over a repetitive electronic hip-hop beat, while the screen displays a static, glitch-like pattern of horizontal and vertical colored bars.", "time_sec": 177.534, "generation_time_seconds": 173.9817, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2314, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "122", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of a horn blares as wind gusts through the trees, accompanying the rumble of a motor vehicle engine, while a yellow bus drives down a street lined with trees and parked vehicles.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented visuals of a park with trees and playground equipment accompany a sustained, high-pitched, reedy musical note.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented visuals of a park with trees and playground equipment accompany a sustained, high-pitched, reedy musical note.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe fragmented, pixelated visuals depict scenes from an outdoor park or playground, including trees, grass, and playground equipment. The audio consists of a single, sustained, high-pitched, and reedy musical note, reminiscent of a bagpipe or similar wind instrument, which plays continuously without any other discernible sounds.\n\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented visuals of a park with trees and playground equipment accompany a sustained, high-pitched, reedy musical note.}}\nThe audio presents a single, sustained, high-pitched, and reedy musical note with a clear, somewhat piercing timbre, consistent with a bagpipe or a similar double-reed wind instrument. The note is played without any variation in pitch or rhythm, nor is there any accompanying music or environmental sound. This monophonic, static audio is layered over a visual stream that is severely fragmented and pixelated, displaying a mosaic of what appear to be outdoor scenes, including trees, grass, and a structure resembling a playground. The visuals lack any clear narrative or coherent action, instead presenting a disjointed collage of environmental elements.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Fragmented visuals of a park with trees and playground equipment accompany a sustained, high-pitched, reedy musical note.}}", "time_sec": 216.394, "generation_time_seconds": 213.7166, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1064, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "123", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The blaring siren of an emergency vehicle echoes through the street as a man's voice cuts through the parade of cars, trucks, and motorcycles passing by a crowd of onlookers.", "pred": "A fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of a fragmented, mosaic-like collage of what appears to be a city street scene with a red vehicle, buildings, and pavement. The audio captures the loud, high-pitched wail of a siren, consistent with an emergency vehicle like a fire truck or ambulance.\nA disassembled, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.\nThe visual stream consists of a fragmented, mosaic-like collage of what appears to be a city street scene with a red vehicle, buildings, and pavement. The audio captures the loud, high-pitched wail of a siren, consistent with an emergency vehicle like a fire truck or ambulance.\nA disassembled, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.\n\nA fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, blocky mosaic of a city street with a red vehicle and buildings is accompanied by the sound of a loud, high-pitched emergency siren.}}", "time_sec": 218.075, "generation_time_seconds": 215.0529, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1523, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.78, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "124", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The short loud vibration resonated through the room, illuminating the diamond accents on the antique earrings and white gold ring displayed against the blue backgrounds.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted digital video frame displays fragmented horizontal lines over abstract patterns, accompanied by a loud, sustained low-frequency electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted digital video frame displays fragmented horizontal lines over abstract patterns, accompanied by a loud, sustained low-frequency electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video frame is severely corrupted with horizontal digital artifacts, displaying fragmented black and white bars over a distorted, abstract background of light and dark, textured patterns. Concurrently, the audio consists of a loud, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzzing tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted digital video frame displays fragmented horizontal lines over abstract patterns, accompanied by a loud, sustained low-frequency electronic buzz.}}\nThe video frame is severely corrupted with horizontal digital artifacts, displaying fragmented black and white bars over a distorted, abstract background of light and dark, textured patterns. Concurrently, the audio consists of a loud, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzzing tone.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted digital video frame displays fragmented horizontal lines over abstract patterns, accompanied by a loud, sustained low-frequency electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 204.502, "generation_time_seconds": 202.2921, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2656, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.56, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "125", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cooing of pigeons echoes through a room filled with a bunch of  animals in a cage.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitching video of fragmented horizontal bars is accompanied by low, rhythmic, guttural cooing sounds.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitching video of fragmented horizontal bars is accompanied by low, rhythmic, guttural cooing sounds.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and pixelated image, with rapidly shifting, fragmented horizontal bars of color and texture that obscure any clear visual content. The audio consists of a series of rhythmic, low-pitched, guttural vocalizations, similar to the cooing or grunting of a large animal.\nThe video shows a fragmented, glitching mosaic of horizontal bars in black, white, and grey, while the audio features low, rhythmic, guttural cooing or grunting sounds.\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and pixelated image, with rapidly shifting, fragmented horizontal bars of color and texture that obscure any clear visual content. The audio consists of a series of rhythmic, low-pitched, guttural vocalizations, similar to the cooing or grunting of a large animal.\nThe video shows a fragmented, glitching mosaic of horizontal bars in black, white, and grey, while the audio features low, rhythmic, guttural cooing or grunting sounds.\n\nA heavily distorted, glitching video of fragmented horizontal bars is accompanied by low, rhythmic, guttural cooing sounds.", "time_sec": 182.577, "generation_time_seconds": 180.7936, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1826, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 9.52, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "126", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a small bedroom with a bed and closet, a young girl in a pink dress stands while clattering and banging occur, as a strong breeze blows through the wind.", "pred": "A glitched, horizontally segmented video shows a room with a wooden door and a cabinet of bottles as a man speaks, followed by a crash, a scream, and the sound of shattering glass and falling debris.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitched, horizontally segmented video shows a room with a wooden door and a cabinet of bottles as a man speaks, followed by a crash, a scream, and the sound of shattering glass and falling debris.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual consists of a horizontally segmented, glitched image showing a room with a wooden door, a pink patterned wall, and a white cabinet containing bottles; simultaneously, a male voice speaks before a loud crash, followed by a scream and the sound of glass shattering and objects falling.\n\\boxed{A glitched, horizontally segmented video shows a room with a wooden door and a cabinet of bottles as a man speaks, followed by a crash, a scream, and the sound of shattering glass and falling debris.}\nThe visual consists of a horizontally segmented, glitched image showing a room with a wooden door, a pink patterned wall, and a white cabinet containing bottles; simultaneously, a male voice speaks before a loud crash, followed by a scream and the sound of glass shattering and objects falling.\n\\boxed{A glitched, horizontally segmented video shows a room with a wooden door and a cabinet of bottles as a man speaks, followed by a crash, a scream, and the sound of shattering glass and falling debris.}\n\nA glitched, horizontally segmented video shows a room with a wooden door and a cabinet of bottles as a man speaks, followed by a crash, a scream, and the sound of shattering glass and falling debris.", "time_sec": 182.003, "generation_time_seconds": 180.1123, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1514, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "127", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A loud, long explosion echoes through the night sky,  while the air force symbol and abstract backgrounds add a sense of power.", "pred": "The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video begins with a black screen, followed by brief horizontal digital glitch effects, and then returns to a black screen. The audio consists of a low-frequency electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a final sustained low electronic tone, all without any speech.\nThe video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.}}\nThe audio contains no speech, only a low-frequency electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone, all of which are non-speech sound effects. The video contains no discernible objects, people, or text, only a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts. There is no visual representation of the sound events in the audio.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.}}\n\nThe video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a black screen with horizontal digital glitch artifacts, while the audio features a low electronic pulse, a loud digital whoosh, and a sustained low electronic tone.}}", "time_sec": 198.859, "generation_time_seconds": 197.0426, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1243, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.64, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "128", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring as a man stands on a balcony in front of a building with clock.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, horizontally banded image of a massive bell tower is accompanied by a deep, rhythmic, metallic gong-like sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, horizontally banded image of a massive bell tower is accompanied by a deep, rhythmic, metallic gong-like sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA large, metallic bell is struck repeatedly, producing a deep, resonant, and sustained gong-like sound with a slow, rhythmic pulse.\nA massive, out-of-focus bell tower is visible, with thick vertical pillars and a dark, intricate metal structure, all distorted by severe digital horizontal banding and color artifacts, while a deep, slow, rhythmic gong sound pulses in the background.\nThe visual shows a heavily distorted, digitally corrupted image of a large bell tower with thick vertical pillars and a dark metal structure, all fragmented by horizontal bands of color, while the audio features a deep, sustained, and rhythmic metallic gong or bell strike.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, horizontally banded image of a massive bell tower is accompanied by a deep, rhythmic, metallic gong-like sound.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, horizontally banded image of a massive bell tower is accompanied by a deep, rhythmic, metallic gong-like sound.}}", "time_sec": 174.688, "generation_time_seconds": 173.1278, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0393, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "129", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A racing vehicle speeds down a dirt road lined with a crowd of people, as a horn honks and wind blows into the microphone.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated outdoor scene with a crowd and trees is accompanied by the sound of a high-performance engine revving, screeching tires, and a loud crash.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated outdoor scene with a crowd and trees is accompanied by the sound of a high-performance engine revving, screeching tires, and a loud crash.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, pixelated, and mosaic-like image of an outdoor scene with a crowd, trees, and a blue vehicle, while the audio features the loud roar of a high-performance engine being revved, followed by the sound of tires screeching and a loud crash.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated outdoor scene of a crowd and trees is accompanied by the sound of a high-performance engine revving, screeching tires, and a loud crash.}}\nThe visual is a complex mosaic of fragmented, distorted images, including what appears to be a crowd, green vegetation, and a light-colored vehicle against a bright sky, all rendered with severe digital corruption and horizontal banding. The audio consists of a deep, powerful engine roar that rapidly increases in pitch and intensity, transitioning into a prolonged, high-pitched tire screech and culminating in a loud, chaotic crash involving the sound of shattering material.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated outdoor scene with a crowd and trees is accompanied by the sound of a high-performance engine revving, screeching tires, and a loud crash.}}", "time_sec": 201.376, "generation_time_seconds": 197.8213, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1429, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "130", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks with a slide whistle sound, typing on a keyboard and mouse clicking, woodwind music plays in the background, a ship sails through the game with pirate ships in sight.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in yellow, green, and red, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a \"pop\" sound effect and keyboard typing.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in yellow, green, and red, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a \"pop\" sound effect and keyboard typing.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe screen is filled with heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in shades of yellow, green, red, and dark grey, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a sound effect and keyboard typing sounds.\nThe screen displays heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in yellow, green, and red, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a \"pop\" sound effect and keyboard typing.\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in yellow, green, and red, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a \"pop\" sound effect and keyboard typing.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated patterns in yellow, green, and red, while a voice whispers \"snowflake,\" followed by a \"pop\" sound effect and keyboard typing.}}", "time_sec": 177.612, "generation_time_seconds": 175.4701, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1641, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "131", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The baby cries as a woman speaks, while a little girl in a pink dress sits on a red chair with a small child.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal digital glitching overlays a scene with a crying baby, a speaking male, and a barking dog.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal digital glitching overlays a scene with a crying baby, a speaking male, and a barking dog.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, creating a mosaic of fragmented, shifting blocks in green, brown, and black, while the audio consists of a baby crying, a male voice speaking, and a dog barking. \\boxed{\\text{Severely distorted horizontal digital glitching overlays a scene with a crying baby, a speaking male, and a barking dog.}}\nThe visual is entirely composed of a digital artifact, specifically horizontal line tearing or scan line corruption, which breaks the image into a series of fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks. The colors within these blocks are primarily desaturated greens, browns, and blacks, with some areas exhibiting a yellowish cast. There is no discernible object, person, or environment visible due to the overwhelming nature of the glitch. Simultaneously, the audio presents a clear, high-fidelity recording of a baby's cry, followed by a male voice saying \"Uh oh\" and \"Let me see,\" and concluding with the sound of a dog barking.\nThe visual is entirely composed of a digital artifact, specifically horizontal line tearing or scan line corruption, which breaks the image into a series of fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks. The colors within these blocks are primarily desaturated greens, browns, and blacks, with some areas exhibiting a yellowish cast. There is no discernible object, person, or environment visible due to the overwhelming nature of the glitch. Simultaneously, the audio presents a clear, high-fidelity recording of a baby's cry, followed by a male voice saying \"Uh oh\" and \"Let me see,\" and concluding with the sound of a dog barking.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal digital glitching overlays a scene with a crying baby, a speaking male, and a barking dog.}}", "time_sec": 228.857, "generation_time_seconds": 226.5872, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1073, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "132", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a woman speaks affectionately, a pig oinks  on the bed.", "pred": "A man whispers, sighs, and softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man whispers, sighs, and softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA man whispers, followed by a sigh, then softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man whispers, sighs, and softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.}}\nThe audio contains a man whispering, a human sigh, and the words 'night night' spoken softly, all in a quiet setting with no other discernible background sounds or music.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man whispers, sighs, and softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.}}\n\nA man whispers, sighs, and softly says 'night night' in a quiet, dark environment.", "time_sec": 137.565, "generation_time_seconds": 134.6786, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2474, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "133", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A black sports car speeds down a curvy road with the sound of humming and revving engine, accompanied by squealing tires.", "pred": "Severely pixelated, mosaic-like visuals of green and grey shapes are accompanied by the high-pitched whine of a powerful engine and the screech of tires.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely pixelated, mosaic-like visuals of green and grey shapes are accompanied by the high-pitched whine of a powerful engine and the screech of tires.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a severe mosaic of distorted, fragmented, and shifting green and grey rectangular blocks, obscuring any coherent scene, while the audio is dominated by the high-pitched, aggressive whine of a powerful engine under intense acceleration, accompanied by a high-frequency tire screech.\n\\boxed{Severely pixelated, mosaic-like visuals of green and grey shapes are accompanied by the high-pitched whine of a powerful engine and the screech of tires.}\nThe audio presents a continuous, high-frequency, rising and falling whine characteristic of a high-revving engine, accompanied by a sharp, abrasive screech, indicating tires losing traction on a hard surface.\n\\boxed{Severely pixelated, mosaic-like visuals of green and grey shapes are accompanied by the high-pitched whine of a powerful engine and the screech of tires.}\n\nSeverely pixelated, mosaic-like visuals of green and grey shapes are accompanied by the high-pitched whine of a powerful engine and the screech of tires.", "time_sec": 272.974, "generation_time_seconds": 271.7116, "selection_time_seconds": 0.053, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "134", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man engage in conversation as bird sounds fill the air, including a bird in a cage on the roof of a building and a broken cage on the roof of a building.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched architectural scene of a modern building with crisscrossing beams and a bright sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish and the bleating of goats.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched architectural scene of a modern building with crisscrossing beams and a bright sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish and the bleating of goats.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a fragmented, glitched view of a modern building's facade with crisscrossing structural elements under a bright sky, while the audio features a male voice speaking in Spanish amidst the distinct bleating of goats.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, mosaic-like composite of modern architecture, showing brickwork, glass panels, and a complex metal framework under a bright, blue sky. The audio consists of a male voice speaking in Spanish, with the distinct bleating of goats audible in the background.\nThe video shows a fragmented, glitched architectural scene with a modern building's facade, crisscrossing metal beams, and a bright sky, while the audio contains a male voice speaking Spanish and the distinct bleating of goats.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched architectural scene of a modern building with crisscrossing beams and a bright sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish and the bleating of goats.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched architectural scene of a modern building with crisscrossing beams and a bright sky is accompanied by a male voice speaking in Spanish and the bleating of goats.}}", "time_sec": 215.043, "generation_time_seconds": 212.5015, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2211, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "135", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man's voice narrates as he cuts wood with a knife on a wooden table, followed by the sound of paper shuffling.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated video shows no discernible scene while a man speaks and a power saw cuts wood.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated video shows no discernible scene while a man speaks and a power saw cuts wood.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe view is severely corrupted by horizontal, blocky digital artifacts, obscuring any clear visual scene. Overlaid on this, an adult male speaks in a low, calm voice, followed immediately by the loud, rapid, rhythmic sound of a saw cutting through a material.\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated video shows no discernible scene while a man speaks and a power saw cuts wood.}\nThe audio confirms the presence of a man speaking and a sawing sound, but the video is completely unusable due to severe digital corruption, making it impossible to verify any visual details.\n\nA heavily pixelated video shows no discernible scene while a man speaks and a power saw cuts wood.", "time_sec": 220.55, "generation_time_seconds": 218.8437, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1329, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "136", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the intense video game scene, clicks, gunshots, and breathing are heard as a woman navigates through a cave.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, pixelated blocks of dark textures with occasional green and orange shapes, accompanied by the sounds of explosions, automatic gunfire, a male voice, and a final electronic tone.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, pixelated blocks of dark textures with occasional green and orange shapes, accompanied by the sounds of explosions, automatic gunfire, a male voice, and a final electronic tone.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, with the screen fragmented into horizontal and vertical blocks of distorted, pixelated textures in dark, earthy browns and grays. Among the static, glimpses of blocky green and orange shapes are visible. The audio consists of two loud, booming explosions, followed by the sound of rapid gunfire, a male voice, and a final sustained electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted video displays fragmented, pixelated blocks of dark textures with occasional green and orange shapes, accompanied by the sounds of explosions, automatic gunfire, a male voice, and a final electronic tone.}}\nThe audio begins with the distinct sound of a mechanical device, possibly a firearm, being loaded or cocked. This is immediately followed by two extremely loud, booming explosions with significant reverberation, suggesting a large, open environment. After a brief pause, the sound of rapid, automatic gunfire erupts. A male voice then speaks, saying \"Reload,\" and the audio concludes with a sustained, low-frequency electronic tone. The visual component consists of a heavily distorted video feed, characterized by a mosaic of horizontal and vertical bands of corrupted pixel data, primarily in dark brown, gray, and black tones, with intermittent flashes of green and orange\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, pixelated blocks of dark textures with occasional green and orange shapes, accompanied by the sounds of explosions, automatic gunfire, a male voice, and a final electronic tone.}}", "time_sec": 239.361, "generation_time_seconds": 237.3955, "selection_time_seconds": 0.052, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
