 voice speaks in Mandarin and a dog barks in the background.", "time_sec": 251.597, "generation_time_seconds": 250.293, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0389, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "141", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "Two men discuss while an insect buzzes by, wind blows, and birds chirp in the distance, as a person holding a pen  draws a map of the area.", "pred": "A glitching screen of fragmented data overlays a muffled male voice speaking over static.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitching screen of fragmented data overlays a muffled male voice speaking over static.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image composed of horizontal white and grey bars with fragmented text and faint lines, while the audio consists of a low-fidelity, muffled male voice speaking indistinctly over persistent static and crackling noise.\n\\boxed{A glitching screen of fragmented data overlays a muffled male voice speaking over static.}\nThe visual stream is a static, non-moving image of digital corruption, exhibiting a fixed pattern of horizontal lines and pixelation, with no discernible motion, color variation, or environmental context, characteristic of a severe video data error. The audio stream is dominated by a low-fidelity recording of a male voice speaking in a muffled tone, layered with constant, high-frequency static and intermittent crackling, suggesting a weak or damaged audio source. These modalities are independent: the video shows no signs of a physical environment, while the audio contains no environmental sounds, only a voice and recording artifacts. Synthesizing these observations into a single\n\nA glitching screen of fragmented data overlays a muffled male voice speaking over static.", "time_sec": 195.295, "generation_time_seconds": 192.8985, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2176, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "142", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice narrates as a motorcycle accelerates down a narrow road with a blue car following behind.", "pred": "A first-person view from a moving vehicle shows a road with green verges and trees, while a loud engine and a male voice are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A first-person view from a moving vehicle shows a road with green verges and trees, while a loud engine and a male voice are heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly moving, glitchy, and fragmented view of an outdoor environment with green grass, trees, and a blue sky, while the audio features a loud, rumbling vehicle engine accompanied by a male voice speaking.\nThe video displays a rapidly moving, glitchy, and fragmented view of an outdoor environment with green grass, trees, and a blue sky, while the audio features a loud, rumbling vehicle engine accompanied by a male voice speaking.\nThe video displays a rapidly moving, glitchy, and fragmented view of an outdoor environment with green grass, trees, and a blue sky, while the audio features a loud, rumbling vehicle engine accompanied by a male voice speaking.\nThe video displays a rapidly moving, glitchy, and fragmented view of an outdoor environment with green grass, trees, and a blue sky, while the audio features a loud, rumbling vehicle engine accompanied by a male voice speaking.\n\nA first-person view from a moving vehicle shows a road with green verges and trees, while a loud engine and a male voice are heard.", "time_sec": 186.135, "generation_time_seconds": 182.9601, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0444, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "143", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A person on a boat catches a bass with a hook in its mouth, as water splashes, a duck quacks, and the person laughs.", "pred": "Severely corrupted video with horizontal glitch lines overlays audio of a croaking frog and splashing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely corrupted video with horizontal glitch lines overlays audio of a croaking frog and splashing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, presenting as fragmented, horizontal bands of distorted and shifting imagery. Overlapping this visual glitch, the audio captures the distinct croaking call of a frog, followed by the subsequent sound of splashing water.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely corrupted video with horizontal glitch lines overlays audio of a croaking frog and splashing water.}}\nThe initial analysis correctly identifies the primary visual and auditory components. The video's state is a severe digital artifact, specifically a horizontal line corruption that fragments and distorts the underlying image. The audio is clear and captures two distinct events in sequence. The first is a biological sound, a croak from an amphibian, likely a frog. The second is a mechanical or physical sound, the splash of an object or animal entering a body of water. The final description must accurately represent these two independent modalities without conflating them, as the visual corruption is a technical failure and the sounds are from a real-world event. The next logical step\n\nSeverely corrupted video with horizontal glitch lines overlays audio of a croaking frog and splashing water.", "time_sec": 201.145, "generation_time_seconds": 198.4331, "selection_time_seconds": 0.199, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "144", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A crowd of people cheers and applause to the dancers for dance performs on stage.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The audio is a continuous, low-frequency rumble with a mechanical clanking rhythm, consistent with a large, heavy vehicle in motion. The visual is a static, abstract composition of horizontal and vertical lines and blocks, exhibiting severe digital corruption.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The audio is a continuous, low-frequency rumble with a mechanical clanking rhythm, consistent with a large, heavy vehicle in motion. The visual is a static, abstract composition of horizontal and vertical lines and blocks, exhibiting severe digital corruption.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine, like a truck or bus, accompanied by a rhythmic, mechanical clanking sound, suggesting the vehicle is moving. The visual is an abstract, distorted, and fragmented image composed of horizontal bands with vertical lines, exhibiting digital corruption that obscures any discernible scene or subject.\nThe audio features the loud, low-frequency rumble of a large engine, like a truck or bus, with rhythmic mechanical clanking, while the visual is an abstract, fragmented image with horizontal bands and vertical lines showing digital corruption.\nThe audio is a continuous, low-frequency rumble with a mechanical clanking rhythm, consistent with a large, heavy vehicle in motion. The visual is a static, abstract composition of horizontal and vertical lines and blocks, exhibiting severe digital corruption.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio is a continuous, low-frequency rumble with a mechanical clanking rhythm, consistent with a large, heavy vehicle in motion. The visual is a static, abstract composition of horizontal and vertical lines and blocks, exhibiting severe digital corruption.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio is a continuous, low-frequency rumble with a mechanical clanking rhythm, consistent with a large, heavy vehicle in motion. The visual is a static, abstract composition of horizontal and vertical lines and blocks, exhibiting severe digital corruption.}}", "time_sec": 209.782, "generation_time_seconds": 207.4776, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0408, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "145", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bathroom, a man with a beard is shaving on his face,while there is a sink  and water splashing sounds in the background.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated and distorted sepia-toned video plays over the sound of a toilet flushing, a door closing, and the tank refilling.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated and distorted sepia-toned video plays over the sound of a toilet flushing, a door closing, and the tank refilling.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily distorted and pixelated image in a sepia tone, showing fragmented, shifting horizontal and vertical bands of light and dark, with no discernible subjects or coherent scenes.\nThe audio stream contains the sound of a toilet flushing, preceded by the sound of a door closing and followed by the sound of a toilet tank refilling.\nThe video displays severe digital corruption with horizontal and vertical block artifacts and pixelation, while the audio captures the sequence of a door closing, a toilet flushing, and the subsequent sound of the tank refilling.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated and distorted sepia-toned video plays over the sound of a toilet flushing, a door closing, and the tank refilling.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated and distorted sepia-toned video plays over the sound of a toilet flushing, a door closing, and the tank refilling.}}", "time_sec": 150.038, "generation_time_seconds": 147.3645, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0505, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "146", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The hissing spray of a pressure washer cleans the roof as liquid patters on the surface, while a man works diligently atop the metal roof with a squeegee.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, and continuous mechanical buzzing sound, similar to a dental drill or a high-speed power tool operating at full capacity. Simultaneously, the visual content displays a severely distorted and fragmented image composed of numerous small, rectangular tiles or blocks that are in motion and jumbled together. This visual effect suggests extreme digital corruption, significant video compression artifacts, or a highly abstract, glitch-art style of animation. The scene gives the impression of a rapidly shifting, disassembled collage of various environmental elements, including a sky with clouds, green foliage, and what appears to be a white tiled roof or\nA severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.\nThe audio is a high-frequency, sustained, and abrasive mechanical buzzing, lacking musicality or rhythm, consistent with a malfunctioning or high-RPM power tool. The video is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and scrambled visual field; it is not a coherent image but an abstract composition of rapidly shifting, rectangular blocks, possibly representing a sky, foliage, and roofing materials, all rendered in a glitch-art or digital corruption style. The two sensory inputs are unrelated and do not depict the same event. The final answer is a direct, dense description combining these two independent observations.\n\nA severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted video stream displays a fragmented, glitching collage of white tiled roofing and green trees under a blue sky, accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "time_sec": 187.611, "generation_time_seconds": 185.9196, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0353, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "147", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The helicopter flies low over a field, its engine running idle as the wind blows heavily into the microphone.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, dark, abstract visual accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, dark, abstract visual accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video begins with a heavily distorted, pixelated image of a dark, blurry, and abstract scene. As it progresses, the distortion intensifies, resulting in a completely dark, pixelated, and fragmented visual that is unrecognizable. Concurrently, the audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, continuous mechanical whirring sound, similar to a power tool or engine, which starts abruptly and persists without change, creating a clear contrast between the chaotic visual and the monotonous, powerful sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, dark, and abstract visual accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.}}\nThe analysis begins with the visual component: the scene is characterized by severe digital distortion, manifesting as horizontal and vertical banding, pixelation, and a mosaic-like block structure. The color palette is limited to dark browns, grays, and blacks, with an absence of discernible objects, people, or environments, rendering the visual content abstract. Simultaneously, the audio presents a single, dominant sound source: a high-frequency, mechanically driven whirring noise, exhibiting characteristics of a high-RPM power tool such as a drill or saw. The sound is consistent in pitch and amplitude, with no speech, music,\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, dark, abstract visual accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.}}", "time_sec": 201.048, "generation_time_seconds": 199.5305, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0395, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 7.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "148", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks on a pier next to a body of water as waves splash in the background.", "pred": "A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train. \\boxed{A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train. \\boxed{A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted and fragmented abstract pattern, composed of shifting rectangular blocks that suggest a warped view of a sky and water surface, while the audio consists of a deep, distorted male voice speaking, layered over the loud, rhythmic clatter of a train moving on tracks.\nThe final sentence is: A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train. \\boxed{A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train.}\nThe visual is a heavily distorted and fragmented abstract pattern, composed of shifting rectangular blocks that suggest a warped view of a sky and water surface, while the audio consists of a deep, distorted male voice speaking, layered over the loud, rhythmic clatter of a train moving on tracks.\nThe final sentence is: A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train. \\boxed{A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking,\n\nA fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train. \\boxed{A fragmented, mosaic-like view of a sky and water scene is overlaid with a deep, distorted male voice speaking, accompanied by the loud, rhythmic clatter of a moving train.}", "time_sec": 223.649, "generation_time_seconds": 221.8421, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0375, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.35, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "149", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man's voice blends with the sound of ocean waves trickling and splashing, the bow of a sailboat navigates through the open sea with the wind and waves.", "pred": "The video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio consists of a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.}}\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio consists of a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks\n\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, glitching, and pixelated abstract image with shifting rectangular blocks of dark, watery textures and fragmented light streaks, while the audio features a male voice speaking over loud, high-pitched, fluctuating electronic static.", "time_sec": 318.215, "generation_time_seconds": 316.2728, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1405, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.65, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "150", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bathroom with a white urinal and a black drain, a man's voice is muffled by the camera as water gurgles in the drain, followed by the sound of a toilet flushing.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal green and white static with black blocky patterns is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal green and white static with black blocky patterns is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows horizontal green and white lines, some with black and white patterns, which are characteristic of video static or a glitch. This visual is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing.\n\\boxed{\\text{Video glitch with horizontal green and white lines accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing.}}\nThe video displays horizontal bands of green, white, and black static, with some sections showing distorted blocky patterns, while the audio consists of a toilet flushing.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Horizontal green and white static with black blocky patterns is accompanied by the sound of a toilet flushing.}}", "time_sec": 183.672, "generation_time_seconds": 182.0891, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0377, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 37.04, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "151", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a bustling city, a man in a suit and tie walks down a train as a woman gazes out the window, while a group of people chat amidst the sound of a crying infant and a muffled bus engine.", "pred": "The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream consists of a rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented horizontal and vertical bars, exhibiting severe digital corruption with color blocks of yellow, black, white, and blue, suggesting a glitch or distorted data transmission. The audio stream features a low, guttural, non-verbal moaning sound, possibly from a person or animal, layered over a continuous, high-pitched electronic tone and a faint, indistinct male voice in the background.\nThe screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.}}\nThe visual stream consists of a rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented horizontal and vertical bars, exhibiting severe digital corruption with color blocks of yellow, black, white, and blue, suggesting a glitch or distorted data transmission. The audio stream features a low, guttural, non-verbal moaning sound, possibly from a person or animal, layered over a continuous, high-pitched electronic tone and a faint, indistinct male voice in the background.\nThe screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning\n\nThe screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.\n\\boxed{\\text{The screen displays a highly corrupted, rapidly shifting mosaic of black, white, yellow, and blue horizontal and vertical bars, while the audio contains a low, guttural moaning sound layered over a high-pitched electronic tone and faint, indistinct male speech.}}", "time_sec": 280.598, "generation_time_seconds": 278.2126, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2399, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 2.47, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "152", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of metal clacking sharply as water drains down a pipe is accompanied by the visual of a white urinal with a red hole in the drain.", "pred": "The audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio consists of rhythmic impacts, followed by a loud crash, and then a continuous high-pitched buzzing sound, while the visual is a block of solid, nondescript greenish-brown color with no discernible objects or movements.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.}}\nThe audio consists of rhythmic impacts, followed by a loud crash, and then a continuous high-pitched buzzing sound, while the visual is a block of solid, nondescript greenish-brown color with no discernible objects or movements.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.}}\nThe audio consists of rhythmic impacts, followed by a loud crash, and then a continuous high-pitched buzzing sound, while the visual is a block of solid, nondescript greenish-brown color with no discernible objects or movements.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.}}\n\nThe audio features rhythmic impacts, a crash, and a continuous buzz, while the visual is a solid greenish-brown color with no discernible features.", "time_sec": 244.75, "generation_time_seconds": 243.3602, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0437, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "153", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The engine vibrates as a man speaks while looking under the hood at the exposed engine of a car.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, pixelated, and fragmented image composed of black, grey, and blue-toned squares, suggesting a corrupted or abstract digital scene, while the audio features the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating and then idling, accompanied by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"}}\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with abstract geometric patterns in dark, metallic colors, while the audio captures the loud, high-pitched whine of a small engine rapidly decelerating to an idle, followed by a male voice saying \"Oh, my God.\"}}", "time_sec": 284.467, "generation_time_seconds": 281.4641, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1352, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "154", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio whooshes as a woman speaks, followed by digital beeps and men talking, while a person stands on a boat in the ocean next to a logo for a technology company.", "pred": "A distorted retro video game scene with glitch effects is followed by a forest shot, accompanied by a deep rumble, a synthesized female voice announcing an intercom connection, and distorted male speech.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A distorted retro video game scene with glitch effects is followed by a forest shot, accompanied by a deep rumble, a synthesized female voice announcing an intercom connection, and distorted male speech.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video begins with a black screen, then transitions to a heavily distorted, glitching画面 resembling a retro video game with blocky, colorful graphics and large, pixelated text. This is followed by a brief shot of a dark, blurry forest scene, before the video ends with a black screen. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, deep rumbling sound, a synthesized female voice announcing \"BB Talkin Intercom Connected,\" a male voice saying \"Let's talk BB Talkin,\" and a final, heavily distorted, unintelligible vocal utterance.\n\\boxed{A distorted retro video game scene with glitch effects is followed by a forest shot, accompanied by a deep rumble, a synthesized female voice announcing an intercom connection, and distorted male speech.}\nThe video begins with a black screen, then transitions to a heavily distorted, glitching画面 resembling a retro video game with blocky, colorful graphics and large, pixelated text. This is followed by a brief shot of a dark, blurry forest scene, before the video ends with a black screen. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a loud, deep rumbling sound, a synthesized female voice announcing \"BB Talkin Intercom Connected,\" a male voice saying \"Let's talk BB Talkin,\" and a final, heavily distorted, unintelligible vocal utterance.\n\\boxed{A distorted retro video game scene with glitch effects\n\nA distorted retro video game scene with glitch effects is followed by a forest shot, accompanied by a deep rumble, a synthesized female voice announcing an intercom connection, and distorted male speech.", "time_sec": 285.969, "generation_time_seconds": 283.9512, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1521, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.13, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "155", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man with a tattoo on his arm stirs a pan of sizzling green peppers and onions on the stove, creating a symphony of banging and cracking sounds.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, abstract mosaic of green, brown, and black bands is accompanied by a man explaining he will season vegetables with black pepper, followed by the sound of a pepper grinder.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, abstract mosaic of green, brown, and black bands is accompanied by a man explaining he will season vegetables with black pepper, followed by the sound of a pepper grinder.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and mosaic-like abstract image composed of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands of color, including green, brown, black, white, and red, with no discernible objects or scene.\nThe audio consists of a male voice speaking in a conversational tone, stating, \"with anything else you have to season your vegetables. So I'm going to take some black pepper.\" This is immediately followed by the sound of a pepper grinder being used.\nA heavily pixelated, abstract mosaic of green, brown, and black bands is accompanied by a man explaining he will season vegetables with black pepper, followed by the sound of a pepper grinder.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, pixelated, and mosaic-like abstract image composed of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands of color, including green, brown, black, white, and red, with no discernible objects or scene.\nThe audio consists of a male voice speaking in a conversational tone, stating, \"with anything else you have to season your vegetables. So I'm going to take some black pepper.\" This is immediately followed by the sound of a pepper grinder being used.\nA heavily pixelated, abstract mosaic of green, brown, and black bands is accompanied by a man explaining he will season vegetables with black pepper, followed by\n\nA heavily pixelated, abstract mosaic of green, brown, and black bands is accompanied by a man explaining he will season vegetables with black pepper, followed by the sound of a pepper grinder.", "time_sec": 167.498, "generation_time_seconds": 165.3585, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2221, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "156", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man's voice echoes as race cars speed and the engine humming sound through turns on the track.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, fragmented mosaic of shifting beige and brown patterns is accompanied by the loud, powerful sound of a high-performance vehicle's engine accelerating and decelerating.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, fragmented mosaic of shifting beige and brown patterns is accompanied by the loud, powerful sound of a high-performance vehicle's engine accelerating and decelerating.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual scene is a rapidly shifting mosaic of fragmented, low-resolution images, predominantly in beige and brown tones, suggesting a chaotic or corrupted video feed. Simultaneously, the audio features a powerful, low-frequency engine sound that rapidly accelerates and then decelerates. The engine sound is loud and intense, characteristic of a high-performance vehicle like a sports car or motorcycle, but there are no accompanying sounds of tires on a road or any other environmental noise. The combination of the distorted visuals and the isolated, intense engine noise creates a sensory experience of a high-speed event viewed through a malfunctioning or abstract lens. The engine's sound\nA low-resolution, fragmented mosaic of shifting beige and brown patterns is accompanied by the loud, powerful sound of a high-performance vehicle's engine accelerating and decelerating.\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, fragmented mosaic of shifting beige and brown patterns is accompanied by the loud, powerful sound of a high-performance vehicle's engine accelerating and decelerating.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A low-resolution, fragmented mosaic of shifting beige and brown patterns is accompanied by the loud, powerful sound of a high-performance vehicle's engine accelerating and decelerating.}}", "time_sec": 194.219, "generation_time_seconds": 192.3757, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2693, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "157", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man laughing while making a cloud of smoke on a table, as a man on a surfboard in a pool of water bottle with a table and chairs on the floor talks.", "pred": "A heavily glitched video with fragmented horizontal bands of abstract color is paired with the audio of a loud crash, scraping, rumbling, and a low groan.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily glitched video with fragmented horizontal bands of abstract color is paired with the audio of a loud crash, scraping, rumbling, and a low groan.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and fragmented visual, showing glitched horizontal bands of abstract shapes and colors like beige, red, and blue, with no discernible objects or actions. Simultaneously, the audio captures a loud, sudden crash followed by scraping and rumbling, then a low, guttural groan, all suggesting a violent physical event like a car crash in a confined, reverberant space.\n\\boxed{A heavily glitched video with fragmented horizontal bands of abstract color is paired with the audio of a loud crash, scraping, rumbling, and a low groan.}\nThe audio reveals a sequence of three distinct, non-overlapping sounds: a sharp, explosive impact at 00:02, a sustained metallic screech and rumble from 00:03 to 00:06, and a low, guttural groan from 00:07 to 00:11. The visual is a continuous, abstract glitch of horizontal bands, but the timing of the loud impact in the audio is the most salient event to correlate with the general sense of chaos in the video.\n\nA heavily glitched video with fragmented horizontal bands of abstract color is paired with the audio of a loud crash, scraping, rumbling, and a low groan.", "time_sec": 226.918, "generation_time_seconds": 225.168, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2288, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "158", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a white tiled room, a small motor buzzes as a man speaks while a metal door closes, resembling a microwave oven.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video frames display a heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and distorted text, while the audio captures a person speaking about a process that \"works actually.\"\nA heavily corrupted, glitching screen with vertical bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}\n\nA heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted, glitching screen with horizontal bars and fragmented text is displayed while a person speaks, followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 158.663, "generation_time_seconds": 157.0233, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "159", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a building, a man stands in front of a large TV as a crowd of people laughs, applause, and claps in response to his speech.", "pred": "A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe screen displays a glitched, pixelated, and distorted abstract image with horizontal lines and blocks of color, while the audio contains a male voice speaking in Ukrainian, followed by a loud, sustained, low-frequency electronic buzzing tone.\nA distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}\n\nA distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching abstract image with fragmented blocks of color and horizontal lines is displayed, accompanied by a male voice speaking in Ukrainian followed by a loud, sustained electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 183.726, "generation_time_seconds": 181.7326, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2606, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "160", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The little girl is peacefully sleeping on the couch , while the sound of snoring fills the room.", "pred": "A person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio clip consists of a sequence of deep, rhythmic snoring sounds, suggesting a person is asleep. Concurrently, the video is heavily corrupted, displaying severe horizontal bar artifacts and pixelation across the entire frame, rendering any visual content unidentifiable.\n\\boxed{\\text{A person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.}}\nThe audio clip consists of a sequence of deep, rhythmic snoring sounds, suggesting a person is asleep. Concurrently, the video is heavily corrupted, displaying severe horizontal bar artifacts and pixelation across the entire frame, rendering any visual content unidentifiable.\n\\boxed{\\text{A person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.}}\nThe audio clip consists of a sequence of deep, rhythmic snoring sounds, suggesting a person is asleep. Concurrently, the video is heavily corrupted, displaying severe horizontal bar artifacts and pixelation across the entire frame, rendering any visual content unidentifiable.\n\\boxed{\\text{A person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.}}\n\nA person is snoring while the video feed is severely corrupted with horizontal bars and pixelation.", "time_sec": 347.151, "generation_time_seconds": 344.708, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0403, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "161", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The  woman stood in front of the black and white mural, surrounded by paintings of skulls, skeletons, and a fox, as they heard the sound of spraying and hissing with light vibrations..", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, horizontally scrambled video of abstract patterns in black, white, grey, orange, and blue plays alongside the continuous high-pitched whirring of a power tool.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, horizontally scrambled video of abstract patterns in black, white, grey, orange, and blue plays alongside the continuous high-pitched whirring of a power tool.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, horizontally scrambled image with fragmented patterns of black, white, grey, orange, and blue, while the audio consists of the continuous high-pitched whirring of a power tool, likely a drill or saw, operating in a reverberant indoor space.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, horizontally scrambled video of abstract patterns in black, white, grey, and orange plays alongside the continuous high-pitched whirring of a power tool.}}\nThe visual is a low-fidelity, abstract composition created by horizontal slicing and rearrangement of rectangular image blocks, resulting in a mosaic of fragmented textures and color bands including black, white, grey, orange, and blue, with no discernible objects or scenes. Concurrently, the audio is dominated by a high-pitched, continuous mechanical whir, consistent with the operation of a power tool such as a drill or saw, in an indoor environment with noticeable reverberation. The two modalities are unrelated: the visual is a static, abstract glitch pattern, while the audio is a dynamic, real-world recording.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, horizontally scrambled video of abstract patterns in black, white, grey, orange, and blue plays alongside the continuous high-pitched whirring of a power tool.}}", "time_sec": 201.549, "generation_time_seconds": 200.294, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0477, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.53, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "162", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The rhythmic tick-tock of a large clock with visible gears accompanies a man hanging a black and white clock on the wall in his house.", "pred": "A rhythmic metallic clank and low squeak accompany a series of five horizontal, abstract bands showing warped geometric shapes and solid brownish-orange color.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rhythmic metallic clank and low squeak accompany a series of five horizontal, abstract bands showing warped geometric shapes and solid brownish-orange color.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\n\\boxed{}\nThe audio captures a rhythmic, metallic clanking sound, while the visual shows a series of abstract, horizontal strips depicting distorted, repeating geometric patterns in dark and light tones.\nThe visual consists of five horizontal bands of distorted, warped imagery; the top and bottom bands show a repeating pattern of black and white geometric shapes, while the middle three bands display a solid, muted brownish-orange color. The audio features a rhythmic, metallic clanking accompanied by a distinct, low-frequency squeaking sound, suggesting the movement of a heavy, possibly wooden, object on an old track.\n\nA rhythmic metallic clank and low squeak accompany a series of five horizontal, abstract bands showing warped geometric shapes and solid brownish-orange color.", "time_sec": 164.019, "generation_time_seconds": 162.1361, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1546, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.06, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "163", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a man in a cap looks at the camera and makes a funny face and  speaking ,whistling sound.", "pred": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, monochrome, horizontally striped abstract image is paired with a male voice speaking and a loud, high-pitched electronic siren sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, monochrome, horizontally striped abstract image is paired with a male voice speaking and a loud, high-pitched electronic siren sound.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is a heavily pixelated, mosaic-like abstraction of horizontal bands, dominated by black, white, and grey, with no discernible objects or people; the audio consists of a male voice speaking, immediately followed by a series of loud, high-pitched, electronic siren sounds.\nThe visual stream displays a corrupted, pixelated image with horizontal bands of black and white, possibly indicating a data error or digital artifact; concurrently, the audio captures a male voice uttering a phrase, immediately followed by a sequence of high-pitched, electronic siren sounds.\nA heavily pixelated, monochrome, horizontally striped abstract image is paired with a male voice speaking and a loud, high-pitched electronic siren sound.\n\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, monochrome, horizontally striped abstract image is paired with a male voice speaking and a loud, high-pitched electronic siren sound.}", "time_sec": 210.273, "generation_time_seconds": 208.3311, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2724, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "164", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the man talks, a swarm of insects buzz around him.", "pred": "A solid black screen is paired with the sound of a man speaking in a foreign language and flowing water.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A solid black screen is paired with the sound of a man speaking in a foreign language and flowing water.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a completely black screen, while the audio captures a man speaking in a non-English language outdoors, accompanied by the sound of flowing water.\nThe video is a solid black screen, while the audio features a male voice speaking in a foreign language (possibly Persian), set against a backdrop of flowing water.\nThe screen is black, and the audio contains a man speaking in a foreign language with the sound of water flowing.\n\nA solid black screen is paired with the sound of a man speaking in a foreign language and flowing water.", "time_sec": 157.485, "generation_time_seconds": 155.5491, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1023, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 11.11, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "165", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of knocking followed by a machine sawing accompanies a man using a saw to cut a wooden board on a work bench.", "pred": "The audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio captures the distinct sound of a power tool, likely an angle grinder, being activated and then used to cut a piece of metal, producing a high-pitched, abrasive whirring noise. This sound is heard in a space with noticeable reverberation, suggesting an enclosed environment like a workshop or garage. The visual component, however, consists of a series of horizontal, glitched, and fragmented video strips displaying abstract, distorted, and rapidly shifting patterns of light, shadow, and color, resembling a corrupted digital feed. The visual and auditory elements are entirely disconnected, with no shared context or narrative. Therefore, the scene is\nThe audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.\nThe audio captures the distinct sound of a power tool, likely an angle grinder, being activated and then used to cut a piece of metal, producing a high-pitched, abrasive whirring noise. This sound is heard in a space with noticeable reverberation, suggesting an enclosed environment like a workshop or garage. The visual component, however, consists of a series of horizontal, glitched, and fragmented video strips displaying abstract, distorted, and rapidly shifting patterns of light, shadow, and color, resembling a corrupted digital feed. The visual and auditory elements are entirely disconnected, with no shared context or narrative. Therefore, the scene is\n\nThe audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a high-pitched, abrasive whirring of a power tool, likely a grinder, with reverberation suggesting an enclosed space, while the video displays fragmented, glitched horizontal strips of abstract, distorted light and shadow.}}", "time_sec": 224.899, "generation_time_seconds": 221.9407, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2312, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "166", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the kitchen, a woman fries food while talking, standing next to a white refrigerator.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract image of horizontal brown and beige bands is paired with the sounds of sizzling food and a man speaking.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract image of horizontal brown and beige bands is paired with the sounds of sizzling food and a man speaking.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a severely corrupted, pixelated image dominated by horizontal bands of brown, orange, and beige, with fragmented, unreadable text visible in some sections. The audio features the sound of sizzling food in a pan, accompanied by a male voice speaking.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, abstract composition with horizontal bands of brown and beige, while the audio captures the sizzling of food in a pan and a male voice giving instructions.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract image of brown and beige horizontal bands is paired with the sounds of sizzling food and a man speaking.}}\nThe visual consists of a mosaic of fragmented, horizontal rectangular blocks, creating a distorted and abstract scene dominated by a palette of brown, beige, and orange hues, with some blocks containing indistinct text-like patterns. The audio features a continuous sizzling sound, consistent with cooking, layered with a male voice providing instructions, suggesting a culinary context.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract image of horizontal brown and beige bands is paired with the sounds of sizzling food and a man speaking.}}", "time_sec": 176.878, "generation_time_seconds": 175.2011, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1274, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "167", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man speaks as a stream of water trickles in the background, while a young man rides a boat with a camera on board.", "pred": "A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male voice describing a \"Brixton Stratton 5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" while a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep is heard in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.}}\nThe visual consists of rapidly shifting, fragmented panels of green and brown textures, creating a glitchy, abstract mosaic effect.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.}}\nThe audio features a male voice describing a \"Brixton Stratton 5 horsepower four-stroke outboard motor\" while a continuous, high-pitched electronic beep is heard in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.}}\nThe visual consists of rapidly shifting, fragmented panels of green and brown textures, creating a glitchy, abstract mosaic effect.\n\\boxed{\\text{A man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.}}\n\nA man describes a Brixton Stratton outboard motor as a continuous electronic beep sounds in the background.", "time_sec": 252.275, "generation_time_seconds": 250.1322, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1637, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 17.39, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "168", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of rushing water fills the room, as a  wooden shelf surrounded by books and a clock on the wall.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily pixelated, glitching abstract image with yellow and brown horizontal lines and black static, while the audio features the continuous gurgling and splashing of flowing water.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily pixelated, glitching abstract image with yellow and brown horizontal lines and black static, while the audio features the continuous gurgling and splashing of flowing water.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and pixelated image, where fragmented horizontal lines and blocks of color, primarily yellow and brown, are interspersed with black static, creating a glitching, abstract visual effect. Simultaneously, the audio captures the prominent, continuous sound of flowing water, such as from a stream or fountain, with subtle gurgling and splashing noises, suggesting a natural water source.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily pixelated, glitching abstract image with yellow and brown horizontal lines and black static, while the audio features the continuous gurgling and splashing of flowing water.}}\nThe video displays a heavily distorted and pixelated image, where fragmented horizontal lines and blocks of color, primarily yellow and brown, are interspersed with black static, creating a glitching, abstract visual effect. Simultaneously, the audio captures the prominent, continuous sound of flowing water, such as from a stream or fountain, with subtle gurgling and splashing noises, suggesting a natural water source.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily pixelated, glitching abstract image with yellow and brown horizontal lines and black static, while the audio features the continuous gurgling and splashing of flowing water.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video shows a heavily pixelated, glitching abstract image with yellow and brown horizontal lines and black static, while the audio features the continuous gurgling and splashing of flowing water.}}", "time_sec": 265.567, "generation_time_seconds": 263.8945, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1869, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.25, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "169", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The car engine idles before revving loudly, as a young woman with blue hair stands next to a man with a dog on his head.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting, pixelated collage of abstract, metallic, and grid-like patterns is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and then accelerating loudly.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting, pixelated collage of abstract, metallic, and grid-like patterns is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and then accelerating loudly.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene displays a rapidly shifting, pixelated collage of abstract, metallic, and grid-like patterns in monochrome and color, while the accompanying audio consists of a low-frequency engine hum followed by the loud, high-pitched roar of a vehicle accelerating away from the listener.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, pixelated collage of abstract metallic and grid-like patterns is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and then accelerating loudly.}}\nThe visual stream consists of a fragmented, mosaic-like composition of rectangular tiles. These tiles display abstract, monochromatic textures resembling metallic grilles, wires, and blurred industrial structures. Some tiles contain faint, moving elements such as yellow lines and red dots. The entire visual field is in constant, rapid flux, with the tiles shifting and reorganizing, creating a sense of chaotic motion without a discernible subject or scene. The audio track is dominated by a persistent low-frequency hum, consistent with an idling engine, which is abruptly replaced by the loud, high-pitched roar of a vehicle's engine and tires as it accelerates\nThe visual field is a dynamic, glitch-like mosaic of fragmented, rectangular tiles. These tiles display abstract patterns in monochrome and color, resembling metallic grilles, blurred grid structures, and wire-like textures, with some containing faint moving elements like yellow lines and red dots. The entire composition is in constant, rapid reorganization, creating a sense of chaotic, non-representational motion. The audio begins with a low-frequency engine hum, suggesting a stationary vehicle, which is then abruptly overtaken by the loud, high-pitched roar of a vehicle engine and tires as it accelerates away from the listener. The visuals do not depict a\n\nA rapidly shifting, pixelated collage of abstract, metallic, and grid-like patterns is accompanied by the sound of a vehicle engine starting and then accelerating loudly.", "time_sec": 238.107, "generation_time_seconds": 236.6069, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1411, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "170", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": " A man speaks over an intercom as a muffled helicopter engine roars, followed by gunshots firing in a video game displayed on a laptop screen.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video feed shows glitching text and static while a distorted voice reports enemy contact and gunfire.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video feed shows glitching text and static while a distorted voice reports enemy contact and gunfire.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays heavy digital corruption, with horizontal static lines, blocky pixelation, and scattered text fragments like \"C 3333\" and \"PULSE 12:49\". Simultaneously, the audio features a distorted male voice over a radio, reporting \"Enemy contact, west of your location,\" followed by the sound of rapid gunfire and the voice stating, \"Objective Alpha has just been neutralized.\"\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video feed shows glitching text and static while a distorted voice reports enemy contact and gunfire.}}\nThe visual and audio streams are independent sensory inputs. The video is a dense, dark, and fragmented digital artifact with no discernible real-world scene; its content is limited to corrupted blocks and glitching text. The audio, however, is a clear narrative of a military or tactical radio transmission, with a voice reporting an enemy contact and subsequent gunfire. The key detail is that the audio describes a specific event (\"Enemy contact... Objective Alpha has just been neutralized\"), which is not visually represented in any way. The final analysis must merge these two modalities without attempting to create a unified, coherent scene from the disjointed elements.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video feed shows glitching text and static while a distorted voice reports enemy contact and gunfire.}}", "time_sec": 229.518, "generation_time_seconds": 227.2811, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0426, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.45, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "171", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man wearing a blue glove washes dishes in a kitchen sink with running water as he talks to an elderly woman, accompanied by the sound of plastic clacks and water running down a drain.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual displays a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no discernible subject.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual displays a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no discernible subject.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio stream contains a male voice speaking and the sound of a toilet flushing. The visual stream displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and glitched image composed of horizontal bands of light and dark, lacking any discernible subject.\nThe audio features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual consists of a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no clear subject.\nThe audio stream features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual stream displays a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no clear subject.\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual displays a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no discernible subject.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The audio features a male voice speaking about \"spraying\" and \"going,\" followed by the sound of a toilet flushing, while the visual displays a heavily distorted, glitched image with horizontal bands of light and dark, showing no discernible subject.}}", "time_sec": 203.488, "generation_time_seconds": 201.2135, "selection_time_seconds": 0.223, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 4.17, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "172", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The microwave oven hums loudly as an adult male and a child chat, while a sudden beep interrupts the conversation, with a TV playing in the background.", "pred": "A dark, horizontally-barred video flickers over a light, vertically-lined surface, accompanied by a deep male voice speaking over persistent, mechanical rattling and cranking noises.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A dark, horizontally-barred video flickers over a light, vertically-lined surface, accompanied by a deep male voice speaking over persistent, mechanical rattling and cranking noises.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a series of rapidly flickering, dark, horizontal bars with intermittent glimpses of a light-colored, vertically-lined surface, while the audio features a deep male voice intermittently speaking over persistent, mechanical rattling and cranking noises.\n\\boxed{\\text{A dark, horizontally-barred video flickers over a light, vertically-lined surface, accompanied by a deep male voice speaking over persistent, mechanical rattling and cranking noises.}}\nThe visual content is a heavily distorted and fragmented video, composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bands of dark, light, and colored pixels. Intermittently, these bands resolve into brief, unclear glimpses of what appears to be a textured, light-colored surface with faint vertical lines. The audio consists of a low-fidelity recording of a male voice speaking in a deep, somewhat muffled tone, with the words \"cranking noises\" being discernible. This speech is layered over a continuous, rhythmic mechanical rattling and cranking sound. The combination of the fragmented visuals and the mechanical soundscape suggests a low-quality recording of a\n\nA dark, horizontally-barred video flickers over a light, vertically-lined surface, accompanied by a deep male voice speaking over persistent, mechanical rattling and cranking noises.", "time_sec": 215.838, "generation_time_seconds": 213.7976, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1158, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "173", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cordless drill with a battery in it is being used to work on something, creating vibrations and humming as it starts and stops several times.", "pred": "A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the repeated sound of a staple gun firing, while the visual consists of a rapidly changing, horizontally striped, abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks, creating a glitchy effect.\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern composed of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks, while the audio features the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.}}\nThe analysis is complete as the final answer has been provided.\n\nA rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly shifting, horizontally striped abstract pattern of orange, turquoise, black, and grey blocks is shown, accompanied by the repeated sound of a staple gun being fired.}}", "time_sec": 236.95, "generation_time_seconds": 235.0357, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1059, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.77, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "174", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a serene farm setting, a man's voice is heard speaking as goats and a cow make their sounds, while a little white lamb  stand near a wooden fence in the grass.", "pred": "A white lamb stands in a dirt pen near a wooden gate, while a deep growl and a high-pitched electronic tone are heard.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A white lamb stands in a dirt pen near a wooden gate, while a deep growl and a high-pitched electronic tone are heard.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video depicts a chaotic, glitchy visual effect composed of rapidly shifting and fragmented horizontal bands of color and texture, while the audio consists of a deep, guttural growl followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A glitching, fragmented video of shifting horizontal bands accompanies a deep growl and a high-pitched electronic tone.}}\nThe video shows a rapidly shifting, glitched mosaic of horizontal bands with textures resembling wire mesh, foliage, and abstract patterns against a light background. The audio features a deep, guttural growl, followed by a high-pitched, sustained electronic tone, and a low-frequency rumble.\n\\boxed{\\text{A rapidly glitching horizontal mosaic of textures accompanies a deep growl, high-pitched electronic tone, and low rumble.}}\n\nA white lamb stands in a dirt pen near a wooden gate, while a deep growl and a high-pitched electronic tone are heard.", "time_sec": 180.599, "generation_time_seconds": 178.0077, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1685, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 29.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "175", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a city parking lot, several fire trucks are parked next to a building as men speak in the distance while whistling and humming.", "pred": "A fragmented urban mosaic with buildings and a stadium is overlaid with the screech of train wheels on a metal track and the rumble of a moving vehicle.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A fragmented urban mosaic with buildings and a stadium is overlaid with the screech of train wheels on a metal track and the rumble of a moving vehicle.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is a fragmented, mosaic-like view of an urban environment, showing glimpses of high-rise buildings, trees, and a stadium or arena with red and white seating. Overlaid on this visual is the loud, high-pitched screech of metal wheels on a metal track, accompanied by the deep rumbling of a heavy vehicle, suggesting a train or subway car in motion.\n\\boxed{A fragmented urban mosaic with buildings and a stadium is overlaid with the screech of train wheels on a metal track and the rumble of a moving vehicle.}\nThe analysis proceeds with a focus on the physical evidence presented in both the visual and auditory streams. The visual component is a composite of numerous small, rectangular video tiles arranged in a grid, a common artifact of digital video corruption or a deliberate glitch art effect. These tiles collectively depict an outdoor, urban setting, identifiable by the presence of multi-story buildings, patches of green foliage, and, most distinctly, tiered seating with a repeating red and white pattern, characteristic of a sports stadium or arena. This visual information is independent of the auditory data. The audio stream is dominated by a single, continuous sound source: a loud, high-p\n\nA fragmented urban mosaic with buildings and a stadium is overlaid with the screech of train wheels on a metal track and the rumble of a moving vehicle.", "time_sec": 197.688, "generation_time_seconds": 195.4335, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2405, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "176", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring amidst audio static as a man stands under a wooden roof in the attic.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated and distorted visual of abstract shapes is paired with the deep, rhythmic tolling of a large bell.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated and distorted visual of abstract shapes is paired with the deep, rhythmic tolling of a large bell.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated image with horizontal lines of color, while the audio features the deep, resonant, and rhythmic tolling of a large bell.\n\\boxed{A pixelated, distorted video of an indistinct scene is accompanied by the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell.}\nThe visual information is highly degraded, showing only abstract, shifting blocks of color and horizontal lines, making it impossible to identify any specific objects or actions. The audio consists of the deep, resonant tolling of a large bell, which repeats at a slow, steady rhythm. As per the instructions, the description must be a single sentence combining objective sensory details without semantic smoothing or assumptions. The visual is a distorted, pixelated mosaic, and the auditory is a rhythmic, deep bell toll.\n\nA heavily pixelated and distorted visual of abstract shapes is paired with the deep, rhythmic tolling of a large bell.", "time_sec": 215.175, "generation_time_seconds": 213.5096, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1181, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "177", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cozy bedroom, a man talks while a person snores, and one man take a video.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital distortion shows shifting red and brown blocks; audio features a deep growl and a loud, rapid buzzing.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital distortion shows shifting red and brown blocks; audio features a deep growl and a loud, rapid buzzing.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual field is completely obscured by severe digital distortion, appearing as a mosaic of rapidly shifting, rectangular blocks in shades of red, orange, and brown. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a deep, guttural growl, followed by a high-pitched, rapid, and continuous buzzing sound. The two sensory inputs are unrelated and do not depict the same event.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital distortion shows shifting red and brown blocks; audio features a deep growl and a loud, rapid buzzing.}}\nThe visual field is completely obscured by severe digital distortion, appearing as a mosaic of rapidly shifting, rectangular blocks in shades of red, orange, and brown. Simultaneously, the audio consists of a deep, guttural growl, followed by a high-pitched, rapid, and continuous buzzing sound. The two sensory inputs are unrelated and do not depict the same event.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital distortion shows shifting red and brown blocks; audio features a deep growl and a loud, rapid buzzing.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Severe digital distortion shows shifting red and brown blocks; audio features a deep growl and a loud, rapid buzzing.}}", "time_sec": 187.442, "generation_time_seconds": 186.1613, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0938, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "178", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A red truck with its lights on driving down a dark street at dusk, accompanied by the wailing police sirens and the sound of heavy wind blowing into a microphone.", "pred": "\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks of light and dark, while a loud, fluctuating mechanical siren wails over a low rumble.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks of light and dark, while a loud, fluctuating mechanical siren wails over a low rumble.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is dominated by severe digital video corruption, with the frame horizontally split into multiple, rapidly shifting, and misaligned rectangular blocks of color and light, creating a fragmented and glitched visual effect. This is accompanied by the harsh, fluctuating, and high-pitched whine of a mechanical alarm, possibly from a siren or vehicle horn, layered over a background of low-frequency rumble and static.\n\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks of light and dark, while a loud, fluctuating mechanical siren wails over a low rumble.}\nThe scene is dominated by severe digital video corruption, with the frame horizontally split into multiple, rapidly shifting, and misaligned rectangular blocks of color and light, creating a fragmented and glitched visual effect. This is accompanied by the harsh, fluctuating, and high-pitched whine of a mechanical alarm, possibly from a siren or vehicle horn, layered over a background of low-frequency rumble and static.\n\n\\boxed{A heavily corrupted video displays fragmented, shifting rectangular blocks of light and dark, while a loud, fluctuating mechanical siren wails over a low rumble.}", "time_sec": 215.751, "generation_time_seconds": 214.1863, "selection_time_seconds": 0.224, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "179", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the bustling kitchen, a man grills hot dogs and chickens while women chat, accompanied by the distant hum of a motor.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, abstract video with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture is accompanied by a person speaking in a foreign language and a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, abstract video with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture is accompanied by a person speaking in a foreign language and a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily pixelated, abstract image with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture; simultaneously, the audio captures a person speaking in a foreign language while a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum or rumble is audible in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract video with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture is accompanied by a person speaking in a foreign language and a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.}}\nThe video displays a heavily pixelated, abstract image with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture; simultaneously, the audio captures a person speaking in a foreign language while a continuous, low-frequency mechanical hum or rumble is audible in the background.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily pixelated, abstract video with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture is accompanied by a person speaking in a foreign language and a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.}}\n\nA heavily pixelated, abstract video with horizontal bands of distorted color and texture is accompanied by a person speaking in a foreign language and a continuous low-frequency mechanical hum.", "time_sec": 193.239, "generation_time_seconds": 191.3232, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2325, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "180", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A toy helicopter flies over a green field with trees and mountains in the background, as muffled plastic clacking is heard.", "pred": "The video displays a rapidly transitioning, fragmented landscape, starting with a pale sky and then showing a patchwork of green fields and autumnal trees, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, similar to a chainsaw or power tool, which is then abruptly cut off by a series of short, sharp electronic beeps.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly transitioning, fragmented landscape, starting with a pale sky and then showing a patchwork of green fields and autumnal trees, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, similar to a chainsaw or power tool, which is then abruptly cut off by a series of short, sharp electronic beeps.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The video displays a rapidly transitioning, fragmented landscape, starting with a pale sky and then showing a patchwork of green fields and autumnal trees, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, similar to a chainsaw or power tool, which is then abruptly cut off by a series of short, sharp electronic beeps.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly transitioning, fragmented landscape, starting with a pale sky and then showing a patchwork of green fields and autumnal trees, while the audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, similar to a chainsaw or power tool, which is then abruptly cut off by a series of short, sharp electronic beeps.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly transitioning, fragmented landscape, starting with a pale sky and then showing a patchwork of green fields and autumnal trees. The audio features a loud, high-pitched mechanical whine, similar to a chainsaw or pow