 beeps.}}", "time_sec": 442.375, "generation_time_seconds": 440.0786, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1304, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "181", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In a cacophony of sounds, ducks quack and chirp while a rooster crows, as a crowd talks in the background, while a duck and a bird peer through the bars of their cages at the zoo.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A video severely corrupted by digital block artifacts displays scrambled, moving rectangular patterns, while the audio is filled with the high-pitched squeals of a pig and the indistinct grunting of other animals.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A video severely corrupted by digital block artifacts displays scrambled, moving rectangular patterns, while the audio is filled with the high-pitched squeals of a pig and the indistinct grunting of other animals.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video exhibits severe digital corruption, manifesting as a mosaic of scrambled, moving rectangular blocks that obscure any discernible scene or subject. This visual chaos is accompanied by a cacophony of animal sounds, dominated by the high-pitched, frantic squealing of a pig, layered over the indistinct, low-frequency grunts of other animals.\n\\boxed{\\text{A video severely corrupted by digital block artifacts displays scrambled, moving rectangular patterns, while the audio is filled with the high-pitched squeals of a pig and the indistinct grunting of other animals.}}\nThe audio consists of a cacophony of animal sounds, dominated by the high-pitched, frantic squealing of a single pig, layered over the indistinct, low-frequency grunting of other animals. This creates a chaotic and agitated soundscape. The video is completely abstract, showing only a severe digital corruption of moving, scrambled rectangular blocks, with no discernible objects or scene. The two modalities are entirely independent: the visual conveys technical failure, while the audio suggests a chaotic animal environment.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A video severely corrupted by digital block artifacts displays scrambled, moving rectangular patterns, while the audio is filled with the high-pitched squeals of a pig and the indistinct grunting of other animals.}}", "time_sec": 203.251, "generation_time_seconds": 201.7796, "selection_time_seconds": 0.04, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "182", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the immersive game world, thunder roars in the distance as rain lightly pours, while a man yells and another hums in a room captured.", "pred": "A pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green indicators, and red error symbols is overlaid with a Scottish male voice speaking over a constant low-frequency hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green indicators, and red error symbols is overlaid with a Scottish male voice speaking over a constant low-frequency hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted and pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green status indicators, and red error symbols, while the audio features a male voice speaking with a Scottish accent over a constant background hum.\n\\boxed{A pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green indicators, and red error symbols is overlaid with a Scottish male voice speaking over a constant low-frequency hum.}\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted and pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green status indicators, and red error symbols, while the audio features a male voice speaking with a Scottish accent over a constant background hum.\n\\boxed{A pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green indicators, and red error symbols is overlaid with a Scottish male voice speaking over a constant low-frequency hum.}\n\nA pixelated digital interface with fragmented text, green indicators, and red error symbols is overlaid with a Scottish male voice speaking over a constant low-frequency hum.", "time_sec": 172.72, "generation_time_seconds": 170.6965, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1418, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "183", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a crying baby sitting in a yellow high chair looks at the camera and makes a funny face, while in the background, a young woman talking.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitched abstract pattern of horizontal bars in orange, brown, and white is shown, accompanied by a child's crying and a male voice speaking in Mandarin.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitched abstract pattern of horizontal bars in orange, brown, and white is shown, accompanied by a child's crying and a male voice speaking in Mandarin.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and glitched abstract pattern of horizontal bars in orange, brown, black, and white. Concurrently, the audio captures a child's prolonged crying and whimpering, followed by a male voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese.\nThe visual is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and glitched abstract pattern of horizontal bars in orange, brown, black, and white, while the audio features a child crying and a male voice speaking in Mandarin.\nThe visual content is a sequence of horizontal bars displaying a distorted, glitched, and fragmented abstract pattern in shades of orange, brown, and white, while the audio captures a child's prolonged crying and a male voice speaking in Mandarin.\n\nA heavily distorted, glitched abstract pattern of horizontal bars in orange, brown, and white is shown, accompanied by a child's crying and a male voice speaking in Mandarin.", "time_sec": 134.31, "generation_time_seconds": 132.4421, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1341, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.88, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "184", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The man inside the building rings a bell, while the church's bell tower chimes in unison.", "pred": ":\nA fragmented, horizontally striped visual of a modern building is accompanied by the loud pealing of large bells that are abruptly cut off by a single, sustained high-pitched electronic tone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": ":\nA fragmented, horizontally striped visual of a modern building is accompanied by the loud pealing of large bells that are abruptly cut off by a single, sustained high-pitched electronic tone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual consists of a fragmented, distorted, and horizontally striped mosaic of what appears to be a modern building, with repeating blocks of light and dark grey tones, along with small patches of blue and gold. The audio features the loud, resonant pealing of multiple large bells, characteristic of a clock tower or cathedral, which continues until the very end when it is abruptly cut off by a single, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, striped visual of a modern building is accompanied by the loud pealing of large bells that abruptly stop and are replaced by a single, sustained high-pitched electronic tone.}}\nThe visual is a severely corrupted image, composed of numerous horizontal rectangular strips of varying shades of grey, black, and white, with small sections of blue and gold. These strips are arranged in a non-linear, layered fashion, creating a fragmented, shattered, or glitch-like effect that obscures any clear subject or background. The audio consists of two distinct, sequential sound events: first, the loud, complex, and resonant pealing of multiple large bells, suggesting a location like a clock tower or cathedral; second, this bell sound is abruptly cut off and replaced by a single, pure, and unwavering high-pitched electronic\n\n:\nA fragmented, horizontally striped visual of a modern building is accompanied by the loud pealing of large bells that are abruptly cut off by a single, sustained high-pitched electronic tone.", "time_sec": 205.72, "generation_time_seconds": 203.9667, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0383, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.9, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "185", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The train horn echoes as a train speeds by on the tracks near a building, with the railroad crossing signals ringing in the distance.", "pred": "A train horn blares over a low rumble as a heavily corrupted video shows railway tracks, trees, and buildings under a cloudy sky.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A train horn blares over a low rumble as a heavily corrupted video shows railway tracks, trees, and buildings under a cloudy sky.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains the sound of a train horn, which is a loud, multi-tonal blast. This sound is accompanied by a low-frequency rumble, consistent with the vibration of a heavy train moving on a track. These auditory cues strongly imply the visual presence of a train and its associated environment, such as tracks or a station. The video, however, displays a heavily corrupted image composed of many small, disjointed rectangular tiles. These tiles collectively depict a landscape that includes multiple sets of parallel railway tracks, green trees, and several buildings under a cloudy sky, with some tiles showing a close-up of a dark, textured surface resembling\nThe audio features the loud, multi-tonal blast of a train horn, accompanied by a low-frequency rumble consistent with a moving train, while the video displays a heavily corrupted image of a railway environment with multiple tracks, trees, buildings, and a close-up of a dark, textured surface.\nThe audio contains the sound of a train horn, which is a loud, multi-tonal blast. This sound is accompanied by a low-frequency rumble, consistent with the vibration of a heavy train moving on a track. These auditory cues strongly imply the visual presence of a train and its associated environment, such as tracks or a station. The video, however, displays a heavily corrupted image composed of many small, disjointed rectangular tiles. These tiles collectively depict a landscape that includes multiple sets of parallel railway tracks, green trees, and several buildings under a cloudy sky, with some tiles showing a close-up of a dark, textured surface resembling\n\nA train horn blares over a low rumble as a heavily corrupted video shows railway tracks, trees, and buildings under a cloudy sky.", "time_sec": 354.986, "generation_time_seconds": 352.567, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0499, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "186", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large red and white plane takes off from the runway at an airport, accompanied by the sound of wind rushing past.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A severe digital video artifact of shifting colored blocks is accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a large vehicle passing by.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A severe digital video artifact of shifting colored blocks is accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a large vehicle passing by.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe scene is incoherent and highly distorted, composed of fragmented, rapidly shifting horizontal and vertical bars in black, white, grey, red, and green, with no discernible objects, people, or coherent environment visible. Overlapping this visual static is the loud, roaring sound of a large vehicle, possibly a truck or bus, passing by at high speed. The audio and visual streams are completely disconnected, with the overwhelming engine noise being the only clear sensory input.\n\\boxed{\\text{A complex, fragmented visual glitch overlays a loud, roaring vehicle sound.}}\nThe visual is a severe digital artifact, not a real-world scene. It's composed of numerous rectangular blocks in black, white, grey, red, and green, arranged in a grid that rapidly shifts and changes, suggesting corrupted or poorly transmitted video data. Simultaneously, the audio is a loud, continuous, low-frequency roar with a Doppler effect, characteristic of a large, heavy vehicle like a truck or bus passing at high speed. The two modalities are unrelated; the visual is a technical failure, and the audio is an environmental recording. The final description must be a single, dense, factual sentence combining both.\nThe visual is a severe digital artifact, not a real-world scene. It's composed of numerous rectangular blocks in black, white, grey, red, and green, arranged in a grid that rapidly shifts and changes, suggesting corrupted or poorly transmitted video data. Simultaneously, the audio is a loud, continuous, low-frequency roar with a Doppler effect, characteristic of a large, heavy vehicle like a truck or bus passing at high speed. The two modalities are unrelated; the visual is a technical failure, and the audio is an environmental recording. The final description must be a single, dense, factual sentence combining both.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A severe digital video artifact of shifting colored blocks is accompanied by the loud, roaring sound of a large vehicle passing by.}}", "time_sec": 233.873, "generation_time_seconds": 230.8225, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2491, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 20.69, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "187", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man sits on a bench near a silver car with its engine running idle, while a logo is visible on the vehicle's side. and in background a man was speacking.", "pred": "A distorted, glitching close-up of a metallic, slatted surface is shown while a loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble plays, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A distorted, glitching close-up of a metallic, slatted surface is shown while a loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble plays, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble is heard, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.\nA distorted, glitching close-up of a metallic, slatted surface is shown while a loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble plays, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted, glitching close-up of a metallic, slatted surface is shown while a loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble plays, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.}}\n\nA distorted, glitching close-up of a metallic, slatted surface is shown while a loud, low-frequency mechanical engine rumble plays, accompanied by a male voice speaking indistinctly over the noise.", "time_sec": 175.375, "generation_time_seconds": 173.5953, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1623, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.41, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "188", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A young boy talks as a duck quacks, with water trickling and frogs croaking in the background, against a sunset with clouds and a fence silhouette.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, glitching video with fragmented orange, brown, and black blocks plays alongside a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous low-frequency electronic hum.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, glitching video with fragmented orange, brown, and black blocks plays alongside a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous low-frequency electronic hum.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image with fragmented horizontal and vertical blocks of color, primarily orange, brown, and black, while the audio features a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous, low-frequency electronic hum.\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image with fragmented horizontal and vertical blocks of color, primarily orange, brown, and black, while the audio features a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous, low-frequency electronic hum.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitching video with fragmented orange, brown, and black blocks plays alongside a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous low-frequency electronic hum.}}\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image with fragmented horizontal and vertical blocks of color, primarily orange, brown, and black, while the audio features a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous, low-frequency electronic hum.\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitching image with fragmented horizontal and vertical blocks of color, primarily orange, brown, and black, while the audio features a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous, low-frequency electronic hum.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, glitching video with fragmented orange, brown, and black blocks plays alongside a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous low-frequency electronic\n\nA heavily distorted, glitching video with fragmented orange, brown, and black blocks plays alongside a male voice speaking in Russian over a continuous low-frequency electronic hum.", "time_sec": 217.051, "generation_time_seconds": 214.1149, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1754, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "189", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cart with wheels is pushed through the room, creating a symphony of digital beeping, rapid vibrations, and humming on the hard wood floor.", "pred": "Severely corrupted video frames of indistinct textures accompany a sharp electronic buzzer and two powerful, deep mechanical engine revs.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "Severely corrupted video frames of indistinct textures accompany a sharp electronic buzzer and two powerful, deep mechanical engine revs.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visuals are heavily distorted and fragmented, displaying a collage of indistinct textures in neutral and dark tones, while the audio features a sharp electronic buzzer followed by two powerful, deep mechanical engine revs.\n\\boxed{Severely corrupted video frames of indistinct textures accompany a sharp electronic buzzer and two powerful, deep mechanical engine revs.}\nThe audio contains no speech or music; it exclusively features a sequence of mechanical and electronic sounds. The event begins with a short, high-pitched electronic chime, immediately followed by two distinct, powerful revs of a large engine, each with a deep, resonant roar and ending in a sharp crackle. The visual component is a heavily corrupted, pixelated, and mosaic-like image composed of horizontal and vertical bands of color and texture, lacking any discernible figures, objects, or motion. The overall impression is of a system malfunction or a digital glitch.\n\nSeverely corrupted video frames of indistinct textures accompany a sharp electronic buzzer and two powerful, deep mechanical engine revs.", "time_sec": 231.836, "generation_time_seconds": 228.2726, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2008, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "190", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The audio-visual caption would be: A black and white dog growling and barking while playing with a ball on the floor in front of a door.", "pred": "A heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily corrupted, blocky, and pixelated image with horizontal bands of distorted colors, while the audio features a dog barking and growling aggressively indoors.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.}}\nThe audio stream contains a sequence of low, guttural dog growls, followed by sharp, high-pitched barks. Between the barks, there are distinct sounds of heavy, rapid panting and the shuffling of paws on a hard floor, all within an acoustically reverberant indoor environment.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.}}\nA heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.\n\nA heavily corrupted video shows indistinct horizontal bands of color, accompanied by the aggressive barking and growling of a dog indoors.", "time_sec": 420.444, "generation_time_seconds": 418.3994, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0838, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 21.43, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "191", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A large black dog sleeping on a green couch with a black dog laying on a pillow, by loud nearby snoring.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{Severely compressed, fragmented green and brown video with horizontal lines accompanies heavy human snoring.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{Severely compressed, fragmented green and brown video with horizontal lines accompanies heavy human snoring.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital compression artifacts, creating a fragmented, distorted green and brown pattern. Simultaneously, the audio captures a person snoring repetitively and heavily.\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely compressed, fragmented green and brown video with horizontal lines accompanies heavy human snoring.}}\nThe audio presents a continuous, low-frequency, rhythmic snore, characterized by a deep, guttural quality and a regular, cyclical pattern of inhalation and exhalation. The sound is close and intimate, lacking any echo or reverb, suggesting the microphone is positioned directly beside the sleeper in a quiet, enclosed space. No other background noises, such as environmental sounds or other people, are audible, indicating a highly focused and isolated recording of the snoring event.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Severely compressed, fragmented green and brown video with horizontal lines accompanies heavy human snoring.}}", "time_sec": 147.249, "generation_time_seconds": 145.709, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0739, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 16.0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "192", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A pigeon perched on a wooden wall with something in its beak coos softly as bird wings flap, while a construction machine operates in the background.", "pred": ":\n\\boxed{Severely horizontally distorted video with fragmented colors and textures is accompanied by a continuous low hum, a sharp metallic clank, and a loud crashing sound.}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": ":\n\\boxed{Severely horizontally distorted video with fragmented colors and textures is accompanied by a continuous low hum, a sharp metallic clank, and a loud crashing sound.}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays severe horizontal digital distortion, rendering the scene unrecognizable, while the audio consists of a low-frequency hum, a sharp metallic clank, and a crashing sound.\nThe visual content is a sequence of heavily distorted, horizontal scan lines, where colors and textures are fragmented and shuffled, resulting in an abstract mosaic with no discernible objects or environment, while the audio features the continuous low hum of an engine or machinery, a sharp metallic clank, and a loud crashing sound.\nThe video shows severe horizontal digital corruption with fragmented, shifting bands of color and texture, while the audio captures a continuous low-frequency hum, a sharp metallic clank, and a loud crashing sound.\n\n:\n\\boxed{Severely horizontally distorted video with fragmented colors and textures is accompanied by a continuous low hum, a sharp metallic clank, and a loud crashing sound.}", "time_sec": 170.018, "generation_time_seconds": 167.7298, "selection_time_seconds": 0.3172, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "193", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man quietly paints a white vase on various surfaces while a sprayer sprays with low machine noise in the background.", "pred": "A man sprays a white vase inside a spray booth, accompanied by the sound of a power tool.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A man sprays a white vase inside a spray booth, accompanied by the sound of a power tool.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, pixelated mosaic of abstract and architectural forms, dominated by geometric shapes and textures in neutral tones, while the audio consists of a continuous, high-pressure hiss of steam or compressed air being released nearby.\n\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated, mosaic-like abstract sequence of architectural forms is accompanied by a loud, continuous hissing sound.}}\nThe audio is a single, sustained, high-pressure hissing sound, devoid of speech, music, or environmental cues like birds or traffic, strongly suggesting a malfunctioning valve, a pressurized system venting, or an industrial process. The video is a heavily distorted, fragmented, and pixelated abstract composition, where horizontal and vertical bands of color and texture rapidly shift, making specific objects or locations indiscernible. A direct causal link cannot be established from the audio alone, as the source of the hiss is not visually represented. The combination of the industrial sound and the glitchy visuals creates a disjointed sensory experience.\n\nA man sprays a white vase inside a spray booth, accompanied by the sound of a power tool.", "time_sec": 183.472, "generation_time_seconds": 181.3341, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2395, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 33.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "194", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A politician addressing a large crowd at an event, speaking into a microphone on stage.", "pred": "A corrupted, mosaic-like digital video displays fragmented, colorful blocks while a deep male voice speaks in Kannada.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A corrupted, mosaic-like digital video displays fragmented, colorful blocks while a deep male voice speaks in Kannada.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nA distorted, pixelated, and mosaic-like abstract image composed of small, colorful rectangular blocks, resembling a severely corrupted digital video feed, is displayed alongside a low-pitched, deep, and resonant male voice speaking in Kannada.\n\\boxed{\\text{A corrupted, mosaic-like digital video displays fragmented, colorful blocks while a deep male voice speaks in Kannada.}}\nThe audio consists of a low-pitched, deep male voice speaking in Kannada with a slow, deliberate cadence, suggesting a formal or ritualistic context. The video is a severe digital artifact, showing a grid of small, rectangular blocks with vibrant but chaotic colors (red, orange, blue, purple), indicating a corrupted or heavily processed video stream. The two modalities are unrelated, with the audio providing a clear, focused narrative and the video presenting only abstract, non-representational visual noise.\n\\boxed{\\text{A corrupted, mosaic-like digital video displays fragmented, colorful blocks while a deep male voice speaks in Kannada\n\nA corrupted, mosaic-like digital video displays fragmented, colorful blocks while a deep male voice speaks in Kannada.", "time_sec": 275.879, "generation_time_seconds": 272.9798, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0374, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "195", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As a silver train passes by a platform at the train station, the honk echoes through the air accompanied by loud gusts of wind.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched visual of a structure and foliage accompanies the loud, high-pitched whine of a passing high-speed train.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched visual of a structure and foliage accompanies the loud, high-pitched whine of a passing high-speed train.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a distorted, fragmented mosaic of what appears to be a concrete structure and green foliage. The audio is dominated by the loud, high-pitched whine of a high-speed train or roller coaster passing by.\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched visual of a structure and foliage accompanies the loud, high-pitched whine of a passing high-speed train.}}\nThe audio contains a single, dominant sound: the high-pitched, continuous whine of a high-speed train or roller coaster passing by at great velocity. The visual is a heavily distorted, glitched mosaic composed of shifting rectangular panels. These panels show fragmented views of a grey, geometric structure, possibly a bridge or building, and patches of green foliage. The images are incoherent and lack clear context due to the severe digital corruption. The two modalities present a stark contrast: a realistic, powerful locomotive sound paired with an abstract, artificial visual corruption.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A fragmented, glitched visual of a structure and foliage accompanies the loud, high-pitched whine of a passing high-speed train.}}", "time_sec": 193.931, "generation_time_seconds": 192.0351, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1685, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 15.38, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "196", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of frogs chirping fills the night as men speak and bang, while a man plays guitar next to a campfire.", "pred": "A male voice is heard just before a loud, high-pitched power tool begins operating in a reverberant space.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male voice is heard just before a loud, high-pitched power tool begins operating in a reverberant space.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe provided image is a dark, low-resolution frame with visible horizontal scan lines and digital artifacts, suggesting significant video degradation or intentional glitch effects, but no discernible subjects, objects, or environmental elements can be identified from the visual information alone.\nThe audio consists of a male voice speaking, immediately followed by the loud, high-pitched, and continuous whirring of a power tool, likely an angle grinder or similar device, operating in a reverberant, enclosed space.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice is heard just before a loud, high-pitched power tool begins operating in a reverberant space.}}\nThe provided image is a dark, low-resolution frame with visible horizontal scan lines and digital artifacts, suggesting significant video degradation or intentional glitch effects, but no discernible subjects, objects, or environmental elements can be identified from the visual information alone.\nThe audio consists of a male voice speaking, immediately followed by the loud, high-pitched, and continuous whirring of a power tool, likely an angle grinder or similar device, operating in a reverberant, enclosed space.\n\\boxed{\\text{A male voice is heard just before a loud, high-pitched power tool begins operating in a reverberant space.}}\n\nA male voice is heard just before a loud, high-pitched power tool begins operating in a reverberant space.", "time_sec": 171.739, "generation_time_seconds": 168.9478, "selection_time_seconds": 0.1608, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "197", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "As the mid-size motor vehicle engine accelerates with a slight rattling sound, a driver wearing a helmet shifts gears downward inside the cockpit of the car.", "pred": "A heavily pixelated, abstract visual of dark and light green shapes accompanied by the loud, sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily pixelated, abstract visual of dark and light green shapes accompanied by the loud, sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual stream is a heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of dark and light green, grey, and blue shapes, with no discernible objects or actions. This is accompanied by the loud, high-pitched, and sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start and run.\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, abstract visual of dark and light green shapes accompanied by the loud, sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start.}\nThe visual stream is a heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of dark and light green, grey, and blue shapes, with no discernible objects or actions. This is accompanied by the loud, high-pitched, and sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start and run.\n\\boxed{A heavily pixelated, abstract visual of dark and light green shapes accompanied by the loud, sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start.}\n\nA heavily pixelated, abstract visual of dark and light green shapes accompanied by the loud, sputtering sound of a small engine struggling to start.", "time_sec": 202.594, "generation_time_seconds": 200.2484, "selection_time_seconds": 0.2878, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.12, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "198", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A blue and yellow train passes by on the tracks with loud hissing, a continuous horn, and brief clanking, traveling through the snowy landscape.", "pred": "A rapidly glitching montage of fragmented urban architecture and text overlays is accompanied by a deep, ominous, low-frequency electronic drone.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapidly glitching montage of fragmented urban architecture and text overlays is accompanied by a deep, ominous, low-frequency electronic drone.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, glitchy montage of architectural structures, including tall buildings and a circular facade, interspersed with text fragments like \"GRANT\" and \"STRAIGHT,\" all rendered in a fragmented, pixelated style. Simultaneously, the audio features a deep, sustained, low-frequency electronic tone with a slow, ominous pulsation, creating a tense and suspenseful atmosphere. The visual and auditory elements are entirely distinct, with no directly corresponding sounds to the visual events, as the audio is a non-diegetic, ambient sound design element. The overall sensory impression is one of a digital, abstract,\nA rapidly glitching montage of fragmented urban architecture and text overlays is accompanied by a deep, ominous, low-frequency electronic drone.\nThe final answer is: \\boxed{\\text{A rapidly glitching montage of fragmented urban architecture and text overlays is accompanied by a deep, ominous, low-frequency electronic drone.}}\n\nA rapidly glitching montage of fragmented urban architecture and text overlays is accompanied by a deep, ominous, low-frequency electronic drone.", "time_sec": 218.224, "generation_time_seconds": 216.1958, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0984, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "199", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of an idle car engine running in a garage as wind blows into a microphone, while a man stands next to a black car.", "pred": "A rapid sequence of abstract, horizontally striped, and fragmented visual glitches is accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A rapid sequence of abstract, horizontally striped, and fragmented visual glitches is accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, abstract mosaic of distorted and fragmented images, while the audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, and continuous mechanical whirring sound.\nThe video shows a fast-moving, abstract sequence of horizontal strips with distorted and fragmented visual information, while the audio features a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.\nThe visual stream is a glitch-art effect with horizontal bands of distorted, fragmented imagery, while the audio is a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.\n\nA rapid sequence of abstract, horizontally striped, and fragmented visual glitches is accompanied by a loud, continuous, high-pitched mechanical whirring sound.", "time_sec": 167.282, "generation_time_seconds": 165.9638, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0308, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 6.67, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "200", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The vehicle engine revs loudly as the camera shows the car's engine compartment with the hood up, revealing a cluttered engine bay.", "pred": "A static, abstract composition of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal is paired with the loud, layered mechanical sounds of a powerful engine and a high-pitched whine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A static, abstract composition of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal is paired with the loud, layered mechanical sounds of a powerful engine and a high-pitched whine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, glitched, and pixelated abstract image composed of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal, while the audio consists of a loud, deep, rumbling engine sound with a high-pitched whine.\nThe visual is a non-representational digital glitch effect with no discernible objects or environment, while the audio is the powerful, layered sound of a large engine, possibly a jet or heavy vehicle, combined with a high-frequency mechanical whine.\nA static, abstract composition of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal is paired with the loud, layered mechanical sounds of a powerful engine and a high-pitched whine.\n\\boxed{\\text{A static, abstract composition of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal is paired with the loud, layered mechanical sounds of a powerful engine and a high-pitched whine.}}\n\nA static, abstract composition of fragmented horizontal and vertical bands in red, black, white, and teal is paired with the loud, layered mechanical sounds of a powerful engine and a high-pitched whine.", "time_sec": 221.719, "generation_time_seconds": 219.9635, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0624, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.71, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "201", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman's voice guides as she and a man work together on a sewing machine, stitching fabric with precision.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated, abstract pattern of shifting horizontal stripes in brown, orange, and black is accompanied by a person explaining a machine's function and a loud, rhythmic mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated, abstract pattern of shifting horizontal stripes in brown, orange, and black is accompanied by a person explaining a machine's function and a loud, rhythmic mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a heavily distorted, pixelated, and horizontally striped abstract pattern of shifting geometric shapes in dark brown, orange, and black, with brief flashes of blue and white, while the audio features a person explaining a machine's function, accompanied by a loud, rhythmic mechanical buzzing sound.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated, abstract pattern of shifting horizontal stripes in brown, orange, and black is accompanied by a person explaining a machine's function and a loud, rhythmic mechanical buzzing sound.}}\nThe video displays a highly abstract and distorted visual composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bands and blocks of color, primarily in shades of brown, orange, and black. This visual is heavily fragmented, appearing as if it is being torn apart or glitched. Concurrently, the audio captures a male voice explaining a process involving an \"overlock stitch\" and \"cutting off excess fabric.\" This explanation is immediately followed by the loud, rhythmic, mechanical buzzing of a sewing machine operating at high speed. The juxtaposition of the chaotic visual and the functional audio creates a sense of technical process viewed through a corrupted lens.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated, abstract pattern of shifting horizontal stripes in brown, orange, and black is accompanied by a person explaining a machine's function and a loud, rhythmic mechanical buzzing sound.}}", "time_sec": 218.5, "generation_time_seconds": 216.8271, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0384, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "202", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man energetically shouting in a lush green rice field as ducks quack and chirp around him, with the wind adding to the lively atmosphere.", "pred": "A static, pixelated green field with horizontal distortion bands is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched electronic siren.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A static, pixelated green field with horizontal distortion bands is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched electronic siren.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a static, pixelated, low-resolution image of a green landscape with horizontal bands of distorted textures and colors. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, sustained electronic tone, possibly a siren or alarm.\nA static, pixelated green field with horizontal distortion bands is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched electronic siren.\n\\boxed{\\text{A static, pixelated green field with horizontal distortion bands is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched electronic siren.}}\nThe video displays a highly pixelated and fragmented image of a grassy outdoor environment, characterized by distinct horizontal bands of distorted textures, including green grass, brown soil, and wooden objects. Simultaneously, the audio features a loud, sustained, high-pitched electronic tone, resembling a siren or alarm, with no other discernible sounds. The visual and auditory elements are independent and do not correspond to a real-world event. The final answer must be a single, concise sentence under 30 words that objectively combines these observations.\n\nA static, pixelated green field with horizontal distortion bands is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched electronic siren.", "time_sec": 185.507, "generation_time_seconds": 183.8607, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0376, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 14.29, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "203", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A yellow fire truck accelerates down a highway with emergency sirens blaring, passing by a crowd of people as a man speaks on an intercom.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract patterns and colors, while the audio features a loud, oscillating siren followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract patterns and colors, while the audio features a loud, oscillating siren followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract patterns and colors, including green foliage, yellow and red geometric shapes, and industrial textures, all in constant motion. Simultaneously, a loud, high-pitched, oscillating siren wails, suggesting an emergency vehicle, followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.\nThe video shows a constantly shifting, abstract mosaic of fragmented patterns and colors, while the audio features a loud, oscillating siren followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.\nThe visual is a highly distorted, fragmented, and rapidly shifting mosaic of abstract patterns, colors, and textures, including green foliage, horizontal bands, and geometric shapes, with no discernible coherent scene. The audio consists of a loud, oscillating electronic siren, followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract patterns and colors, while the audio features a loud, oscillating siren followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The video displays a rapidly shifting, fragmented mosaic of abstract patterns and colors, while the audio features a loud, oscillating siren followed by the deep rumble of a large engine.}}", "time_sec": 168.963, "generation_time_seconds": 166.6664, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0348, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "204", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a green hat holds a glass in his hands while speaking, with small birds chirping in the distance and his backside one car.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated outdoor mosaic with wooden textures and foliage is paired with a man's voice stating his taped glasses impair his vision, followed by rustling and a dog's bark.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated outdoor mosaic with wooden textures and foliage is paired with a man's voice stating his taped glasses impair his vision, followed by rustling and a dog's bark.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual is a digital mosaic of fragmented outdoor scenes, including wooden structures and foliage, while the audio captures a man stating his glasses are taped, followed by rustling and a dog barking.\nThe image is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic composed of numerous rectangular fragments depicting various outdoor scenes including wooden textures, foliage, and what appears to be a paved ground, all overlaid with digital static and horizontal scan lines, while the accompanying audio features a male voice stating he cannot see because his glasses are taped, followed by rustling and a dog barking.\nThe visual is a heavily corrupted, pixelated mosaic composed of numerous rectangular fragments depicting various outdoor scenes including wooden textures, foliage, and what appears to be a paved ground, all overlaid with digital static and horizontal scan lines, while the accompanying audio features a male voice stating he cannot see because his glasses are taped, followed by rustling and a dog barking.\n\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated outdoor mosaic with wooden textures and foliage is paired with a man's voice stating his taped glasses impair his vision, followed by rustling and a dog's bark.}}\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A pixelated outdoor mosaic with wooden textures and foliage is paired with a man's voice stating his taped glasses impair his vision, followed by rustling and a dog's bark.}}", "time_sec": 167.761, "generation_time_seconds": 165.8899, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0414, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 10.81, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "205", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the video, a helicopter with a flag flies in the sky as a man talks in the background it show on a television nwes.", "pred": "A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.\n\\boxed{\\text{A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.\n\\boxed{\\text{A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a loud, high-pitched, and abrasive mechanical whine, characteristic of a high-RPM tool or engine, with a distinct grinding quality that suggests friction or cutting. This sound is continuous and intense, peaking in loudness. Concurrently, the visual data is severely degraded, displaying multiple horizontal bars of corrupted video, with some segments showing fragmented text like \"THE TIME\" and \"FIRST IT\" in red and white, and others showing abstract patterns of black, green, and red pixels. The combination of a powerful mechanical sound and a glitched, non-realistic visual feed indicates a recording of a malfunctioning\nA high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.\n\\boxed{\\text{A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.}}\nThe audio features a loud, high-pitched, and abrasive mechanical whine, characteristic of a high-RPM tool or engine, with a distinct grinding quality that suggests friction or cutting. This sound is continuous and intense, peaking in loudness. Concurrently, the visual data is severely degraded, displaying multiple horizontal bars of corrupted video, with some segments showing fragmented text like \"THE TIME\" and \"FIRST IT\" in red and white, and others showing abstract patterns of black, green, and red pixels. The combination of a powerful mechanical sound and a glitched, non-realistic visual feed indicates a recording of a malfunctioning\n\nA high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.\n\\boxed{\\text{A high-RPM mechanical whine and grinding sound accompany severe horizontal video static and corrupted text fragments.}}", "time_sec": 180.179, "generation_time_seconds": 178.4183, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0356, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.26, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "206", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A woman cuts fabric with red scissors and a iron scale on a sewing machine while vibrations from the machine are heard with a woman speaking.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual content is severely degraded, presenting as a mosaic of rapidly shifting, fragmented, and blurred rectangular blocks in warm, earthy colors, with no coherent scene or object discernible. The audio simultaneously features a loud, continuous, low-frequency mechanical rumbling, followed by the distinct sound of a mechanical door or gate closing, and finally a male voice speaking in Spanish.\nA heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.\nThe visual information is a non-representational, abstract data glitch composed of rapidly changing, fragmented, and blurred rectangular tiles in a palette of browns, oranges, and beiges. The audio is a mechanical sequence: a continuous, heavy rumbling sound, the distinct clank of a large metal door or gate shutting, and a male voice speaking in Spanish (\"okay. Veamos. ¿Te queda? ¿Tú qué?\").\n\nA heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.\n\\boxed{\\text{A heavily distorted, pixelated mosaic of abstract, warm-toned blocks is accompanied by the loud rumbling of machinery, a mechanical door slamming shut, and a man speaking in Spanish.}}", "time_sec": 208.884, "generation_time_seconds": 207.4671, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0351, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 3.85, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "207", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a woman speaking, a dog growls and barks, as a person holds a piece of paper next to an envelope, with a set of cards featuring a pattern and a card displaying a picture of a dog.", "pred": "\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio features a male speaker discussing a project involving \"three panels\" and \"snail adhesive\" while a dog barks and growls in the background.\nThe visual content shows a rapidly changing, abstract collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white, creating a glitch-art effect.\nThe audio features a male speaker discussing a project involving \"three panels\" and \"snail adhesive\" while a dog barks and growls in the background.\nThe speaker's explanation is briefly interrupted by the sound of a dog barking and growling.\nThe final sound is a loud electronic buzzer or horn.\nAn objective description must integrate the visual and auditory information without assuming a narrative link between them.\nA male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.\n\nA male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{A male speaker discusses attaching panels with adhesive as a dog barks and growls, concluding with a loud electronic buzzer, over a rapidly shifting, glitch-art style collage of horizontal and vertical rectangular segments in teal, brown, black, and white.}}", "time_sec": 216.25, "generation_time_seconds": 214.3811, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0351, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 12.5, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "208", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman in the foreground speaks as bacon sizzles in a bowl of water on the stove, accompanied by the thumping of chicken leg piece.", "pred": "A glitched video of horizontal bands with abstract patterns is paired with audio of a man saying \"adding our drumsticks\" over sizzling sounds and a final musical chord.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A glitched video of horizontal bands with abstract patterns is paired with audio of a man saying \"adding our drumsticks\" over sizzling sounds and a final musical chord.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video is a highly distorted, fragmented, and glitched visual collage composed of rapidly shifting horizontal bands of abstract shapes, patterns, and colors, while the audio consists of a male voice saying \"adding our drumsticks\" followed by the sound of sizzling food and a musical chord.\nThe video displays severe digital corruption, manifesting as a mosaic of rapidly shifting, warped horizontal bands with abstract, indistinct patterns and textures in various colors, while the audio features a male voice stating \"adding our drumsticks\" over prominent sizzling sounds and a concluding musical chord.\nA glitched video of horizontal bands with abstract patterns is paired with audio of a man saying \"adding our drumsticks\" over sizzling sounds and a final musical chord.\n\nA glitched video of horizontal bands with abstract patterns is paired with audio of a man saying \"adding our drumsticks\" over sizzling sounds and a final musical chord.", "time_sec": 175.875, "generation_time_seconds": 174.2204, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0328, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "209", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A child and a man share a laugh while a frog gurgles, as a man speaks, with visuals of a person holding a small frog in their hand next to a dog and in grass one small cycle is there.", "pred": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented green and brown blocks while a male voice reacts to a loud, high-pitched squeal and an animal's low, guttural growl.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A severely corrupted video displays fragmented green and brown blocks while a male voice reacts to a loud, high-pitched squeal and an animal's low, guttural growl.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe visual quality is extremely degraded, showing severe horizontal digital corruption with fragmented, moving green and brownish blocks against a black background, resembling a corrupted video stream. Over this, a male voice speaks, then a loud, high-pitched squealing sound occurs, followed by the voice saying \"buddy, no,\" and finally, a continuous, low, guttural growl is heard.\n\\boxed{\\text{A severely corrupted video displays fragmented green and brown blocks while a male voice reacts to a loud, high-pitched squeal and an animal's low, guttural growl.}}\nThe visual stream is defined by persistent, horizontal digital corruption, presenting as a mosaic of small, fragmented rectangular blocks of green and brown against a solid black background. This corruption suggests a video file error, not a real-world scene with dynamic elements. The audio consists of distinct, sequential events: a male voice asks, \"Is it toxic?\", followed by a loud, high-pitched, and abrasive squeal, then the same voice shouts \"Buddy, no!\" in a panicked tone, and finally, a deep, continuous, low-pitched growl is audible. There are no other discernible background sounds or environmental cues in the\n\nA severely corrupted video displays fragmented green and brown blocks while a male voice reacts to a loud, high-pitched squeal and an animal's low, guttural growl.", "time_sec": 253.796, "generation_time_seconds": 251.7829, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0381, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "210", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of clanking plastic and a car engine revving, holding a white paper and a purple wire.", "pred": ":\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted video of horizontal bands of light and shadow accompanies a man speaking, a snapping sound, and a low electronic buzz.}}", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": ":\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted video of horizontal bands of light and shadow accompanies a man speaking, a snapping sound, and a low electronic buzz.}}", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video frame is a heavily distorted, abstract composition showing horizontal bands of fragmented, high-contrast shapes in black, white, and orange. The audio consists of a male voice speaking, followed by the sound of a plastic object being handled, a sharp snap, and a low-frequency electronic buzz.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted video of horizontal bands of light and shadow accompanies a man speaking, a snapping sound, and a low electronic buzz.}}\nThe video frame is a heavily distorted, abstract composition showing horizontal bands of fragmented, high-contrast shapes in black, white, and orange. The audio consists of a male voice speaking, followed by the sound of a plastic object being handled, a sharp snap, and a low-frequency electronic buzz.\n\n:\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted video of horizontal bands of light and shadow accompanies a man speaking, a snapping sound, and a low electronic buzz.}}", "time_sec": 147.439, "generation_time_seconds": 145.8279, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0391, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "211", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The woman on the couch is seen blowing her nose into a napkin while repeatedly sneezing and coughing.", "pred": "A woman wrapped in a blanket holds a thermometer and blows her nose, while the audio captures a person coughing.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A woman wrapped in a blanket holds a thermometer and blows her nose, while the audio captures a person coughing.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe audio contains a sequence of human coughs. The visual is heavily corrupted with horizontal banding and pixelation, showing indistinct vertical elements that could be people or objects in a disorganized, fragmented arrangement.\n\\boxed{Audio contains human coughing; visual is a heavily corrupted, pixelated image with indistinct vertical forms.}\nThe audio contains a sequence of human coughs. The visual is heavily corrupted with horizontal banding and pixelation, showing indistinct vertical elements that could be people or objects in a disorganized, fragmented arrangement.\n\\boxed{Audio contains human coughing; visual is a heavily corrupted, pixelated image with indistinct vertical forms.}\n\nA woman wrapped in a blanket holds a thermometer and blows her nose, while the audio captures a person coughing.", "time_sec": 264.291, "generation_time_seconds": 262.8023, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0972, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.78, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "212", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The sound of whooshing and humming fills the air as a man speaks, accompanied by distant squeaks, while young men play basketball on the court, with a logo-adorned speaker nearby.", "pred": "A heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced urban scene plays alongside a continuous low hum and a sudden, loud, unintelligible distorted male voice.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced urban scene plays alongside a continuous low hum and a sudden, loud, unintelligible distorted male voice.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video displays a heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced, and pixelated visual of an urban environment, with indistinct architectural and possibly vehicular shapes, while the audio features a continuous low-frequency hum abruptly punctuated by a loud, heavily distorted, and unintelligible male voice.\n\\boxed{A heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced urban scene plays alongside a continuous low hum and a sudden, loud, unintelligible distorted male voice.}\nThe visual is characterized by severe digital corruption, manifesting as horizontal bands of scrambled pixels and fragmented, overlapping images. This suggests a deliberate glitch-art effect or a corrupted video file. Amidst these distortions, one can discern architectural elements like windows, columns, and a possible roofline, as well as what might be a vehicle. The color palette is muted, dominated by greys, browns, and dark blues. The audio consists of a deep, resonant, and continuous low-frequency hum or drone that persists throughout. This drone is abruptly interrupted by a loud, heavily distorted, low-pitched male voice that speaks in a\n\nA heavily distorted, horizontally-sliced urban scene plays alongside a continuous low hum and a sudden, loud, unintelligible distorted male voice.", "time_sec": 260.577, "generation_time_seconds": 258.8196, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0498, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "213", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "A man in a hat cooks food on a grill outside, accompanied by the sizzle of frying food and music as he speaks.", "pred": "A distorted male voice sample and electronic music play over a completely black screen.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "A distorted male voice sample and electronic music play over a completely black screen.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video frame is completely black, showing no visible imagery or objects. Concurrently, the audio presents a layered soundscape consisting of an electronic music track with a prominent beat, a high-pitched, repetitive synth melody, and a distorted male voice sample with artificial reverb.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted male voice sample and electronic music play over a completely black screen.}}\nThe visual content is a completely black frame with no discernible objects, scenes, or actions. The audio consists of three distinct and simultaneous layers: a rhythmic, bass-heavy electronic beat, a high-pitched repetitive melodic synth line, and a heavily processed male voice sample with noticeable reverb, delivering fragmented, unintelligible phrases.\n\\boxed{\\text{A distorted male voice sample and electronic music play over a completely black screen.}}\n\nA distorted male voice sample and electronic music play over a completely black screen.", "time_sec": 172.175, "generation_time_seconds": 170.1632, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0383, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 8.33, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
{"id": "214", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "In the midst of a dark night lighting with rain falling outside .", "pred": "The visual is a solid black screen, while the audio is a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_pd", "raw_output": "The visual is a solid black screen, while the audio is a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video is a static, solid black screen, providing no visual information. The audio consists of a loud, high-pitched, and continuous whining sound, possibly from a high-speed machine or a power tool.\n\\boxed{\\text{A solid black screen is accompanied by a loud, high-pitched, continuous whining sound.}}\nThe visual component is a completely black screen for the entire duration, indicating no discernible image, object, or action is being displayed. The accompanying audio is a single, continuous, high-frequency mechanical whine, lacking any speech, music, or ambient sounds.\n\\boxed{\\text{The visual is a solid black screen, while the audio is a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine.}}\n\nThe visual is a solid black screen, while the audio is a continuous, high-pitched mechanical whine.", "time_sec": 161.548, "generation_time_seconds": 160.448, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0345, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 0, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
